  <para style="h">Isaayyaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabiiʼiyyii Isaayyaas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaayyaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabiiʼiyyii</para>
  <para style="mt1">Isaayyaas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Mulʼata Isaayyaas ilmi Amoos bara bulchiinsa Uziyaan, bara Yootaam, bara Aahaazii fi bara Hisqiyaas keessa waaʼee Yihuudaatii fi Yerusaalem arge.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Saba Fincilaa Tokko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Yaa Shamaayʼuniiwwan dhagaʼaa! Yaa lafa dhaggeeffadhu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhee dubbateeraatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“Ani ijoollee horadheen guddifadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">isaan garuu natti fincilaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Qotiyyoon gooftaa isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">harreenis gola gooftaa isaa ni beeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Israaʼel garuu hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">sabni koo hin hubatu.”<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Yaa saba cubbamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">uummata balleessaan itti baayʼate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">ilmaan warra waan hamaa hojjetuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">ijoollee xuraaʼummaadhaan guutamte isiniif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Isaan Rabbii Allaah dhiisaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Qulqullicha Israaʼel sana tuffatanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">dugda isaanii itti garagalfataniiru.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Isin siʼachi maaliif rukutamtu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Maaliif fincila keessa jiraatu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Mataan keessan guutuun miidhameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">garaan keessan guutuunis dadhabeera.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Faana miilla keessaniitii hamma gubbee mataa keessaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">fayyaa hin qabdan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">madaa fi dirmammuun, madaan dhiigu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">kan hin qulqulloofne yookaan hin maramne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">yookaan zayitiidhaan hin laafne.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Biyyi keessan duwwaa hafteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">magaalaawwan keessan ibiddaan gubamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">alagoonni fuuluma keessan duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">lafa qotiisaa keessan saamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">akkuma waan ormi ishee saameettis onti.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Intalli Xiyoon akkuma daʼannoo iddoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">dhaabaa wayinii keessaatti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">akkuma daasii lafa qotiisa buqqee keessaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">akkuma magaalaa marfame tokkootti dhiifamti.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Utuu Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">hambaa muraasa nuuf hambisuu baatee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">nu silaa akkuma Sodoom taanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">Gomoraas fakkaanna turre.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Yaa bulchitoota Sodoom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">dubbii Rabbii Allaah dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">yaa saba Gomoraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">Seera Allaah keenyaa dhaggeeffadhaa!<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">“Baayʼinni aarsaa keessanii anaaf maali?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">Ani aarsaa gubamu kan korbeeyyii hoolaatii fi <optbreak /> horii gabbifamanii baayʼeen qaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">ani dhiiga korommii looniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">kan xobbaallaawwan hoolaattii fi reʼeetti hin gammadu.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Isin yommuu fuula koo duratti mulʼachuuf dhuftan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">akka oobdii koo dhidhiittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">eenyutu isin irraa barbaade?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Kennaa faayidaa hin qabne fiduu dhiisaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">Ixaanni keessan na jibbisiisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Ayyaana Baatii, Sanbataa fi yaaʼii keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">jechuunis wal gaʼii keessan hamaa sana ani hin fedhu.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Ayyaana Baatii keessanii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">ayyaanota keessan bebbeekamoo lubbuun koo ni jibbiti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">Isaan baʼaa natti taʼaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">anis obsuu dadhabeera.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Yeroo isin duʼaa godhachuuf harka keessan balʼifattan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">ani ija koo isinan dhokfadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">yoo isin duʼaa baayʼee godhattan illee ani hin dhaggeeffadhu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 1:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Harki keessan dhiigaan guutameera!<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Dhiqadhaatii of qulqulleessaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">Hojii keessan hamaa sana fuula koo duraa balleessaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">Yakka hojjechuus dhiisaa;<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />waan qajeelaa hojjechuu baradhaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">Murtii qajeelaa barbaadaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">warra hacuucame jajjabeessaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">Ijoollee abbaa hin qabneef falmaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">haadha hiyyeessaatiif dhaabadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">“Kottaa wal qorraa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">cubbuun keessan yoo akka bildiimaa taʼe iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">inni addaatee akka cabbii ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">yoo akka alalaa diimate iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">akka suufii ni addaata.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Isin yoo fedhii qabaattanii ajajamtan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:19">waan lafti baaftu filatamaa ni nyaattu;<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />garuu yoo diddanii finciltan goraadeetu isin nyaata.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">Afaan Rabbii Allaah waan kana dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Akka magaalaan amanamtuun sun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">sagaagaltuu taate ilaalaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Isheen dur murtii qajeelaadhaan guutamtee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">qajeelummaan ishee keessa jiraata ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">amma immoo namoota nama ajjeesantu ishee keessa jiraata!<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Meetiin kee ligidaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">daadhiin wayinii kee filatamaan bishaaniin makameera.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Bulchitoonni kee finciltoota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">michuu hattuuwwanii ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">isaan hundinuu mattaʼaa jaallatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">kennaas akka malee barbaadu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Isaan ijoollee abbaa hin qabneef hin falman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">himata haadha hiyyeessaa hin dhaggeeffatan.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Jabaan Israaʼel sun akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">“Ani amajaajota koo irraa boqonnaa nan argadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">diinota koos haaloo nan baafadha.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Ani harka koo sitti nan deebisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ligidaaʼummaa kees akka malutti sirraa nan haqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">xurii kee hundas sirraa nan balleessa.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Ani akkuma bara durii abbootii murtii iddootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">akkuma jalqabaatti gorsitoota kee illee siifin deebisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Ergasii ati magaalaa qajeelummaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">magaalaa amanamtuu jedhamtee ni waamamta.”<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Xiyoon murtii qajeelaadhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">qalbii jijjiirrattoonni ishee immoo qajeelummaadhaan furamu.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Finciltoonnii fi cubbamoonni garuu ni caccabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">warri Rabbii Allaah dhiisanis ni badu.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />“Isin sababii muka qilxuu itti gammaddan sanaatiif ni qaanoftu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">sababii iddoo biqiltuu filattan sanaatiif immoo ni salphattu.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Isin akka qilxuu baalli irraa harcaʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">akka iddoo biqiltuu bishaan hin qabnee ni taatu.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Namni jabaan akkuma huubaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">hojiin isaas akkuma qaanqee taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">isaan lachuu walumaan gubatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">namni ibidda sana dhaamsus hin jiru.”<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tulluu Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 2:1-4">2:1‑4</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mik 4:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Wanni Isaayyaas ilmi Amoos waaʼee Yihuudaatii fi Yerusaalem arge kanaa dha:<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Bara dhumaa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">tulluun mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">tulluuwwan hunda keessaa ol dheeratee dhaabata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">inni tulluuwwan caalaa ol ol jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">saboonni hundinuu gara isaatti yaaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Namoonni baayʼeen dhufanii akkana jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">“Kottaa gara tulluu Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">gara mana Allaah Yaaʼikuub ol baanaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Inni akka nu daandii isaa irra deemnuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">karaa isaa nu barsiisa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Seerri Xiyoon keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">dubbiin Rabbii Allaah immoo <optbreak /> Yerusaalem keessaa ni baʼa.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Inni saboota gidduutti murtii kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">namoota hedduudhaafis ni murteessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Isaan goraadee isaanii tumanii maarashaa tolfatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">eeboo isaaniis tumanii haamtuu tolfatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Sabni tokko saba biraatti goraadee hin luqqifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">yookaan lolaaf nama hin leenjifatan.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Yaa mana Yaaʼikuub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">kottaa ifa Rabbii Allaah keessa deddeebinaa.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Guyyaa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Kanaafuu saba kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">mana Yaaʼikuub dhiifteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Isaan bartee Baʼa Biiftuutiin guutamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">akkuma Filisxeemotaa falfala hojjetu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">duudhaa namoota ormaattis ni cichu.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Biyyi isaanii meetii fi warqeen guutamteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">qabeenyi isaanii dhuma hin qabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">Biyyi isaanii fardeeniin guutamteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">gaariiwwan isaaniis dhuma hin qaban.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Biyyi isaanii waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoodhaan guutamteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">isaan hojiidhuma harka isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">waanuma qubni isaanii tolcheef sagadu.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Kanaafuu namni gad qabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">ilmaan namaa gad deebifamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">ati isaaniif hin dhiisin.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Argamuu Rabbii Allaah isa sodaachisaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">surraa ulfina isaa duraa, kattaa keessa lixu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">lafa keessas dhokadhu!<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Iji nama of tuuluu gad qabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">of jajuun namootaas gad deebifama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">gaafas Rabbii Allaah qofatu ol ol jedha.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">warra of jajuu fi warra of tuulu hundaaf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">warra ol ol jedhan hundaaf guyyaa tokko qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">isaanis gad deebifamu.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Inni birbirsa Libaanoon dheeraa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">guddaa hundaaf, qilxuu Baashaan hundaaf,<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />tulluuwwan ol dhedheeroo hundaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:14">gaarran ol dhedheeroo hundaaf,<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />gamoo gurguddaa hundaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">dallaa dhagaadhaan jabeeffamee ijaarame hundaaf,<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />doonii daldalaa hundaa fi waan gatii guddaa qabu hundaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">guyyaa murteeffate tokko qaba.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Of tuulummaan namaa gad qabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">of jajuun namootaas gad deebifama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">gaafas Rabbii Allaah qofatu ol ol jedha;<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />waaqeffatamtoonni tolfamoon guutumaan guutuutti ni barbadeeffamu.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Namoonni yommuu inni lafa raasuuf kaʼutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">sodaachisa Rabbii Allaahatii fi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">surraa isaa ulfina qabeessa sana duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">gara holqa kattaa keessaattii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">boolla lafa keessaatti ni baqatu.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Gaafas namoonni waaqeffatamtoota isaanii tolfamoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">kanneen waaqeffachuuf jedhanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">meetii fi warqee irraa tolfatan sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">tuqaa fi simbira halkaniitiif darbatu.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Isaan yommuu inni lafa raasuuf kaʼutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">sodaachisa Rabbii Allaahatii fi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">surraa ulfina isaa duraa gara holqa guddaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">kattaawwan keessaatii fi baqaqaa kattaatti ni baqatu.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Nama duʼa hin oolle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">kan hafuurri isaa funyaan irra jiru abdachuu dhiisaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">Inni maalitti lakkaaʼama?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Murtii Yerusaalemii fi Yihuudaa Eeggatu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Kunoo Gooftaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Yerusaalemii fi Yihuudaa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">kennaa fi gargaarsa isaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">kan midhaaniitii fi kan bishaanii hunda irraa fudhata;<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />gootaa fi loltuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:2">abbaa murtiitii fi nabiiʼiyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">hooda himaa fi maanguddoo,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />ajajaa shantamaatii fi nama ulfina qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">gorsituu, ogeessa hojii harkaatii fi <optbreak /> ogeessa waa dawweessuu beeku irraa fudhata.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />“Ani dargaggoota qondaaltota isaanii nan godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">ijoolleen isaan bulchu.”<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Namoonni wal hacuucu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">namni tokko nama kaanitti, ollaanis, ollaa isaatti kaʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Dargaggeessi jaarsatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">tuffatamaanis kabajamaatti kaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Namni tokko mana abbaa isaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">obboloota isaa keessaa tokko qabee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">“Ati qoloo qabda; kanaafuu bulchaa nuuf taʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">tuullaa waan diigamee kanattis itti gaafatama fudhu!” jedha.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Inni garuu gaafas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">“Ani furmaata taʼuu hin dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Ani nyaata yookaan uffata tokko illee mana kootii hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">bulchaa sabaa na hin taasisinaa” jedhee iyya.<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Yerusaalem gatantaraa jirti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">Yihuudaan immoo kufteerti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">dubbii isaaniitii fi gochi isaanii Rabbii Allaahan mormuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">ulfina argamuu isaa xureessa.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Haalli fuula isaanii dhugaa isaanitti baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">isaan akkuma Sodoom cubbuu isaanii ifa baasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">isaan cubbuu isaanii hin dhokfatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Isaaniif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">Isaan balaa guddaa ofitti fidaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Akka wanni kun isaaniif tolu qajeeltotatti himaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">isaan buʼaa hojii isaanii nyaatu.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Hamaadhaaf wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">Badiisni isatti ni dhufa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">Inni gatii harka isaa ni argata.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Dargaggoonni saba koo cunqursu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">dubartoonni isaan bulchu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Yaa saba ko, qajeelchitoonni keessan karaa irraa isin jalʼisaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">isaan irraa isin gorsaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Rabbii Allaahan murtii kennuuf taaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:13">saba isaattis muruuf kaʼeera.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">maanguddootaa fi hooggantoota saba isaatti mura:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">“Kan iddoo dhaabaa wayinii kootii balleesse isin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">wanni hiyyeeyyii irraa saamame mana keessan jira.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Isin saba koo caccabsuun keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">fuula hiyyeeyyiis butuchuun keessan maal gochuu keessan?” jedha Gooftaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">“Dubartoonni Xiyoon of tuulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">isaan morma dheereffatanii yaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">ijaanis ni waammatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">faaya miilla isaanii kilillisaa cillaanfachaa deemu.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan mataa intallan Xiyoonitti qaaqee ni fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">Rabbii Allaahan gubbee mataa isaanii moleessa.”<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Gaafas Gooftaan faaya miidhagina isaanii: albuu, marata mataa, faaya mormaa kan baatii fakkaatu, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />amartii gurraa, bitawoo, haguuggii fuulaa, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />Marata mataa, faaya miillaa, sabbata, bilqaaxxii shittoo, kudhaama, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />qubeelaa chaappaa, amartii funyaanii <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />wandaboo filatamaa, koofiyyaa, qoloo, korojoo harkaa, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />of ilaaleewwan, wayyaa quncee talbaa irraa hojjetame, gonfoo dubartootaatii fi uffata mormaa isaan irraa mulqa.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Qooda urgaa, ajaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">qooda sabbataa, funyoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">qooda mataa sirriitti dhaʼamee, moluu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">qooda uffata miidhagaa, wayyaa gaddaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">qooda miidhaginaa fokkisuutu dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Namoonni keessan goraadeedhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:25">loltoonni keessanis lola keessatti dhumu.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Karri Xiyoon faarsitee boossi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">isheen ontee lafa teessi.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Bara sana keessa dubartoonni torba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">nama tokkicha qabatanii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">“Nu nyaatuma keenya nyaanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">uffata keenya uffanna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">garuu maqaa keetiin haa waamamnu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">Salphina keenya nurraa fageessi!” jedhuun.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Damee Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Bara sana keessa dameen Rabbii Allaah bareedee ulfina qabaata; iji lafaas hambaa Israaʼeliif waan isaan ittiin boonanii fi ulfina taʼa. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Warri Xiyoon keessatti hafan, warri Yerusaalem keessatti hambifaman, warri namoota Yerusaalem keessa jiraatan keessatti galmeeffaman hundi qulqulloota jedhamanii ni waamamu. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Gooftaan xurii dubartoota Xiyoon irraa dhiqa; inni Yerusaalem irraa hafuura murtiitii fi hafuura ibiddaatiin dhiiga ni qulqulleessa. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Ergasiis Rabbii Allaahan guutummaa Tulluu Xiyoonii fi warra achitti walitti qabaman hundaa irratti guyyaadhaan duumessa aaraa, halkaniin immoo ifa arraba ibiddaa ni uuma; ulfina sana hunda irra dunkaanatu jiraata. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Innis hoʼa guyyaa irraa daʼoo fi gaaddisa, iddoo bubbee hamaa fi bokkaa jalaa itti baqatanii fi iddoo itti dhokatan taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Faarfannaa Iddoo Dhaaba Wayinii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Ani naman jaalladhu sanaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">faarfannaa waaʼee iddoo dhaabaa wayinii isaa nan faarfadha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Michuun koo gaara gabbataa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">iddoo dhaabaa wayinii qaba.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Innis lafa sana qotee isa irraa dhagaa balleessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">wayinii filatamaa isa irra dhaabe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Qooxii eegumsaa isa keessatti ijaaree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">boolla wayinii itti cuunfan illee qote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Ergasii akka lafti qotiisaa sun ija gaarii kennu eeggate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">inni garuu ija hamaa qofa kenne.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />“Yaa jiraattota Yerusaalemii fi saba Yihuudaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">mee dubbii anaa fi iddoo dhaabaa wayinii koo <optbreak /> gidduu jiruuf murtii kennaa.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Waan ani godheef kana caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">wanni iddoo dhaabaa wayinii kootiif godhamuu malu maali?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Yeroo ani ija wayinii gaarii barbaadetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">inni maaliif ija hadhaaʼaa qofa naqate?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Ani amma waanan iddoo dhaabaa wayinii koo gochuuf jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">isinitti nan hima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">ani dallaa isaa nan diiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">innis ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">dallaa isaa dhagaa nan jigsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">innis gad dhidhiitama.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Ani isa nan onsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">mukni wayinii isaas hin qoramu yookaan lafti isaa hin qotamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Sokorruu fi qoraattiin achi keessatti guddata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">Ani akka bokkaan itti hin roobneef duumessa nan ajaja.”<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Iddoon dhaabaa wayinii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu mana Israaʼel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">namoonni Yihuudaa immoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">iddoo biqiltuu inni itti gammaduu dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Inni murtii qajeelaa barbaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">garuu dhiiga dhangalaafamu arge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">qajeelummaa barbaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">garuu iyya warra miidhamee dhagaʼe.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayyoo fi Murtii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Isin warra hamma iddoon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">tokko iyyuu hin hafnetti mana irratti mana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">lafa qotiisaa irratti lafa qotiisaa dabalattanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">kophuma keessan biyya keessa jiraattaniif wayyoo!<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu utumaa ani dhagaʼuu akkana jedhee dubbate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">“Dhugumaan manneen hedduun ni onu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">manneen gurguddaanii fi babbareedoon nama keessa jiraatu dhabu.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Iddoo dhaabaa wayinii cimdii kudhan irraa daadhii wayinii <optbreak /> baadoosii tokko qofatu galfama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">sanyii qoroosii tokkoo irraa midhaan iifii tokkoo qofatu galfama.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Warra dhugaatii barbaachaaf ganamaan kaʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">kanneen hamma daadhii wayiniitiin machaaʼanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">halkan dheereffataniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Isaan cidha isaanii irratti baganaa, kiraaraa fi dibbee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">ulullee fi daadhii wayinii qabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">garuu hojii Rabbii Allaahatiif dhimma hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">hojii harka isaatiifis ulfina hin kennan.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Kanaafuu sabni koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">sababii hubannaa dhabeef boojiʼama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">namoonni isaanii bebbeekamoon beelaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">uummanni isaaniis dheebuudhaan dhumu.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Kanaafuu Siiʼool garaa isaa balʼifatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">afaan ofii isaa illee hamma malee banata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">namoonni isaanii bebbeekamoonii fi uummanni isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">warri wacanii fi warri gammadan hundis achi keessa buʼu.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Kanaafuu namni gad qabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">ilmaan namaa gad deebifamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">iji of tuultotaas lafa ilaala.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">murtii qajeelaa ofii isaatiin ol ol jedha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:16">Allaahan qulqulluun qajeelummaa ofii isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">akka qulqulluu taʼe of argisiisa.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Yeroo sanatti hoolonni akkuma waan <optbreak /> lafa dheeda isaanii keessa jiraniitti ni dheedu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">xobbaallaawwan hoolaas iddoo sooreyyiin itti barbadaaʼan keessa dheedu.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Warra funyoo gowwoomsaatiin cubbuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">funyoo gaariitiinis hammina harkisan,<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />kanneen, “Allaahan haa ariifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">akka nu arginuuf inni hojii ofii isaa haa saffisiisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">wanni kun haa dhiʼaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">akka nu beeknuufis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">karoorri Qulqullicha Israaʼel haa dhufu” <optbreak /> jedhaniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Warra hamaadhaan gaarii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">gaariidhaan immoo hamaa jedhaniif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">kanneen ifaan dukkana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">dukkanaan immoo ifa jedhaniif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">warra miʼaawaadhaan hadhaaʼaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">hadhaaʼaadhaan immoo miʼaawaa jedhaniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Warra akka yaada isaaniitti ogeeyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">akka ilaalcha isaaniitti immoo abshaala of seʼaniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Warra daadhii wayinii dhuguutti jabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:22">dhugaatii walitti makuuttis goota taʼaniif,<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />warra mattaʼaa fudhatanii yakkamaa gad lakkisaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">murtii nama balleessaa hin qabnee immoo jalʼisaniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Kanaafuu akkuma arrabni ibiddaa cidii lafa irraa arraabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">akkuma okaan ibiddaan gubatee badu sana hiddi isaanii ni tortora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">daraaraan isaaniis akkuma awwaaraa bittinnaaʼee bada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">isaan seera Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu didanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">dubbii Qulqullicha Israaʼel tuffataniiruutii.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Kanaafuu dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah saba isaatti ni bobaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">harki isaa ol kaʼee isaan rukuta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Tulluuwwan ni raafamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">reeffi isaaniis akkuma kosii daandii irratti gatamee taʼa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 5:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Kana hundaan illee dheekkamsi isaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">harki isaas akkuma ol kaafametti jira.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Inni saboota fagoo jiraniif faajjii ol qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">warra moggaa lafaa jiranitti ni siiqsa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">Isaanis kunoo ariifatanii dafanii dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Isaan keessaa namni tokko iyyuu hin dadhabu yookaan hin gufatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">namni tokko iyyuu hin mugu yookaan hin rafu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">sabbanni mudhii isaanii hin laafu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">hidhaan kophee isaaniis hin citu.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Xiyyi isaanii qaramaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">iddaan isaanii hundi qopheeffameera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">kotteen fardeen isaanii akkuma dhagaa qara qabuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">gommaan gaarii isaaniis akkuma bubbee hamaa ti.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Aaduun isaanii akkuma aaduu leencaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">isaan akkuma saafela leencaa aadu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">yeroo waan adamsatan qabatanitti ni gururiʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">isaan waan qabatan fudhatanii deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">namni isaan harkaa buusuu dandaʼus hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Gaafas isaan akkuma huursaa galaanaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">waan sana irraa huursu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Namni tokko yoo biyya sana ilaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">inni dukkanaa fi rakkina arga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">aduunis duumessaan dukkaneeffama.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ergama Isaayyaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Bara Uziyaan Mootichi duʼe keessa, ani utuu Gooftaan teessoo ol dheeraa fi ulfina qabeessa irra taaʼee, handaarri uffata isaa mana qulqullummaa guutee jiruu nan arge. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Isaa olittis suraafeloota tokkoon tokkoon isaanii qoochoo jaʼa jaʼa qabantu ture; isaanis qoochoo lamaan fuula isaanii haguuggatu; qoochoo lamaan miilla isaanii haguuggatu; qoochoo lamaan immoo ni barrisu turan. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Isaanis:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">“Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu <optbreak /> qulqulluu, qulqulluu, qulqulluu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">lafti hundinuu ulfina isaatiin guutamteerti”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 6:3">jedhanii walitti lallabaa turan. <verse eid="ISA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Sagalee isaaniitiin hundeen dhaaba balbalaa ni raafame; manni qulqullummaas aaraan guutame.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Anis akkana jedheen iyye; “Anaaf wayyoo! Ani bade! Ani nama hidhii xuraaʼaa kan namoota hidhii xuraaʼaa qaban gidduu jiraatuudhaatii; iji koo Mooticha, Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu argeeraatii.”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Suraafeloota keessaa inni tokko cilee bobaʼu kan qabduudhaan iddoo aarsaa irraa fuudhe tokko harkatti qabatee gara kootti barrise. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Innis cilee sanaan afaan koo tuqee, “Ilaali, wanni kun hidhii kee tuqeera; balleessaan kee sirraa fuudhameera; cubbuun kees siif dhiifameera” jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Anis sagalee Gooftaa kan, “Ani eenyunan ergadha? Eenyutu nuuf deema?” jedhu nan dhagaʼe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:8">Kana irratti ani, “Kunoo anuu jira. Na ergi!” nan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Innis, “Dhaqiitii akkana jedhii saba kanatti himi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">“ ‘Dhagaʼuu ni dhageessu; garuu hin hubattan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">arguus inuma argitu; garuu hin qalbeeffattan!’<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Qalbii saba kanaa doomsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">gurra isaanii cuqqaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">ija isaaniis cufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Yoo kanaa achii isaan ija ofii isaaniitiin arganii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">gurra isaaniitiin dhagaʼanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">qalbii isaaniitiin hubatanii deebiʼanii fayyu.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Ani, “Yaa Gooftaa, wanni kun hamma yoomiitti akkana taʼa?” nan jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">Innis akkana jedhee deebise:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">“Hamma magaalaawwan diigamanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">nama isaan keessa jiraatu dhabanitti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">hamma manneen onanii lafti qotiisaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">barbadaaʼee duwwaa hafutti,<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />hamma Rabbii Allaahan nama hunda fageessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">lafti sun guutumaan guutuutti dagatamutti taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Kudhan keessaa tokko yoo hafe iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">biyyi sun amma illee deebitee onti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Garuu akkuma mukni laaftootii fi qilxuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">yoo muran gufuun isaa latu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">akkasuma sanyiin qulqulluun gufuu taʼee achitti hafa.”<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mallattoo Amaanuʼel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Bara Aahaaz ilmi Yootaam, ilmi Uziyaan Mootii Yihuudaa turetti, Reziin mootichi Sooriyaatii fi Pheqaan ilmi Remaaliyaa mootichi Israaʼel Yerusaalemiin loluuf itti duulan; garuu ishee moʼachuu hin dandeenye.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Yeroo kanattis, “Sooriyaan Efreem wajjin tokkummaa uummatteerti” jedhanii mana Daawuditti himan; kanaafuu garaan Aahaaziitii fi garaan saba isaa akkuma mukni bosonaa bubbeedhaan raafamu sana raafame.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Kana irratti Rabbii Allaahan Isaayyaasiin akkana jedhe; “Atii fi ilmi kee Sheʼar-Yaashuub dhuma jalʼisii Haroo Ol aanuu kan karaa Lafa qotiisaa namicha wayyaa miicuutti geessu sana biratti Aahaazin simachuuf gad baʼaa. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Akkana jedhiin; ‘Of eeggadhu; calʼisi; hin sodaatin. Ati sababii gufuuwwan muka ibiddaa kanneen seeqaa jiran lamaan kanneeniitiif jechuunis sababii aarii Reziin kan Sooriyaatii fi aarii ilma Remaaliyaa hamaa sanaatiif jettee abdii hin kutatin. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Sooriyaan, Efreemii fi ilmi Remaaliyaa akkana jedhanii badiisa keetiif mariʼataniiru; <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />“Kottaa Yihuudaatti duullaa; kottaa ishee kukkunnee gargar qooddannaa; ilma Xaabiʼeelis ishee irratti moosifannaa.” <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Taʼus Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:7">“ ‘Wanni kun hin raawwatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:7">wanni kun hin taʼu;<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />mataan Sooriyaa Damaasqoodhaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">mataan Damaasqoo immoo Reziinii dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:8">Waggaa jaatamii shan keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Efreem ni bittinnaaʼa; saba tokko taʼuun isaas ni hafa.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Mataan Efreem Samaariyaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">mataan Samaariyaa immoo ilma Remaaliyaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:9">Isin yoo amantii keessaniin jabaattanii dhaabachuu baattan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">yoom iyyuu hin dhaabattan.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Rabbii Allaahan amma illee akkana jedhee Aahaazitti dubbate; <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Qilee akka malee gad fagoo keessatti yookaan shamaayʼun akka malee ol fagoo keessatti, Rabbii Allaah, Allaah kee mallattoo gaafadhu.”<verse eid="ISA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Aahaaz garuu, “Ani hin gaafadhu; Rabbii Allaahas hin qoru” jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Isaayyaasis akkana jedhe; “Yaa mana Daawud mee dhagaʼaa! Isin obsa namaa qoruun isin hanqatee obsa Allaah koo qortuu? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan mataan isaa mallattoo isiniif kenna: Kunoo durbi tokko ni ulfoofti; ilma ni deessi; Amaanuʼel jettees isa moggaafti. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Inni yeroo waan hamaa lagatee waan gaarii filachuu beekutti itittuu fi damma nyaata. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Garuu utuu mucaan sun waan hamaa lagatee waan gaarii filachuu hin beekin dura biyyi mootota lamaan ati sodaatte sanaa ni ona. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Rabbii Allaahan erga Efreem Yihuudaa irraa citee jalqabee bara takkumaa taʼee hin beekin tokko sitti, saba keettii fi mana Abbaa keetiitti ni fida; jechuunis mootii Asoor ni fida.”<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoor, Meeshaa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Bara sana keessa Rabbii Allaahan tisiisota burqaa laga Gibxi keessa jiranii fi kanniisota biyya Asoor siiqsee waama. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Hundi isaanii dhufanii dhooqa lafaa keessa, holqa kattaa keessa, daggala qoraattiitii fi boolla bishaanii hunda keessa qubatu. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Bara sana keessa Gooftaan haaduu laga gamaa kireeffateen jechuunis mootiin Asoor rifeensa mataa keessanii rifeensa miilla keessaniitii fi areeda keessan ni haada. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Bara sana keessa namni tokko goromsa tokkoo fi hoolaa lama qabaata. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Sababii baayʼina aannan isaan kennaniif, inni itittuu sooratu qabaata. Namni biyya sanatti hafu hundinuu itittuu fi damma nyaata. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Bara sana keessa, lafa mukkeen wayinii kumni tokko kanneen meetii saqilii kuma baasan jiran hunda irra sokorruu fi qoraattii qofatu jiraata. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Sababii lafti sun sokorruu fi qoraattiin guutameef, namoonni iddaa fi xiyya qabatan iyyuu achi dhaqu. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Ati sababii sokorruu fi qoraattii sodaattuuf siʼachi gara gaarran kanaan dura gasoon soqamaa turan sanaa hin dhaqxu; isaan lafa loon itti bobbaʼanii fi lafa hoolonni keessa burraaqan taʼu.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isaayyaasii fi Ijoollee Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana naan jedhe; “Gabatee guddaa tokko fuudhiitii isa irratti, ‘Maheer-Shaalaal-Haash-Baaz’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maheer-Shaalaal-Haash-Baaz </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuun </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dafii boojiʼi; ariifadhuu saami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuu dha.</char></note> jedhii qubee beekamaadhaan barreessi.” <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Anis akka isaan dhuga baatota amanamoo taʼaniif Uuriyaa lubichaa fi Zakariyaa ilma Yeberekiyaa nan waammadha. <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Anis nabiiʼiyyittii bira nan gaʼe; isheenis ulfooftee ilma deesse. Rabbii Allaahan akkana naan jedhe; “Maqaa isaa Maheer-Shaalaal-Haash-Baaz jedhii moggaasi. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Utuu mucaan kun ‘Aabboo’ yookaan ‘Aayyoo’ jechuu hin beekin dura qabeenyi Damaasqootii fi boojuun Samaariyaa mootii Asooriin fudhatama.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Rabbii Allaahan ammas akkana jedhee natti dubbate:<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Sabni kun bishaan Shilooʼaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">kan suuta yaaʼu sana dhiisee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:6">Reziinii fi ilma Remaaliyaatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">gammadeeraatii;<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />kanaafuu Gooftaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">lolaa guddaa kan laga Efraaxiis jechuunis mootii Asoor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">ulfina isaa hunda wajjin saba kanatti fida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:7">Lolaan sunis guutee boʼoo isaa irra yaaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">ededa isaa hunda irra dhangalaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Lolaan sunis hamma morma gaʼutti guutee irra dhangalaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">keessa darbuudhaan waan hundumaa haxaaʼee Yihuudaatti geessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:8">Yaa Amaanuʼel!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amaanuʼel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuun </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Allaahan nu wajjin jira </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuu dha.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">Qoochoon isaa balʼifamee guutummaa biyya keetii ni haguuga.”<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Yaa saboota, burkutaaʼaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Isin warri biyya fagoo jirtan hundi dhaggeeffadhaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Waraanaaf hidhadhaa; taʼus burkutaaʼaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Waraanaaf hidhadhaa; taʼus burkutaaʼaa!<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Mariʼadhaa; garuu faayidaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">karoorfadhaa; garuu fiixaan hin baʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">Allaahan nu wajjin jiraatii.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Rabbii Allaahan harka isaa jabaa sanaan natti dubbatee akka ani karaa saba kanaa irra hin deemneef akkana jedhee na akeekkachiiseeraatii:<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />“Isin waan uummanni kun fincila jedhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">hundaan fincila hin jedhinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:12">waan isaan sodaatan hin sodaatinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">hin raafaminaa.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Kan isin akka qulqulluutti ilaaluu qabdan <optbreak /> Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu tokkicha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">kan isin sodaachuu qabdan isuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">kan isin hollachuufii qabdanis isuma.<verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Inni iddoo qulqulluu taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">manneen Israaʼel lamaaniif garuu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">inni dhagaa nama gufachiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">kattaa nama kuffisu taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">Saba Yerusaalemitti garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">inni kiyyoo fi futtaasaa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Hedduun isaanii ni gufatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">isaan kufanii caccabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">futtaasaa seenanii qabamu.”<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Dhuga baʼumsa kana walitti qabsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:16">seera kanas barattoota koo gidduutti chaappaadhaan cufi.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Rabbii Allaah mana Yaaʼikuub duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">fuula isaa dhokfate sana nan eeggadha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:17">Ani isa nan amanadha.<verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Anii fi ijoolleen Rabbii Allaahan naa kenne kunoo ti. Nu Israaʼel keessatti Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu kan Tulluu Xiyoon irra jiraatu sanaaf mallattoo fi fakkeenya.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dukkanni Ifatti Jijjiirama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Yommuu namni tokko dhaqaatii ilaaltootaa fi eker dubbistoota kanneen hasaasanii fi guunguman waa gaafadhaa isiniin jedhutti sabni tokko Allaah isaa gorsa gaafachuu hin qabuu? Isaan waaʼee jiraattotaa maaliif warra duʼan gaafatu? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Akka seeraa fi dhuga baʼumsa sanaatti jiraadhaa! Isaan yoo akka dubbii kanaatti dubbachuu baatan ifa barii hin qaban jechuu dha. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Isaan rakkina guddaa fi beelaan biyya keessa jooru; yommuu beelaʼanittis akka malee aaranii, ol ilaalanii mootii isaaniitii fi Allaah isaanii abaaru. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Ergasiis gara lafaa ilaalanii rakkina guddaa, dukkanaa fi hurrii sodaachisaa argu; isaanis dukkana hamaatti darbatamu.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mucaan Nuuf Dhalateera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Warri rakkina guddaa keessa turan garuu siʼachi gadda keessa hin jiraatan. Inni duraan biyya Zebuuloonii fi biyya Niftaalem gad deebise; gara fuulduraatti garuu Galiilaa Namoota Ormaa kan Yordaanosiin gama, qarqara Daandii Galaanaa irra jiran sana ni kabaja.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Sabni dukkana keessa jiraatu ifa guddaa argeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">warra biyya dukkana limixii keessa jiraataniifis ifni baʼeera.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Ati saba baayʼiftee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">gammachuu isaanii illee guddifteerta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">isaan akkuma uummanni yeroo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">midhaan haamamutti gammadu sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">akkuma namoonni yeroo boojuu qooddatanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">gammadan sana fuula kee duratti ni ililchu.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Ati akkuma bara Midiyaanin moʼatame sanaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">waanjoo isaanitti ulfaate</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">somaa gatiittii isaanii irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">ulee cunqursaa isaanii illee caccabsiteerta.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Kopheen loltuun ittiin duulte hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">uffanni dhiiga keessa cuuphame hundi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">ibiddaan gubama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">qoraan ibiddaas taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Mucaan nuuf dhalateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">ilmi nuuf kennameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">mootummaan gatiittii isaa irra jiraata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Innis Gorsaa Dinqisiisaa, Allaah Jabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Abbaa Bara baraa, Mootii Nagaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">jedhamee ni waamama.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Babalʼinni mootummaa isaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">nagaan isaa dhuma hin qabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Innis murtii qajeelaa fi qajeelummaadhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">hundeessee jabeessee dhaabuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">yeroo sanaa jalqabee bara baraan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">teessoo Daawud irra taaʼee mootummaa isaa bulcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Hinaaffaan Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">waan kana ni raawwata.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼelitti Dheekkame</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Gooftaan dhaamsa tokko Yaaʼikuubitti ergeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:8">kunis Israaʼel irra buʼa.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Uummanni hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">Efreemii fi jiraattonni Samaariyaa waan kana ni beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">isaanis of tuuluu fi garaa of jajuun akkana jedhu;<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Xuubiiwwan diigamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">nu garuu dhagaa soofameen deebisnee ijaarra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">mukkeen harbuu murmuramaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">nu garuu birbirsa iddoo buusna.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan amajaajota Reziin isaanitti jabeesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">diinota isaanii illee isaanitti kakaase.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Warri Sooriyaa gama baʼaatiin, <optbreak /> Filisxeemonni immoo gama lixaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">afaan banatanii Israaʼelin liqimsan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Kana hundaan illee dheekkamsi isaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">harki isaas amma iyyuu akkuma ol kaafametti jira.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Sabni sun garuu gara isa isaan dhaʼe sanaatti hin deebine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">yookaan Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu hin barbaaddanne.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel irraa mataa fi eegee kuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">damee meexxiitii fi shambaqqoo guyyuma tokkoon balleessa;<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />maanguddoonnii fi kabajamoonni mataa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:15">nabiiʼiyyoonni soba barsiisan immoo eegee dha.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Namoonni saba kana qajeelchan isaan dogoggorsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">warri isaaniin qajeelfamanis karaa irraa badu.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan dargaggootatti hin gammadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">yookaan ijoollee abbaa hin qabnee fi <optbreak /> haadhota hiyyeessaatiif hin naʼu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">namni hundinuu kan Allaah hin sodaannee fi hamaadhaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">afaan hundinuus hamaa dubbata.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Kana hundaan illee dheekkamsi isaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">harki isaas amma iyyuu akkuma ol kaafametti jira.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Hamminni dhugumaan akka ibiddaa bobaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">inni sokorruu fi qoraattii illee gubee balleessa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">bosona gobbuus ni qabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">akkuma aara ol baʼuuttis ol baʼa.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Dheekkamsa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuutiin <optbreak /> lafti ni gubatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">namoonnis qoraan ibiddaa taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">namni kam iyyuu obboleessa isaa oolchuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Karaa mirgaatiin ni butatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">garuu beela hin baʼan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">karaa bitaatiin ni nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">garuu hin quufan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Tokkoon tokkoon isaanii foon aantee isaa nyaata;<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Minaaseen Efreemin nyaata; Efreemis Minaasee nyaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">isaan tokkummaadhaan Yihuudaatti garagalu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Kana hundaan illee dheekkamsi isaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">harki isaas amma iyyuu akkuma ol kaafametti jira.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Warra seera jalʼaa baasan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1">kanneen labsii cunqursaa labsaniif wayyoo;<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />isaan murtii rakkattootaa jalʼisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">mirga hiyyeeyyii saba koos ni dhiibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">haadhota hiyyeessaa boojuu godhatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">ijoollee abbaa hin qabnes ni saamu.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Isin yeroo badiisni fagoodhaa dhufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">guyyaa adabbiitti maal gootu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Gargaarsa argachuuf eenyutti baqattu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Qabeenya keessan eessatti dhiiftu?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Warra boojiʼaman jala gugguufuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">yookaan warra ajjeefaman jalatti kufuu malee homtuu hin hafu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 10:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Kana hundaan illee dheekkamsi isaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">harki isaas amma iyyuu akkuma ol kaafametti jira.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murtii Allaahan Asooritti Murteesse</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />“Asooricha isa ulee aarii kootii taʼeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">isa bokkuun dheekkamsa kootii harka isaa jiruuf wayyoo!<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ani akka inni isaan saamuu fi boojiʼuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">akka inni akkuma dhoqqee karaa irraa lafatti isaan dhidhiituuf</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">saba Allaahatti hin bulletti isa nan erga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">uummata na aarsuttis isa nan ajaja.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Garuu kun waan inni yaadu miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">yaadni akkasiis garaa isaa keessa hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">kaayyoon isaa barbadeessuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">saba baayʼees fixuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Innis akkana jedha; ‘Ajajjoonni koo hundinuu mootota mitii?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kaalnoon akkuma Karkemiish mitii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamaati akkuma Arfaad mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Samaariyaanis akkuma Damaasqoo mitii?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Akkuma harki koo mootummoota waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">kanneen fakkiiwwan soofamoo kan Yerusaalemii fi <optbreak /> Samaariyaa caalan qabe sana,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />ani waanan Samaariyaa fi fakkiiwwan ishee godhe sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">Yerusaalemii fi waaqeffatamtoota ishee tolfamoo hin godhuu?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Gooftaan yeroo Tulluu Xiyoon irrattii fi Yerusaalem keessatti hojii isaa hunda fixatutti akkana jedha; “Ani sababii of jajuu garaa isaatii fi ilaalcha isaa kan of tuulummaan guutame sanaatiif jedhee mooticha Asoor nan adaba. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Inni akkana jedhaatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">“ ‘Ani jabina harka kootiin waan kana hojjedheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">ani sababiin hubannaa qabuuf, <optbreak /> ogummaa kootiin hojjedheera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Ani daangaa sabootaa iddoodhaa buqqiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">qabeenya isaanii illee saameera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">Akkuma nama jabaa tokkoo ani mootota isaanii <optbreak /> of jala galfadheera.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Akkuma namni tokko manʼee simbiraa keessa harka kaaʼu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">anis harka koo qabeenya sabootaa keessa nan kaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">akkuma namoonni hanqaaquu dagatame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">walitti qaban sana, anis biyya hunda walitti nan qabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">kan qoochoo hurgufate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">yookaan wacuuf afaan banate tokko iyyuu hin turre.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Qottoon nama ittiin waa murutti ni kooraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Yookaan wanni ittiin waa muran nama itti fayyadamutti of jajaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Kunis akka waan uleen tokko nama isa qabatutti of mirmirsuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">yookaan akkuma bokkuun tokko akka waan muka hin taʼiniitti ol of guddisuu ti!<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">loltoota gagabbatan kanatti dhukkuba nama huqqisu ni erga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">ulfina isaa jalaanis ibiddi tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">akkuma arraba ibiddaa ni qabsiifama.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Ifni Israaʼel ibidda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">Qulqullichi isaanii sunis arraba ibiddaa taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">ibiddi sun guyyuma tokkoon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">qoraattii isaatii fi sokorruu isaa gubee balleessa.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Akkuma namni tokko yeroo dhukkubsatu huqqatu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">ibiddi sun ulfina bosonaa isaatii fi lafa qotiisaa gabbataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">lubbuu fi foonis ni barbadeessa.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Mukkeen bosona isaa keessatti hafan waan akka malee muraasa taʼaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">mucaan tokko galmeessuu ni dandaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hambaa Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Bara sana keessa hambaan Israaʼel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">mana Yaaʼikuub keessaa warri hafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:20">dhugumaan Rabbii Allaah Qulqullicha Israaʼel abdatu malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">lammata isa isaan dhaʼe sana hin abdatan.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Hambaan tokko, hambaan Yaaʼikuub</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">gara Allaah Jabaa sanaatti ni deebiʼa.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Yaa Israaʼel, yoo sabni kee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">akkuma cirracha qarqara galaanaa taʼe iyyuu, <optbreak /> hambaa qofatu deebiʼa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">Badiisni qajeelummaadhaan guutame labsameera.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">badiisa lafa hundatti labsame ni raawwata.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Kanaafuu Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:24">“Yaa saba koo warri Xiyoon keessa jiraattan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">warra Asoor kanneen uleedhaan isin rukutan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">kanneen akkuma warra Gibxi bokkuu ol isinitti fudhatan hin sodaatinaa.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Aariin ani isinitti aare dafee qabbanaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">dheekkamsi koos isaan balleessuuf itti garagala.”<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">akkuma kattaa Hereeb biratti Midiyaanin qacceen garafe sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:26">akkuma biyya Gibxi keessatti godhe sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">ulee isaa bishaan irratti ol fudhata.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Gaafas baʼaan isaanii gatiittii keessan irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">waanjoon isaaniis morma keessan irraa fuudhama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">waan isin akka malee gabbattaniif waanjoon ni caccaba.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Isaan gara Ayyati seenan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">Migroon keessa baʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">nyaataa fi hidhata isaaniis Mikmaas keessatti kuuftan.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Isaan karaa qalʼaa irra baʼanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">“Nu Gebaa qubannee bulla” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Raamaan ni sodaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">Gibeʼaan Saaʼolis ni baqatti.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Yaa intala Galiim, iyyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Yaa Laayishaa dhaggeeffadhu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Yaa Anaatoot deebii isheef kenni!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Maadmenaan baqataarti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">uummanni Geebiimis baqachuuf walitti qabama.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Isaan harʼa Noob gaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">isaan tulluu Intala Xiyoonitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">gaara Yerusaalemitti harka isaanii raasu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Kunoo Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">humna guddaadhaan dameewwan murmura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">mukkeen gurguddaan ni cicciramu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">mukkeen dhedheeroonis gad qabamu.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Inni bosona gobbuu qottoodhaan cira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">Libaanoonis fuula Allaah Jabaa duratti kufa.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Damee Isseey</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Lataan tokko jirma Isseey irraa ni lata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">hidda isaa irraas dameen tokko ija naqata.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Hafuurri Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">Hafuurri ogummaatii fi hubannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">Hafuurri gorsaatii fi humnaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">Hafuurri beekumsaatii fi kan Rabbii Allaah sodaachuu isa irra qubata;<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />inni Rabbii Allaah sodaachuutti ni gammada.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 11:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">Inni waanuma iji isaa arguun murtii hin kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">yookaan waanuma gurra isaatiin dhagaʼuun hin murteessu;<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />garuu nama rakkataaf qajeelummaadhaan murteessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">hiyyeeyyii lafa irraatiifis murtii qajeelaadhaan murtii kenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Inni ulee afaan isaatiin lafa rukuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">hafuura afaan isaatii baʼuun hamoota ni fixa.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Qajeelummaan teepha mudhii isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">amanamummaan immoo sabbata mudhii isaa ti.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Yeeyyiin xobbaallaa hoolaa wajjin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">qeerransi ilmoo reʼee bira ciisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">jabbiin, leencii fi horiin gabbataan walii wajjin bobbaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">mucaan xinnaan isaan bobbaasa.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Saan amaaketa wajjin soorata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">ilmaan isaanii wal cina ciciisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">leencis akka sangaa cidii nyaata.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Daaʼimni boolla bofaa irra taphata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">mucaan xinnaan boolla buutii keessa harka kaaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Isaan tulluuwwan koo qulqulloota hunda irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">waa hin miidhan yookaan waa hin balleessan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">akkuma bishaan galaana guutu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">lafti Rabbii Allaah beekuudhaan guutamtiitii.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Bara sana keessa hiddi Isseey akkuma faajjiitti uummataaf dhaabata; saboonni gara isaatti walitti qabamu; lafti inni boqotus ulfina qabeessa taʼa. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Gaafas Gooftaan yeroo lammaffaaf harka isaa diriirsee Asoor irraa, Gibxi Gadii irraa, Gibxi Olii irraa, Itoophiyaa irraa, Eelaam irraa, Baabilon irraa, Hamaatii fi biyyoota bishaan gidduu galaanaa irraa hambaawwan saba isaa walitti qabata.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Inni sabootaaf faajjii ol kaasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">boojiʼamtoota Israaʼel walitti qaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">inni roga laafaa afran irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">saba Yihuudaa kan bittinnaaʼee ture walitti qaba.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Hinaaffaan Efreem ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">diinonni Yihuudaas ni barbadeeffamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Efreem gaafas Yihuudaatti hin hinaafu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">yookaan Yihuudaan Efreemitti hin hammaatu.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Isaan karaa lixa biiftuutiin gatiittii Filisxeemitti gad buʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">tokko taʼaniis uummata baʼa biiftuu saamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Isaan Edoomii fi Moʼaabin qabatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">warri Amoonis isaan jalatti bulu.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Rabbii Allaahan guutumaan guutuutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">galoo galaana Gibxi ni gogsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">inni bubbee isaa kan nama waxaluun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">harka isaa laga Efraaxiis irra sochoosa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Akka namoonni kopheen ceʼaniifis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">inni laga torbatti gargar isa qooda.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Akkuma gaafa isaan Gibxii baʼan <optbreak /> Israaʼeliif taʼe sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">hambaa saba isaa kan Asoor irraa hafeef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">karaan guddaan ni argama.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Faarfannaa Galataa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Ati gaafas akkana jetta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Rabbii Allaah, ati natti aartee turte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">aariin kees narraa deebiʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">na jajjabeessiteertaatii sin galateeffadha.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Dhugumaan Allaahan fayyina koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">ani isa nan abdadha; hin sodaadhus.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">Rabbii Allaahan, Rabbii Allaahan mataan isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">jabinaa fi faarfannaa koo ti; <optbreak /> inni fayyina koo taʼeera.”<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Isin burqaa fayyinaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:3">gammachuudhaan bishaan waraabbattu.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Isin bara sana keessa akkana jettu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">“Rabbii Allaahaf galata galchaa; maqaa isaa waammadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">waan inni hojjete sabootatti beeksisaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">akka maqaan isaa ol ol jedhe lallabaa.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Inni waan ulfina qabu hojjeteeraatii Rabbii Allaah faarfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">wanni kun addunyaa hunda keessatti haa beekamu.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Yaa saba Xiyoon, Qulqullichi Israaʼel <optbreak /> isin gidduutti guddaadhaatii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">sagalee ol fudhadhaatii gammachuudhaan faarfadhaa.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Baabiloniin Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Raajii waaʼee Baabilon kan Isaayyaas ilmi Amoos arge:<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Tulluu homaa itti hin biqilin irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">faajjii ol kaasaatii isaanitti iyyaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">akka isaan karra namoota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">bebeekamootiin ol galaniif harkaan itti himaa.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Ani qulqulloota koo ajajeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">akka isaan dheekkamsa koo hojii irra naa oolchaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">ani loltoota koo kanneen moʼannoo kootti gammadan <optbreak /> waammadheera.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Waca tulluuwwan irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">kan akka tuuta guddaa tokkoo dhaggeeffadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Guungummii mootummootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">kan saboota walitti qabamanii dhaggeeffadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">lolaaf jedhee loltoota qopheeffachaa jira!<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Isaan biyya fagoodhaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">daarii shamaayʼuniiwwaniitii dhufan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Rabbii Allaah fi miʼa lolaa kan dheekkamsa isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">guutummaa biyyattii balleessuuf dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Waan guyyaan Rabbii Allaah dhiʼaateef booʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">guyyaan sun akkuma badiisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu biraa ergameetti ni dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Kanaafuu harki hundinuu ni laamshaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:7">onneen nama hundaas ni baqa.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Sodaan isaan qabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">dhukkubbii fi gaddi isaan qabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">akkuma dubartii ciniinsuun qabeetti wixxirfatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Isaan rifatanii wal ilaalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">fuulli isaanii akka ibiddaa diimata.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Kunoo guyyaan Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">guyyaan hamaan, dheekkamsaa fi aarii sodaachisaadhaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">lafa onsuu fi cubbamoota ishee keessa jiraatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">barbadeessuuf ni dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Urjiiwwan shamaayʼuniitii fi tuunni isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">ifa isaanii hin kennan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Aduun baatu ni dukkanoofti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">jiʼis ifa ishee hin kennitu.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Ani addunyaa kana sababii jalʼina isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">hamoota sababii cubbuu isaaniitiif nan adaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Ani of tuulummaa of jajjootaa nan balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">of guddisuu gara jabeeyyii illee gadin deebisa.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Ani akka namni warqee qulqulluu caalaa gati qabeessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">warqee Oofiir caalaas muraasa taʼu nan godha.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Kanaafuu ani akka shamaayʼuniiwwan hollatan nan godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">gaafa aariin isaa bobaʼutti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">dheekkamsa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuutiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">lafti iddoo isheetii ni raafamti.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Namni hundinuu akkuma kuruphee adamsamtuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">akkuma hoolota tiksee hin qabnee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">gara saba isaatti deebiʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">namni kam iyyuu biyya isaatti baqata.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Namni boojiʼame hundinuu ni waraanama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">kan qabame kam iyyuu goraadeedhaan duʼa.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Daaʼimman isaanii fuuluma isaanii duratti ni cicciramu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">manneen isaanii ni saamamu; <optbreak /> niitonni isaaniis humnaan gudeedamu.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Kunoo ani warra Meedee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">kanneen meetii irraa dhimma hin qabne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">warra warqeen hin gammachiifne jarattin kakaasa.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Iddaan isaanii dargaggoota fixxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">isaan daaʼimmaniif hin naʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">ijoolleefis garaa hin laafan.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Baabilon ulfinni moototaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">miidhaginni of jaja warra Baabilon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">akkuma Sodoomii fi Gomoraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">irree Allaahatiin garagalfamti.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Namni ishee keessa hin qubatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">yookaan dhaloota hunda keessatti <optbreak /> namni ishee keessa hin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">namni Arabaa tokko iyyuu dunkaana isaa achi hin dhaabbatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">tikseen tokko iyyuu bushaayee isaa achi hin boqochiifattu.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Garuu bineensonni bosonaa achi ciciisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">waangoowwan mana ishee ni guutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">urunguun achi jiraatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">reʼeen diidaa achi keessa buburraaqxi.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Waraabessi daʼannoowwan ishee keessaa yuusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">waangoonis manneen ishee mimmiidhagoo kan mootummaa <optbreak /> keessaa iyyiti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">Yeroon ishee gaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">barri ishees hin dheeratu.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Rabbii Allaahan Yaaʼikuubiif garaa ni laafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">inni amma illee Israaʼelin filatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">biyya isaanii keessa isaan qubachiisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:1">Ormoonni isaanitti dabalamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">mana Yaaʼikuub wajjinis tokko taʼu.<verse eid="ISA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Saboonni isaan fudhatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">iddoo ofii isaaniitti isaan deebisu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Manni Israaʼel immoo akkuma hojjettoota dhiiraa fi dubartiitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">lafa Rabbii Allaah keessatti dhaala godhanii isaan fudhatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Isaan boojitoota isaanii boojiʼanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">warra isaan hacuucanis bulchu.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Guyyaa Rabbii Allaah itti dhiphina, rakkinaa fi hojii hamaa isin itti garboomfamtanii turtan sana jalaa isin boqochiisutti, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />akkana jettee mootii Baabilonitti ni qoosta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">Cunqursichi akkamitti bade!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">Aariin isaas akkamitti isa irraa gale!<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Rabbii Allaahan ulee hamootaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">bokkuu bulchitootaa,<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />kan dheekkamsa wal irraa hin cinneetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">uummata rukute;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:6">kan gara laafina tokko malee ariʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">saboota dhaʼe sana caccabseera.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Lafti hundi boqonnaa fi nagaa argatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">faarfachuuttis kaati.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Gaattiraawwanii fi birbirsawwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">Libaanoon iyyuu isinitti burraaqanii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">“Amma ati kufteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">namni tokko iyyuu nu muruuf hin dhufu” jedhu.<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Siiʼool isheen gadii yeroo ati dhuftutti si simachuuf kaati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">isheen akka isaan si dubbisaniif hafuurota warra duʼanii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">warra addunyaa irratti hooggantoota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">turanii hunda dammaqsiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">isheen warra mootota sabootaa turan hunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">teessoo isaanii irraa kaafti.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Isaan hundinuu deebisanii akkana jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">“Atis akkuma keenya dadhabdeerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">akkuma keenya taateerta.”<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Ulfinni kee hundinuu, sagalee baganaa keetii wajjin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">qabrii keessa buufameera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">ilmaan raammoo si jala afamanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">raammoon si haguugdi.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Yaa bakkalcha barii, ilma barii barraaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">ati akkamitti shamaayʼun irraa lafa dhoofte!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">Ati kan duraan saboota gad qabde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">lafatti gad darbatamteerta!<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Ati garaa keetti akkana jette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">“Ani shamaayʼuniitti olin baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">ani urjiiwwan Allaahatii olitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">teessoo koo olin baafadha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">ani tulluu wal gaʼii irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">fiixee tulluu qulqullichaa irra teessoo irra nan taaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Ani fiixee duumessootaa gara irraatti ol nan baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">ani akka Allaah Waan Hundaa Olii ofin taasisa.”<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Garuu ati siiʼool keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:15">boolla qilee keessa buufamteerta.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Warri si argan ija babaasanii si ilaalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">akkana jedhaniis dinqisiifatu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">“Kun namichuma lafa sochoosee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">akka mootummoonni raafaman godhe,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />namicha addunyaa kana gammoojjii godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">kan magaalaawwan ishee gaggaragalchee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">akka warri boojiʼaman mana isaaniitti hin deebine godhe sanaa?”<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Mootonni sabootaa hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">ulfinaan qabrii isaanii keessa ciciisaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Ati garuu akkuma damee jibbame tokkootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">qabrii kee keessaa baafamtee gatamteerta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">ati warra ajjeefamaniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">warra goraadeen waraanamaniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">warra gara dhagaa boollaatti gad buʼaniin haguugamteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Akkuma reeffaa miillaan dhidhiitamteerta;<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />ati sababii biyya kee balleessitee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">namoota kee fixxeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">isaan gidduutti hin qabbaramtu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 14:20" />
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 14:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Maqaan sanyii hamootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">lammata hin dhaʼamu.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Sababii cubbuu abbootii isaaniitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">iddoo ilmaan isaa itti qalaman qopheessaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">isaan biyya dhaaluudhaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">magaalaawwan isaaniitiinis lafa guutuuf hin kaʼan.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />“Ani isaanitti nan kaʼa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">jedha Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:22">“Ani Baabilon keessaa maqaa isheetii fi hambaa ishee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">ilmaan isheetii fi sanyii ishee nan balleessa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />“Ani iddoo urunguun keessa jiraattuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">lafa caffee ishee nan godha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:23">ani hartuu badiisaatiin ishee nan haxaaʼa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">jedha Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raajii Asooriin Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedhee kakateera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">“Dhugumaan akkuma ani duraan karoorfadhe sana <optbreak /> wanni kun ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">akkuma ani yaade sanas ni dhaabata.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Ani biyya koo keessatti Asoorota nan barbadeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">tulluuwwan koo irratti ani isa gad dhidhiita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Waanjoon isaa saba koo irraa ni fuudhama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">baʼaan isaas gatiittii isaanii irraa ni buʼa.”<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Karoorri guutummaa addunyaatiif murtaaʼe kanaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">kun harka saboota hunda irratti diriirfamee dha.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">waan kana yaadeeraatii, eenyutu isa garagalcha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">Harki isaa diriirfameeraa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">eenyutu duubatti isa deebisuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raajii Filisxeemotaan Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Raajiin kun bara Aahaaz mootichi duʼe keessa dhufe:<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Yaa Filisxeemota, uleen isin dhaʼe waan cabeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">isin hundinuu hin gammadinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">hidda bofa sanaa keessaa buutiitu baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">iji isaa bofa darbatamaa summii qabu ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Hiyyeessi gadadamaan iddoo itti bobbaʼu argata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">rakkataanis nagaadhaan ciisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Hidda kee garuu ani beelaan nan barbadeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">beellis hambaa kee ni fixa.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Yaa karra, ati booʼi! Yaa magaalaa, iyyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Filisxeemonni hundi baqaatii badaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Duumessi aaraa tokko karaa kaabaatiin ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">raayyaa waraana isaa keessas kan citee hafu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Ergamoota saba sanaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">deebii akkamiitu kennamuu mala?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">“Rabbii Allaahan jabeessee Xiyoonin dhaabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">ishee keessattis namoonni isaa kanneen miidhaman <optbreak /> daʼannoo ni argatu.”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Moʼaabiin Mormu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 16:6-12">16:6‑12</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 48:29-36">Erm 48:29‑36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Raajii waaʼee Moʼaab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Aari isheen Moʼaab keessaa diigamteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">halkanuma tokkottis baddeerti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Qiir isheen Moʼaab keessaa diigamteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">halkanuma tokkottis baddeerti!<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Diiboon gara mana qulqullummaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">iddoowwan ol kaʼaatti booʼuuf ol baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Moʼaabis Neboo fi Meedebaaf ni booʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Mataan hundinuu haadamaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">areedni hundinuus cicciramaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Isaan daandii irratti wayyaa gaddaa uffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">bantii manaatii fi waltajjii sabaa irratti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">hundi isaanii ni booʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">imimmaan isaaniis ni dhangalaasu.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Heshboonii fi Eleʼaaleen ni iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">sagaleen isaaniis hamma Yaahaziitti fagaatee dhagaʼame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Kanaafuu loltoonni Moʼaab ni iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">lubbuun isaaniis ni romʼite.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Garaan koo Moʼaabiif iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">kooluu galtoonni ishee hamma Zoʼaariitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">hamma Eglaati Sheelishiyaatti baqatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Isaan booʼaa, gara Luuhiititti ol baʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">karaa Hooronaayim irrattis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">waaʼee badii isaanii faarsanii booʼu.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Bishaanonni Niimriim goganiiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">margis coollageera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">biqiltuuwwan lafaa badaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">wanni magariisni tokko iyyuu hin hafne.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Kanaafuu isaan qabeenya argatanii kuufatan sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">Laga Alaltuu irraan baatanii dabarfatu.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Iyyi isaanii hamma daarii Moʼaabitti dhagaʼame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">wawwaachuun isaanii hamma Eglayiimitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">faaruun booʼicha isaaniis hamma Beʼeer Eeliimiinitti dhagaʼame.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Bishaanonni Diimon dhiigaan guutamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">ani immoo waan kana caalu iyyuu Diimonitti nan fida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">warra Moʼaab keessaa baqatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">kanneen biyya sanatti hafanitti leenca nan erga.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Seelaa, gammoojjii gama jirtu sana irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">bulchaa biyyattiitiif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">gara tulluu Intala Xiyoonitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">xobbaallaawwan hoolaa gibira ergaa.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Akkuma simbira manʼee ishee keessaa ariʼamtee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">asii fi achi fiigduu dubartoonni Moʼaabis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">malkaa laga Arnoonitti akkasuma taʼu.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />“Gorsa nuuf kennaa; murtii murteessaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">Guyyaa saafaadhaan gaaddidduu keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">akkuma halkanii dukkaneessaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Baqattootas dhoksaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">kooluu galtoota hin ganinaa.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Baqattoonni Moʼaab isin wajjin haa jiraatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">balleessituu irraa daʼoo isaaniif taʼaa.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Cunqursaan ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">badiisnis ni hafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">warri nama miidhan lafa irraa badu.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Teessoon jaalalaan hundeeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">mana Daawud keessaa namni murtii kennuu irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">murtii qajeelaa barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">kan waan qajeelaa hojjechuuf ariifatu tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">amanamummaadhaan teessoo sana irra ni taaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Nu of tuulummaa Moʼaab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">of guddisuu fi kooruu ishee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">of tuuluu fi addaggee taʼuu ishee dhageenyeerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">of jajuun ishee garuu faayidaa hin qabu.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Kanaafuu Moʼaabonni ni booʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">isaan tokkummaadhaan Moʼaabiif booʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Namoota Qiir Hareeshetiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">faarsanii booʼuudhaan gaddu.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Lafti qotiisaa Heshboon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">mukni wayinii Sibimaas coollageera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Bulchitoonni sabootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">mukkeen wayinii filatamoo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">kanneen duraan Yaʼizeerin gaʼanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">gara gammoojjiitti babalʼatan dhidhiitaniiru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Lataan isaanii dheeratee hamma galaanaatti diriire.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Kanaafuu ani akkuma Yaʼizeer boosse sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">mukkeen wayinii Sibimaatiif nan booʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Yaa Heshboon, yaa Eleʼaalee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">ani imimmaan kootiin sin jiisa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Ililleen yeroo midhaan siif gaʼeetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">gammachuun yeroo midhaan siif <optbreak /> haamamu ture sun hafeera.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Ililchuu fi gammaduun iddoo biqiltuu keessaa badaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">namni tokko iyyuu iddoo dhaabaa wayinii keessatti <optbreak /> hin faarfatu yookaan hin ililchu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">sababii ani ilillee balleesseef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">namni iddoo wayinii itti cuunfanitti wayinii dhidhiitu tokko hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Garaan koo akkuma baganaa faarsee Moʼaabiif booʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">keessi koos Qiir Hareeshetiif booʼa.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Moʼaab yoo iddoo ol kaʼaatti mulʼatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">isheen ofuma dadhabsiifti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:12">yoo duʼaa godhachuuf gara iddoo qulqulluu ishee dhaqxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">kunis faayidaa tokko illee hin qabu.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Kun dubbii Rabbii Allaahan duraanuu waaʼee Moʼaab dubbatee dha. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Rabbii Allaahan garuu amma akkana jedha: “Waggaa sadii keessatti, ulfinni Moʼaabii fi namoonni ishee hedduun hundi akkuma hojjetaan tokko guyyaa isaa lakkaaʼatu sana ni tuffatamu; kanneen hafanis akka malee muraasaa fi dadhaboo taʼu.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Damaasqoodhaan mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Raajii Damaasqoodhaan mormu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">“Kunoo, Damaasqoon tuullaa diigamte taati malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">siʼachi magaalaa hin taatu.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Magaalaawwan Aroʼeer ni onu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">bushaayeen achi ciciisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">wanni isaan sodaachisu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Magaalaan jabeeffamtee ijaaramte Efreem keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">humni mootummaas Damaasqoo keessaa ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">hambaan Sooriyaa akka ulfina Israaʼelootaa taʼa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">jedha Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />“Bara sana keessa ulfinni Yaaʼikuub gad deebiʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">furdinni dhagna isaas ni huqqata.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Akkuma namni midhaan haamu tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">midhaan dhaabbatu walitti qabee irree isaatiin haamu sana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">kunis akkuma yeroo namni tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">Sulula Refaayim keessaa qarmii funaanuu ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Taʼus akkuma yeroo mukni ejersaa dhaʼamuutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">qarmii guuruun amma iyyuu jira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">fiixee ol aanu irratti gumaa lama yookaan sadiitu hafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">damee gad aanu irratti gumaa afur yookaan shantu hafa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">jedha Rabbii Allaahan, Allaahan Israaʼel.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Gaafas namoonni gara Uumaa isaanii ilaalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">ija isaaniis gara Qulqullicha Israaʼel deebifatu.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Isaan gara iddoo aarsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">gara hojii harka isaanii hin ilaalan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:8">isaan galma waaqeffannaa Aasheeraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">iddoo aarsaa ixaanaa kan quba isaaniitiin tolchanis <optbreak /> wayittuu hin lakkaaʼan.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Gaafas magaalaawwan jajjaboon isaan sababii Israaʼelootaatiif keessaa baʼan sun akkuma lafa bosona keessaa kan namni dhiisee deemee taʼu. Hundi ni onu.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Ati Fayyisaa kee, Allaah irraanfatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ati kattaa, daʼoo kee hin yaadanne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">Kanaafuu yoo biqiltuu akka malee gaarii dhaabbattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">muka wayinii kan alaa dhufe biqilfatte iyyuu,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />yoo guyyuma dhaabde sana akka inni biqilu goote iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">ganama yeroo dhaabdetti akka inni daraaru goota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">garuu guyyaa dhukkubaa fi dhibee hin fayyineetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">wayinichi homaa hin fayyadu.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Saboota baayʼee kanneen aaraniif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">Isaan akkuma galaana aaruutti aaru!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Saboota wacaniif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">Isaan akkuma bishaan guddaan huursutti huursu.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Saboonni akkuma huursaa bishaan cabsee deemuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">yoo huurse iyyuu yommuu inni isaanitti dheekkamu <optbreak /> isaan baqatanii badu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">akkuma habaqiin tulluu irraa fuula bubbee dura ariʼamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">akkuma awwaarri fuula bubbee hamaa duraa bittinnaaʼu <optbreak /> isaan ni bittinnaaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Galgala sodaan akkuma tasaa isaan qabatti!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">Isaan utuu lafti hin bariʼin ni dhabamu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Kun qooda warra nu boojiʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">hiree warra nu saamee ti.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Itoophiyaadhaan Mormu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Biyya lageen Itoophiyaatiin gamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">kan qoochoo isheetiin shaakkiftuuf wayyoo;<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />isheen galaana irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">bidiruu dhallaadduutiin ergamoota bishaan irra ergiti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 18:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Yaa ergamoota ariifattoota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">gara saba dhedheeroo kanneen gogaan isaanii lallaafuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">gara saba fagoo fi dhiʼoottis sodaatamuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">saba jabaa fi afaan isaa hin beekamne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">kan biyyi isaanii lageeniin gargar qoodamte sanaa dhaqaa.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Isin uummanni addunyaa hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">warri lafa irra jiraattan yeroo mallattoon gaara irratti <optbreak /> ol qabamu ni argitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">yeroo malakanni afuufamus <optbreak /> inuma dhageessu.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana naan jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">“Ani akkuma hoʼa ifa aduu keessatti calaqqisuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">akkuma duumessa fixeensaa kan hoʼa yeroo midhaan galchaniitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">calʼisee iddoo jireenya kootii nan ilaala.”<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Haamaa midhaaniitiin dura, yeroo hudhaan daraaree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">daraaraan sunis ija wayinii bilchaatee taʼutti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">inni billaa ittiin qoraniin lataa isaa ni ciccira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">damee babalʼates irraa murmuree ni balleessa.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Isaan hundinuu allaattii tulluu kan waa adamsuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">bineensota bosonaatiif dhiifamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">allaattiin bona guutuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">bineensonni bosonaas ganna guutuu isaan nyaatu.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Gaafas saba dhedheeroo kanneen gogaan isaanii lallaafu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">saba fagoo fi dhiʼoottis sodaatamu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">saba jabaa fi afaan isaa hin beekamne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">kan biyyi isaanii lageeniin gargar qoodamte irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuuf kennaan ni fidama;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 18:7">kennaan sunis gara Tulluu Xiyoon, iddoo Maqaan Rabbii Allaah Waan hunda dandaʼu jiraatutti ni fidama.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Gibxiin Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Raajii Gibxiin mormu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">kunoo Rabbii Allaahan duumessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">saffisaa yaabbatee gara Gibxi dhufaa jira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Waaqeffatamtoonni Gibxi tolfamoon fuula isaa duratti hollatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">garaan warra Gibxis isaan keessatti baqa.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />“Ani warra Gibxi walitti nan naqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">obboleessi obboleessa isaa, ollaan ollaa isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">magaalaan tokko magaalaa kaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">mootummaanis mootummaa kaan lola.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Hafuurri warra Gibxi isaan keessatti jeeqama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">anis karoora isaanii nan fashaleessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">isaanis waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo fi hafuurota warra duʼanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">ilaaltotaa fi eker dubbistoota gorsa gaafatu.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Anis dabarsee warra Gibxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">humna gooftaa garaa jabaatu tokkootti nan kenna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">mootiin hamaan tokkos isaan ni bulcha” jedha Gooftaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Bishaanonni galaanaa ni gogu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:5">lagni isaas ni hirʼata; ni gogas.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Burqaawwan isaa ni ajaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">lageen Gibxiis qalʼatanii gogu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">Shambaqqoo fi dhallaadduun ni coollagu;<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />biqiltuuwwan ededa Abbayyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">kanneen qarqara lagichaa jiranis ni coollagu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">Wanni laga Abbayyaa biratti facaafame hundi ni goga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">bubbeedhaan fudhatama; deebiʼees hin argamu.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Qurxummii qabdoonni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">warri hokkoo Abbayyaa keessa buusan <optbreak /> hundi aadanii booʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">warri kiyyoo bishaanitti darbatanis ni dadhabu.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Warri quncee talbaa iddame qopheessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">wayyaa dhooftonnis abdii kutatu.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Warri wayyaa dhaʼan mataa buusu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">warri mindaadhaan hojjetan hundis ni gaddu.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Qondaaltonni Zooʼaan gowwoota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">gorsitoonni Faraʼoon ogeeyyiinis <optbreak /> gorsa faayidaa hin qabne kennu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Isin akkamitti Faraʼooniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">“Ani namoota ogeeyyii keessaa tokkoo dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">ani barataa mootota durii ti” jechuu dandeessu?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Namoonni keessan ogeeyyiin amma eessa jiru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Mee isaan waan Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">Gibxiin mormuudhaan karoorfate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">isinitti haa himan; haa beeksisanis.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Qondaaltonni Zooʼaan gowwoota taʼaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">bulchitoonni Memfiis gowwoomfamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">gurguddoonni saba ishee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">Gibxiin karaa irraa jalʼisaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Rabbii Allaahan hafuura nama hadoochu isaanitti dhangalaaseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">isaan akkuma machaaʼaan tokko hoqqisaa gatantaru sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">biyya Gibxi waan isheen hojjettu hunda keessatti <optbreak /> gatantarsan.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Wanni mataan yookaan eegeen, dameen meexxii <optbreak /> yookaan shambaqqoon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">Gibxiif gochuu dandaʼan tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Bara sana warri Gibxi akka dubartii taʼu. Harka ol kaʼe kan Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu isaanitti ol fudhatu sana arganii sodaan ni hollatu. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Biyyi Yihuudaas warra Gibxi ni naasisa; namni maqaan Yihuudaa biratti dhaʼamu hundinuu sababii waan Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu isaanitti karoorfachaa jiru sanaatiif ni naʼa.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Gaafas biyya Gibxi keessatti magaalaawwan shan afaan Kanaʼaan dubbatu; isaanis Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuuf amanamoo taʼuuf ni kakatu. Isaan keessaa tokko Magaalaa Badiisaa jedhamti.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Gaafas wiirtuu Gibxi keessatti iddoon aarsaa tokko Rabbii Allaahaf ni hojjetama; daangaa biyyattii irrattis siidaan tokkoo Rabbii Allaahaf ni dhaabama. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Kunis biyya Gibxi keessatti Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuuf mallattoo fi dhuga baʼumsa taʼa. Yeroo isaan sababii cunqursitoota isaaniitiif gara Rabbii Allaahatti iyyatanitti, inni fayyisaa fi baraaraa tokko ergeefii isaan oolcha. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan warra Gibxitti of beeksisa; isaanis gaafas Rabbii Allaah ni beeku. Isaanis qalmaa fi kennaa midhaaniitiin waaqeffatu; Rabbii Allaahafis ni wareegu; wareega sanas ni baafatu. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Rabbii Allaahan biyya Gibxi ni rukuta; rukutees ni fayyisa. Isaan gara Rabbii Allaahatti ni deebiʼu; innis duʼaa isaaniitiif deebii kennee isaan fayyisa.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Gaafas Gibxii hamma Asooritti karaa guddaa tokkotu jiraata. Warri Asoor gara Gibxi, warri Gibxis gara Asoor ni dhaqu. Warri Gibxii fi warri Asoor walii wajjin ni waaqeffatu. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Israaʼel bara sana keessa Gibxii fi Asooritti dabalamtee sadaffaa taati; kunis lafa irratti eebba taʼa. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼus, “Gibxi sabni koo, Asoor hojiin harka kootii fi Israaʼel dhaalli koo haa eebbifaman” jedhee isaan eebbisa.<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Gibxii fi Itoophiyaadhaan Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Bara ajajaan muummichi Sargoon mooticha Asooriin ergame sun gara Ashdood dhufee lolee ishee qabate sana keessa, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />yeroodhuma sanatti Rabbii Allaahan karaa Isaayyaas ilma Amoosiitiin dubbate. Innis, “Uffata gaddaa dhagna kee irraa, kophees miilla kee irraa baasi” jedheen. Innis akkasuma godhe; qullaa fi miilla duwwaa asii fi achi deeme.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Kana irratti Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhe; “Akkuma garbichi koo Isaayyaas, akka Gibxii fi Itoophiyaaf mallattoo fi akeekkachiisa taʼuuf jedhee waggaa sadii qullaa fi miilla duwwaa deeme sana, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />akkasuma mootiin Asoor boojiʼamtoota Gibxii fi baqattoota Itoophiyaa dargaggeessaa fi jaarsa, qullaa fi miilla duwwaa hambisee teessuma isaanii illee qullaa godhee fudhatee deeme; kun warra Gibxiitiif qaanii dha. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Warri Itoophiyaa amanatanii Gibxiin boonan ni sodaatu; ni qaanaʼus. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Gaafas warri qarqara galaanaa irra jiraatan akkana jedhu; ‘Warra nu itti irkanne, warra mooticha Asoor jalaa nu baasu jennee gargaarsaaf itti baqanne sana irra waan gaʼe mee ilaalaa! Yoos nu akkamitti jalaa baʼuu dandeenya?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Baabiloniin Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Raajii Gammoojjii Galaana bira jirtuun mormu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Akkuma bubbeen hamaan biyya kibbaa haxaaʼu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">weeraraan tokko gammoojjiidhaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">biyya sodaachisaa keessaa ni dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Mulʼanni hamaan tokko natti mulʼateera:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">gantuun ni ganti; saamtuunis ni saamti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Yaa Eelaam, ol baʼi! Yaa Meedee marsii qabi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Ani aaduu isheen fidde hunda nan xumura.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Kana irratti dugdi na cite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">akkuma dubartii ciniinsifattuu muddamni na qabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">ani waanan dhagaʼeen nan holladhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">waanan argeenis nan raafame.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Qalbiin koo ni raafame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">sodaan na hollachiise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">dimimmisni ani hawwe sun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">sodaatti na jalaa geeddarame.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Isaan maaddii qopheessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">afaa diriirsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">ni nyaatu, ni dhugu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Isin qondaaltonni kaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">gaachanas zayitii dibaa.<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Gooftaan akkana naan jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">“Dhaqiitii eegduu tokko ramadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">innis waan argu haa himu.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Inni yommuu warra farda yaabbatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">kanneen lama lamaan yaaʼan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">warra harree yaabbatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">yookaan warra gaala yaabbatan argutti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">haa dammaqu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">guutumaan guutuutti haa dammaqu.”<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Eegduun sunis akkana jedhee iyye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">“Yaa gooftaa ko, ani guyyuma guyyaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">qooxii eegumsaa irra nan dhaabadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">halkan hundas ani hojii koo irra nan tura.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Kunoo, warri farda yaabbatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">lama lamaan dhufaa jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">inni akkana jedhee deebise:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">‘Baabilon jigdeerti; jigdeerti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Fakkiiwwan waaqeffatamtoota ishee hundinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">burkutaaʼanii lafa dhaʼaniiru!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Yaa saba koo warra oobdii midhaanii irratti dhaʼamtan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">ani waan Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Allaah Israaʼel irraa dhagaʼe isinittin hima.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raajii Edoomiin mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Raajii Duumaan mormu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Namni tokko Seeʼiirii na waamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">“Yaa eegduu, halkan kun bariʼuuf hammamtu hafe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Yaa eegduu, halkan kun bariʼuuf hammamtu hafe?” jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Eegduun sunis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">“Bariʼuu gaʼeera; garuu deebiʼee dhiʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Yoo gaafachuu barbaaddan gaafadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">garuu deebiʼaa kottaa” jedhee deebisa.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raajii Biyya Arabaatiin Mormu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Raajii biyya Arabaatiin mormu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Isin imaltoonni Dedaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">kanneen bosona Arabaa keessa qubattan,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />warra dheeboteef bishaan fidaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">isin warri Teemaa keessa jiraattan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">baqattootaaf waan nyaatan fidaa.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Isaan goraadee jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">goraadee luqqifame jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">xiyya aggaamame jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">hoʼa waraanaa jalaa baqataniiruutii.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Gooftaan akkana naan jedhe: “Akkuma waggoota hojjetaa qaxaramaa tokkootti ulfinni Qeedaar hundinuu waggaa tokko keessatti ni dhuma. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Warra xiyya darbatan keessaa kanneen hafan, gootonni Qeedaar muraasa taʼu.” Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Waaʼee Yerusaalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Raajii waaʼee Sulula Mulʼataa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Amma maaltu isin rakkisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:1">isin hundi fiixee manaatti ol baatan?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Yaa magaalaa wacaan guutamte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">yaa magaalaa jeeqamtuu fi fandalaltuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">namoonni si jalaa qalaman goraadeedhaan hin ajjeefamne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">yookaan waraana keessatti hin dhumne.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Hooggantoonni kee hundi walumaan baqatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">isaan utuma xiyya hin darbatin qabaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Isin utuma diinni fagoo jiruu baqattan iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">warri qabamtan hundi walumaan mana hidhaatti galfamtaniirtu.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Kanaafuu ani, “Ana irraa garagalaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">ani hiqqifadhee nan booʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Badiisa saba koo irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">na jajjabeessuu hin yaalinaa” nan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">Sulula Mulʼataa keessatti, guyyaa jeequmsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">dhidhiitamuutii fi burjaajii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">akkasumas guyyaa itti dallaa diiguutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">tulluuwwanittis iyyuu qaba.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Eelaam manʼee xiyyaa qabattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">gaariiwwanii fi abbootii fardaa fudhattee baati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">Qiiris gaachana ishee qabatti.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Sululawwan kee filatamoon gaariiwwaniin guutamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">abbootiin fardaas karra magaalattii irratti ramadamaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Gooftaan ittisa Yihuudaa irraa mulqeera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">Atis gaafas miʼa lolaa kan Masaraa Bosonaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">keessa jiru sana abdatta.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Dallaan Magaalaa Daawud</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">karaa baayʼee akka urame argitaniirtu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:9">Haroo Gad aanaa keessattis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">bishaan kuufattaniirtu.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Isin manneen Yerusaalem lakkooftan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">dallaa ishee dhagaa jabeessuuf jettaniis manneen sana diigdan.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Bishaan Haroo Moofaatiif dallaa lamaan gidduutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">kuusaa bishaanii tolchitan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:11">garuu isin gara Isa waan sana hojjetee hin ilaalle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">yookaan Isa bara dheeraan dura waan sana karoorseef <optbreak /> ulfina hin kennine.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">akka ati boossee wawwaattuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">akka ati rifeensa mataa keetii of irraa cirtee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">wayyaa gaddaa uffatuuf guyyaa sana si waame.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Qooda kanaa garuu gammachuu fi fandalaluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">loon gorraʼuu fi hoolota qaluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">foon nyaachuu fi daadhii wayinii dhuguutu jira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">Isin, “Kottaa ni nyaannaa; ni dhugnas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">bor ni duunaatii!” jettu.<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu utuma gurri koo dhagaʼuu waan kana naa ibse: “Hamma guyyaa duʼa keessaniitti cubbuun kun isin irraa hin haqamu” jedha Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:15">“Dhaqiitii itti gaafatamaa kanaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:15">Shebnaa, bulchaa masaraa mootummaatiin akkana jedhi:<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />Ati maal asii hojjetta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">Akka ati iddoo kanatti iddoo qabrii qopheeffattu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:16">akka iddoo ol kaʼaa irratti boolla qabrii keetii qotattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">akka kattaa keessatti iddoo boqonnaa keetii tolchattu <optbreak /> eenyutu eeyyama siif kenne?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />“Yaa nama jabaa kunoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">Rabbii Allaahan jabeessee qabee si darbachuuf jira.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Inni akkuma kubbaa furuursee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">biyya balʼaa tokko keessa si buusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:18">Yaa salphina mana gooftaa keetii, ati achitti duuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">gaariiwwan kee mimmiidhagoonis achitti hafu!<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Ani aangoo kee irraa sin buusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">atis taayitaa kee irraa ni ariʼamta.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />“Ani gaafas garbicha koo Eliiyaaqiimin ilma Hilqiyaa nan waama. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Ani uffata kee isatti nan uffisa; sabbata kee mudhii isaatti nan hidha; aangoo kees dabarsee isaaf nan kenna. Inni warra Yerusaalem keessa jiraatanii fi mana Yihuudaatiif abbaa ni taʼa. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Ani furtuu mana Daawud gatiittii isaa irra nan kaaʼa; waan inni banu namni tokko iyyuu cufuu hin dandaʼu; waan inni cufus namni tokko iyyuu banuu hin dandaʼu. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Ani akkuma fannoo waa itti fannisan tokkootti iddoo jabaa irra isa nan dhaaba; innis mana abbaa isaatiif teessoo ulfinaa ni taʼa. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Isaanis kabaja mana abbaa isaa hunda, ijoollee isaatii fi ijoollee ijoollee isaa, miʼa xixinnaa kan waciitiidhaa jalqabee hamma okkoteetti jiru hunda isatti fannisu.”<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedha; “Gaafas qofoon iddoo jabaa dhaabame sun ni buqqaʼa; muramee lafa buʼa; baʼaan isatti fannifame sun harcaʼee caccaba.” Rabbii Allaahan waan kana dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Raajii Waaʼee Xiiroos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Raajii waaʼee Xiiroos:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Yaa dooniiwwan Tarshiishi wawwaadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">Xiiroos barbadooftee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">mana yookaan buufata doonii malee hafteertii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Biyya Qophroos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">oduun isaan qaqqabeera.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Isin jiraattoonni qarqara galaanaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">daldaltoonni Siidoonaa, warri galaana irra marmaaran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">isin sooromsan calʼisaa.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Midhaan Shihoor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">bishaanota gurguddaa irraan dhufe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">oomishni Abbayyaa Xiiroosiif galii ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">isheenis lafa gabaa kan sabootaa taate.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Yaa Siidoonaa, yaa daʼannoo galaanaa qaanaʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">galaanni akkana jedhee dubbateeraatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">“Ani hin ciniinsifanne yookaan hin deenye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">ilmaan hin horanne yookaan intallan hin guddifanne.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Yeroo oduun gara Gibxi dhufutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">isaan gabaasa Xiiroos irraa dhufuun ni dhiphatu.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Isin gara Tarshiishitti ceʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">yaa warra qarqara galaanaa jiraattan wawwaadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Magaalaa dulloomtuun durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">kan miilli ishee ishee fuudhee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">akka isheen biyya fagoo keessa qubattuuf ishee geesse kun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">magaalaa kee ishee fandalaltuudhaa?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Xiiroos ishee gonfoo nama gonfachiiftu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">kan daldaltoonni ishee ilmaan moototaa taʼan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">kan daldaltoonni ishee lafa irratti kabajamoo taʼanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">eenyutu waan kana karoorfate?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">of jaja ishee kan ulfina ishee hunda keessa jiru gad deebisuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">warra lafa irratti kabajaman hunda salphisuuf <optbreak /> waan kana karoorfateera.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Yaa Intala Tarshiish,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">ati siʼachi buufata doonii hin qabaattuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">lafa kee hamma Abbayyaa bira gaʼutti qotadhu.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Rabbii Allaahan harka isaa galaana irra qabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">mootummoota hollachiiseera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Inni akka daʼannoowwan ishee diigamaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">waaʼee Kanaʼaan ajaja kenneera.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Innis akkana jedha; “Yaa Durba Siidoonaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">ati kana caalaa hin fandalaltu!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 23:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">“Kaʼiitii gara Qophiroositti ceʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">ati achitti iyyuu boqonnaa hin argattu.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Mee biyya Baabilonotaa ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">uummanni kun amma seenaa hin qabu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">Warri Asoor akka isheen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">iddoo jireenya uumamawwan gammoojjii taatu godhan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">isaan siree eegumsaa ijaarratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">daʼannoowwan ishee qullaa hambisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">ishees ni barbadeessan.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Yaa dooniiwwan Tarshiish wawwaadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:14">daʼannoon keessan barbadeeffameeraatii!<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Yeroo sanaa jalqabee Xiiroos hamma waggaa torbaatamaatti ni dagatamti; kunis bara jireenya mootii tokkoo ti. Dhuma waggaa torbaatamman sanaatti garuu akkuma sirba sagaagaltuu tokkoof sirbame sanaatti Xiiroos irra gaʼa:<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />“Yaa sagaagaltuu irraanfatamtuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">baganaa qabadhuutii magaalaa keessa naannaʼi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">ati akka yaadatamtuuf baganaa sirriitti rukuti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">sirba baayʼee sirbi.”<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Dhuma waggaa torbaatamaatti Rabbii Allaahan Xiiroosin ni yaadata; isheenis gara daldala isheetti deebitee mootummoota fuula lafaa irra jiran hunda wajjin sagaagalti. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Taʼus buʼaan isheetii fi wanni isheen argattu Rabbii Allaahaf addaan baafama; hin kuufamu; walittis hin qabamu. Buʼaan ishees warra fuula Allaaha dura jiraataniif nyaata gaʼaa fi uffata babbareedaa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Rabbii Allaahan Lafa Ni barbadeessa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Kunoo, Rabbii Allaahan lafa ni onsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">ishees ni barbadeessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:1">inni ishee gaggaragalchee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">warra ishee irra jiraatan bittinneessa;<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Kan saba irra gaʼu luba irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kan garbicha irra gaʼu gooftaa irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kan garbittii irra gaʼu giiftii irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kan bitataa irra gaʼu gurgurataa irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kan isa ergifatu irra gaʼu, isa ergisu irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">kan liqeeffataa irra gaʼu, isa liqeessu ni gaʼaatii.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Lafti guutumaan guutuutti ni onti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">guutumaan guutuuttis ni saamamti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:3">Rabbii Allaahan waan kana dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Lafti ni gogdi; bifti ishees ni geeddarama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">addunyaan ni bututti; bifti ishees ni geeddarama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">gurguddoonni saba lafaas ni bututu.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Lafti saba isheetiin xuroofteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">isaan seeraaf ajajamuu didan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">sirnaan buluu didanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">kakuu bara baraa sana cabsaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Kanaafuu abaarsi lafa balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">sabni ishees balleessaa isaatiif adabama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">Kanaafuu jiraattonni lafaa ni gubatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">nama muraasatu hafa.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Daadhiin wayinii haaraan ni goga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">mukni wayiniis ni coollaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">warri gammadan hundinuu ni aadu.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Dibbeen sagaleen isaa namatti tolu ni calʼisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">wacni fandalaltootaa qabbanaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">baganaan nama gammachiisus calʼiseera.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Isaan siʼachi sirbaa daadhii wayinii hin dhugan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">dhugaatiin jabaan warra isa dhuganitti ni hadhaaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Magaalaan diigamte sun ontee hafti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:10">akka namni tokko iyyuu ol hin seenneef manni hundi ni cufama.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Isaan daadhii wayinii dhabanii daandii irratti booʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">gammachuun hundi gaddatti geeddarama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">ililchuun hundis lafa irraa dhabama.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Magaalaan sun diigamtee hafti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:12">karri ishees ni caccaba.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Akkuma yeroo mukni ejersaa dhaʼamuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">akkuma yeroo wayiniin galfamutti qarmiin hafu taʼu sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">lafa irratti saboota gidduuttis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">akkasuma ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Isaan sagalee ol fudhatanii gammachuun iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">gama lixa biiftuutti ulfina Rabbii Allaah labsu.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Kanaafuu isin baʼa biiftuu irraa Rabbii Allaahaf ulfina kennaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">qarqara galaanaattis maqaa Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">Allaah Israaʼel leellisaa.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Nu moggaa lafaa irraa faarfannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">“Isa qajeelaa sanaaf ulfinni haa taʼu” jedhu dhageenya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Ani garuu akkanan jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">“Ani bade, ani bade! Anaaf wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Gantoonni ni ganu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Gantoonni gantummaa isaaniitiin ganu!”<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Yaa uummata lafa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">sodaan, qilee fi kiyyoon si eeggatu.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Namni sagalee goolii baqatu kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">qilee keessa buʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">namni qilee keessaa ol baʼu kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">kiyyoodhaan qabama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Foddaan shamaayʼuniiwwanii banameeraatii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">hundeewwan lafaa ni raafamu.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Lafti baqaqxeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">lafti gargar baateerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">lafti akka malee raafamteerti;<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Lafti akkuma nama machaaʼee gatantarti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">isheen akkuma daasii bubbeedhaan raafamti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">yakki fincila ishee akka malee itti ulfaateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">isheen ni jigdi; deebitees hin kaatu.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Rabbii Allaahan gaafas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">humnoota Shamaayʼunii, shamaayʼun irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">mootota lafaa immoo lafa irratti ni adaba.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Isaan akkuma hidhamtootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">boolla keessaatti walitti qabamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">manni hidhaa itti cufamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">guyyaa hedduu booddee adabamu.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Jiʼi ni burjaajofti; aduunis ni qaanofti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Tulluun Xiyoon irrattii fi Yerusaalem keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">fuula maanguddootaa duratti ulfinaan ni moʼaatii.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Rabbii Allaahaf Galata Galchuu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Rabbii Allaah, ati Allaah koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">waan ati amanamummaa kee kan mudaa hin qabneen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">wantoota dinqisiisoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">bara dheeraan dura karoorfame hojjetteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">ani ulfina siif nan kenna; maqaa kees nan leellisa.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Ati magaalaa sana tuullaa dhagaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">magaalaa dallaa jajjabaa qabdu immoo diigamaa goote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">magaalaan daʼannoo Namoota Ormaa turte sun <optbreak /> siʼachi hin jiraattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">isheen gonkumaa deebitee hin ijaaramtu.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Kanaafuu namoonni jajjaboon si kabaju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">magaalaawwan saboota gara jabeeyyii si sodaatu.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Ati hiyyeeyyiif lafa itti baqatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">rakkataaf immoo dhiphina isaa keessatti daʼoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">bubbee hamaa jalaa iddoo itti baqatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">hoʼa jalaa immoo iddoo itti qabbaneeffatu turte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Hafuurri gara jabeeyyiin baafatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">akkuma bubbee hamaa dallaa dhagaa dhaʼuutii fi<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />akkuma hoʼa gammoojjii ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Ati waca alagootaa ni calʼisiifta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">akkuma hoʼi gaaddisa duumessaatiin qabbanaaʼu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">sirbi gara jabeeyyiis ni qabbanaaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">tulluu kana irratti uummata hundaaf cidha nyaata gaarii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:6">affeerraa daadhii wayinii gogee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">foon coomaa fi daadhii wayinii filatamaa ni qopheessa.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Inni tulluu kana irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">haguuggii uummata hundatti haguugame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:7">golgaa saba hundatti golgame ni balleessa;<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />inni bara baraan duʼa ni liqimsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan fuula hunda irraa imimmaan ni haqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">inni lafa hunda irratti salphina saba isaa ni balleessa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">Rabbii Allaahan waan kana dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Isaan gaafas akkana jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">“Dhugumaan kun Allaah keenya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">nu isa amananne; innis nu oolche.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Kun Rabbii Allaah dha; nu isa amananne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">kottaa fayyisuu isaatti gammannaa; ni ililchinas.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Harki Rabbii Allaah tulluu kana irra ni boqota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">Moʼaab garuu akkuma cidiin dikee keessatti dhidhiitamu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">isa jalatti dhidhiitama.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Innis akkuma namni bishaan daaku tokko daakuuf harka balʼifatu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">gaara sana irratti harka isaa ni balʼifata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:11">Allaahanis of tuulummaa isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">ogummaa harka isaanii wajjin gad deebisa.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Inni dallaa kee ol dheeraa dhagaan ijaarame sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">akka inni duufu godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">lafatti gad jigsees biyyootti dabala.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Faarfannaa Galataa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Bara sana faarfannaan kun biyya Yihuudaa keessatti faarfatama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Nu magaalaa jabaa qabna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Allaahanis fayyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">dallaa eegumsa isheetii fi daʼannoo ishee taasisa.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Akka sabni qajeelaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">sabni amanamummaadhaan jiraatu ol seenuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">karrawwan banaa.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Inni sitti irkateeraatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">nama yaadni garaa isaa si wajjin jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">ati nagaa hirʼina hin qabneen isa eegda.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan, Rabbii Allaahan mataan isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">Kattaa bara baraa taʼeef, bara baraan Rabbii Allaah amanadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Inni warra iddoo ol kaʼaa irra jiraatan gad qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">magaalaa tabba irra jirtu gad buusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">lafatti gatees awwaaratti ishee maka.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Miilli, miilli warra hacuucamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">faanni hiyyeeyyii ishee dhidhiita.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Daandiin nama qajeelaa wal qixxaataa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">yaa Isa Tolaa, ati qajeeltotaaf karaa baafta.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Rabbii Allaah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">nu karaa seera keetii irra deemaa si eegganna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">maqaan keetii fi beekamuun kee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">hawwii garaa keenyaa ti.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Halkan lubbuun koo si yaaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">ganamas hafuurri koo baayʼisee si barbaada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Yeroo murtiin kee gara lafaa dhufutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">uummanni addunyaa qajeelummaa barata.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Namni hamaan gara laafinni godhamuuf iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">qajeelummaa hin baratu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">biyya qajeelummaan jirutti iyyuu inni ittuma fufee jalʼina hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">surraa Rabbii Allaahas hin hubatu.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Rabbii Allaah, harki kee ol kaafameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">isaan garuu isa hin argan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Isaan hinaaffaa ati saba keetiif qabdu arganii haa qaanaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">ibiddi diinota keetiif kuufame sun isaan haa balleessu.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Rabbii Allaah, ati nagaa nuuf kenniteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">ati hojii keenya hunda nuuf hojjetteertaatii.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Yaa Rabbii Allaah keenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">si malee gooftonni biraa nu bulchaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">nu garuu maqaa kee qofa ulfeessina.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Isaan amma duʼaniiru; siʼachi hin jiraatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">isaan gaaddidduu dha; deebiʼaniis hin kaʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Ati isaan adabde; isaan balleessites;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">yaadannoo isaanii hundas ni barbadeessite.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Rabbii Allaah, ati saba baayʼisteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">ati saba baayʼisteerta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">ati ofii keetiif ulfina argatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">daarii biyyaa hunda balʼifteerta.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Rabbii Allaah, isaan yeroo dhiphinaatti si barbaaddatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">yeroo ati isaan adabdetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">isaan duʼaa gad roobsan.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Akkuma dubartiin ulfaa yeroo daʼuu geessutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">ciniinsuudhaan wixxirfattee iyyitu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">yaa Rabbii Allaah, nus fuula kee duratti akkasuma taaneerra.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Nu ulfoofnee, ciniinsuudhaan wixxirfanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">nu garuu bubbee deenye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Nu lafaaf fayyina hin fidne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">nu uummata addunyaa hin deenye.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Garuu namoonni kee kanneen duʼan ni jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">dhagni isaaniis duʼaa ni kaʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Isin warri biyyoo keessa jiraattan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">dammaqaatii gammachuudhaan ililchaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Fixeensi kee akkuma fixeensa ganamaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">laftis warra duʼan of keessaa baafti.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Yaa saba ko, kutaa mana keetti ol galiitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">duubaan balbala ofitti cufi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">hamma dheekkamsi isaa darbutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">yeroo muraasaaf of dhoksi.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Kunoo, Rabbii Allaahan sababii cubbuu isaaniitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">uummata lafa irraa adabuuf <optbreak /> iddoo jireenya isaatii baʼee dhufaa jira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Lafti dhiiga ishee irratti dhangalaafame sana ifa baafti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">siʼachi warra ishee irratti qalaman hin dhoksitu.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Furamuu Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Bara sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Rabbii Allaahan goraadee isaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">goraadee isaa sodaachisaa, guddaa fi jabaa sanaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Lewaataan boficha mirmirfamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">Lewaataan boficha marmaramu sana ni adaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">inni jawwee galaana keessa jiraatu ni kukkuta.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Bara sana akkana jedhama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:2">“Waaʼee iddoo dhaabaa wayinii kan namatti tolu sanaa faarfadhaa;<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />ani Rabbii Allaahan isa nan eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">ani yeroo hunda bishaan nan obaasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">akka namni tokko iyyuu isa hin miineef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">ani halkanii fi guyyaa isa nan eega.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Ani hin aaru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Sokorruu fi qoraattiin waraanaaf utuu natti baʼanii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">Ani silaa isaanitti nan duula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">walitti qabees isaan nan guba.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Yoo kanaa achii isaan kooluu natti haa galan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">isaan na wajjin nagaa haa uuman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">eeyyee, isaan na wajjin nagaa haa uuman.”<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Bara dhufuuf jiru keessa Yaaʼikuub hidda baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">Israaʼel latee daraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">ijaanis addunyaa hunda guuta.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Rabbii Allaahan akkuma warra ishee rukutan sana rukute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">ishee illee rukuteeraa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:7">Akkuma warri ishee ajjeesan sun ajjeefaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">isheenis ajjeefamteertii?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Ati waraanuu fi ariʼuudhaan isheedhaan wal falmite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">inni guyyaa bubbeen baʼaa bubbisutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">bubbee isaa sodaachisaa sanaan ishee balleessa.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Yommuu inni dhagoota iddoo aarsaa hunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">akkuma dhagaa nooraa caccabsamee godhutti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">siidaan asheeraa yookaan iddoon aarsaa ixaanaa tokko iyyuu <optbreak /> dhaabatee hin hafu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">Akkasiinis balleessaan Yaaʼikuub ni haqamaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">kunis cubbuun isaa guutumaan guutuutti haqamuu isaa mirkaneessa.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Magaalaan dallaa jabaa qabdu ni onti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">akka gammoojjii gatamteetii fi dhiifamtee taati;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">jabboonni achi dheeddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">achis ni ciciifti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">jabboonni damee ishee qorqanii qullaa hambisu.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Dameen ishee yeroo gogutti irraa caccaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">dubartoonnis dhufanii ibiddatti naqatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Uummanni kun hubannaa hin qabuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">kanaafuu Tolchaan isaanii garaa hin laafuuf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">Uumaan isaaniis isaaniif hin araaramu.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Bara sana Rabbii Allaahan Laga Efraaxiisii hamma laga Gibxitti midhaan dhaʼa; yaa Israaʼeloota, isin tokko tokkoon walitti ni qabamtu. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Bara sana malakanni guddaan tokko ni afuufama. Warri Asoor keessatti badanii turanii fi warri Gibxi keessatti faffacaʼanii turan dhufanii tulluu qulqulluu irratti Yerusaalem keessatti Rabbii Allaah waaqeffatu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Hooggantoota Efreemiif Wayyoo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Gonfoo of tuulummaa kan machooftota Efreem sanaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">daraaraa coollagu kan ulfina miidhagina isaaniitiif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">kan mataa sulula gabbataa irra jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">magaalaa warra daadhii wayiniitiin fudhataman <optbreak /> sanaatiif wayyoo!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Kunoo, Gooftaan isa humna qabeessaa fi jabaa tokko qaba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">Inni akkuma cabbiitii fi bubbee waa balleessuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">akkuma bokkaa jabaatii fi bishaan guutee irra dhangalaʼuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">humnaan lafatti gad ishee darbata.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Gonfoon of tuulummaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">machooftonni Efreem miilla jalatti dhidhiitamu.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Daraaraan harcaʼu, miidhaginni isaa kabajamaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">kan mataa sulula gabbataa irra jiru sun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">akkuma muka harbuu utuu bonni hin gaʼin bilchaatu sanaa taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">namni isa argu hundi akkuma isa harka keessa galfateen <optbreak /> isa nyaatee fixa.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Bara sana Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">hambaa saba isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:5">gonfoo ulfinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">miʼa miidhaginaa ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Inni nama murtii kennuuf taaʼuuf hafuura murtii qajeelaa taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">warra karra irraa waraana deebisaniif immoo <optbreak /> madda jabinaa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Jarri kuni daadhii wayiniitiin gatantaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">dhugaatii jabaadhaan dogoggoru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">luboonnii fi nabiiʼiyyoonni dhugaatii jabaadhaan gatantaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">daadhii wayiniitiin fudhatamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">isaan dhugaatii jabaadhaan karaa irraa badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">yeroo mulʼata arganittis ni dogoggoru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">yeroo murtii kennanittis ni dogoggoru.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Maaddiin hundinuu diddigaan guutameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">iddoon hin xureeffamin tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />“Namni inni waa barsiisuu yaalu kun eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">Inni eenyuuf ergaa isaa ibsaa jira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Ijoollee aannan dhiifteef moo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">ijoollee harma guuteef?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Ajaja irratti ajaja; ajaja irratti ajaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">sirna irratti sirna; sirna irratti sirna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">asitti muraasa; achitti muraasa” taʼaatii.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Yoos Allaahan afaan alagootaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">afaan hin beekamneenis saba kanatti ni dubbata;<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />inni akkana isaaniin jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">“Kun iddoo boqonnaa ti; warri dadhaban haa boqotan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">kun iddoo aara galfannaa ti.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">Isaan garuu dhagaʼuu didan.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Yoo akkasii dubbiin Rabbii Allaah akkana isaanitti taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">ajaja irratti ajaja; ajaja irratti ajaja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">sirna irratti sirna; sirna irratti sirna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">asitti muraasa; achitti muraasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">kunis akka isaan dhaqanii dugda duubatti kufanii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">akka isaan caccabanii kiyyoodhaan qabamaniif.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Kanaafuu isin qoostonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">warri uummata Yerusaalem bulchitan dubbii <optbreak /> Rabbii Allaah dhagaʼaa.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Isin akkana jettanii of tuultu; “Nu duʼa wajjin kakuu galleerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">siiʼool wajjinis walii galtee gooneerra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Sababii nu soba daʼoo godhannee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">sobas iddoo itti dhokannu godhanneef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">balaan hamaan yeroo dhufee lafa balleessutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">nu tuquu hin dandaʼu.”<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">“Kunoo ani dhagaa tokko, dhagaa qoratame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">dhagaa golee gati jabeessa tokko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">hundee mirkanaaʼaadhaaf Xiyoon keessa nan kaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">namni amanu kam iyyuu hin qaanaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Ani murtii qajeelaa funyoo ittiin safaran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">qajeelummaa immoo madaalii nan godhadha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">soba isin daʼoo godhattan sana bokkaan jabaan ni balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">bishaanis lafa isin itti dhokattan keessa ni lolaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Kakuun isin duʼa wajjin godhattan ni diigama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">walii galteen isin siiʼool wajjin godhattanis <optbreak /> ni barbadeeffama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Yeroo balaan hamaan dhufee lafa balleessutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">isin lafatti gad dhidhiitamtu.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Inni yeroo dhufu hunda isin fudhatee deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">ganama ganama halkanii fi guyyaas, <optbreak /> inni waa balleessa.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 28:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Ergaa kana hubachuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">naasuu guddaa namatti fida.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Sireen irratti diriirfachuuf baayʼee gabaabaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">uffata halkanii ofitti marachuuf baayʼee dhiphaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Rabbii Allaahan hojii isaa, hojii isaa haaraa sana hojjechuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">gocha isaa, gocha isaa kan hin beekamne sana hojjechuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">akkuma Tulluu Pheraaziim keessatti godhe sana ni kaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">akkuma Sulula Gibeʼoonitti godhe sana ni kaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Amma qoosaa keessan dhiisaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">yoo akkas hin taʼin foncaan keessan isinitti jabaata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Gooftaan, Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">labsii guutummaa biyyattii balleessuuf labse natti himeera.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Dhaggeeffadhaatii sagalee koo dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:23">qalbeeffadhaatii waan ani dubbadhu dhagaʼaa.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Qonnaan bulaan tokko yeroo sanyii facaasuuf lafa qotatutti, <optbreak /> ittuma fufee qotaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">Inni ittuma fufee biyyoo caccabsee bulleessaa?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Inni yeroo lafa wal qixxeessutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">dimbilaalaa fi kamuunii hin facaasuu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Inni qamadii toora tooraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">garbuu iddoo isaa irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">honboriis lafa qotiisaa isaa irratti hin facaasuu?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Allaahan isaa isa barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:26">karaa qajeelaa irras isa buusa.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Abasuudni gangalchaadhaan hin dhaʼamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">kamuunii irras gommaan gaarii hin oofamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">abasuudni uleedhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">insilaalli immoo shimalaan dhaʼama.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Midhaan buddeena tolchuuf daakamuu qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">kanaafuu namni tokko bara baraan midhaan hin dhaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">Inni gommaa gaarii kan midhaan dhaʼu midhaan sana irra oofu iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">fardeen isaa midhaanicha hin bulleessan.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Wanni kun hundinuu Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">isa mariidhaan dinqisiisaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">ogummaadhaanis guddaa taʼe biraa dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Magaalaa Daawudiif Wayyoo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Yaa Ariiʼeel, yaa Ariiʼeel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">magaalaa Daawud keessa jiraate, siif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Waggaa irratti waggaa dabalaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">ayyaanonni waggaas ittuma haa fufan.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Taʼus ani Ariiʼeelin marsee nan qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">isheen boossee ni wawwaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">isheen anaaf akka Ariiʼeel taati.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Ani karaa hundaan naannoo kee nan qubadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">gamoowwaniinis sin marsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">tuullaa biyyoos sitti naannessee nan dhaaba.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Ati gad deebifamtee lafa irraa ni dubbatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">haasaan kee biyyoo keessaa guunguma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">Sagaleen kee akka sagalee ekeraa lafa keessaa baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">haasaan kees biyyoo keessaa hasaasa.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Diinonni kee hedduun garuu akka awwaara bullaaʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">gara jabeeyyiin baayʼeenis akka habaqii bubbeen fudhatee taʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">Akkuma tasaa utuu hin beekaminis,<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:6">bakakkaadhaan, sochii lafaatii fi waca guddaadhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">bubbeedhaan, bubbee hamaa fi arraba ibidda waa fixuutiin ni dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Ergasii tuunni saboota hundaa kan Ariiʼeeliin lolu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">kan ishee fi daʼoo ishee jajjaboo dhaʼee marsee qabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">akkuma abjuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">akkuma mulʼata halkan keessaa taʼa;<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />kunis akkuma namni beelaʼe tokko akka waa nyaachaa jiru abjuudhaan argee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">yeroo dammaqutti garuu amma illee beela qabu sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">yookaan akkuma namni dheebote tokko akka waa dhugaa jiru abjuudhaan argee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">yeroo dammaqutti garuu amma illee dheebuudhaan gaggabu sana taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Tuuta saboota hundaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">kan Tulluu Xiyoon lolu irrattis akkasuma taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Rifadhaa; dinqisiifadhaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">of jaamsaatii nama waa hin argine taʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">machaaʼaa; garuu daadhii wayiniitiin hin taʼin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">gatantaraa; garuu dhugaatii jabaadhaan hin taʼin.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Rabbii Allaahan hirriba cimaa isinitti buuseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">ija keessan nabiiʼiyyoota, cufeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">mataa keessan ilaaltootas, haguugeera.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Mulʼanni kun hundi isiniif dubbii kitaaba maramaa irratti chaappeffame malee homaa miti. Yoo isin kitaaba kana nama dubbisuu dandaʼu tokkotti kennitanii, “Maaloo mee waan kana dubbisi” jettaniin inni, “Sababii kitaabichi chaappeffameef ani dubbisuu hin dandaʼu” jedhee deebisa. <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Yookaan yoo isin kitaaba maramaa kana nama dubbisuu hin dandeenye tokkotti kennitanii, “Maaloo mee waan kana dubbisi” jettaniin inni, “Ani akkamitti akkan dubbisu hin beeku” jedhee deebisa.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Gooftaan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">“Uummanni kun afaan isaatiin natti dhiʼaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">hidhii isaatiinis na kabaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">garaan isaa garuu narraa fagoo jira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">waaqeffannaan isaan na waaqeffatanis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">seera namni barsiisu qofaan tolfame.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Kanaafuu ani amma illee dinqii irratti dinqii dabalee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">uummata kana nan dinqisiisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">ogummaan nama ogeessaa ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">hubannaan hubattootaas ni dhokata.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Warra karoora isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">Rabbii Allaah duraa dhokfachuuf jedhanii <optbreak /> qileetti gad buʼaniif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">warra hojii isaanii dukkana keessatti hojjetanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">“Eenyutu nu arga? Eenyutu beeka?” <optbreak /> jedhanii yaadaniif wayyoo!<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Kun jalʼina keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">suphee dhooftuu akka supheetti ilaaltu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Wanni tolchame tokko nama isa tolcheen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">“Inni na hin tolchine” jedhaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Okkoteen tokko suphee dhooftuudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">“Inni homaa hin beeku” jechuu dandaʼaa?<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Libaanoon yeroo gabaabaa keessatti <optbreak /> lafa qotiisaa gabbatte hin taatuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">Lafti qonnaa gabbataan sunis bosona hin fakkaattuu?<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Gaafas duudaan dubbii kitaaba maramaa ni dhagaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">iji nama jaamaa dimimmisaa fi dukkana keessatti ni arga.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Namni gad of qabu ammas Rabbii Allaahatti ni gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">rakkattoonnis Qulqullicha Israaʼel sanaan ni gammadu.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Gara jabeeyyiin ni badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">warri namatti qoosan ni barbadaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">warri hammina hojjechuu jaallatan hundinuu ni balleeffamu;<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />warri dubbiin yakkamaa nama godhan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">warri namicha mana murtiitti namaaf falmu dura kiyyoo kaaʼanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:21">sobaan dhugaa baʼuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">murtii qajeelaa nama yakka hin qabnee jalʼisan ni balleeffamu.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan inni Ibraahimin fure sun mana Yaaʼikuubiin akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">“Yaaʼikuub siʼachi deebiʼee hin qaanaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">fuulli isaas siʼachi hin dukkanaaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Isaan yeroo gidduu isaaniitti ijoollee isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">hojii harka kootii sana arganitti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">maqaa koo ni qulqulleessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">isaan qulqullummaa Qulqullicha Yaaʼikuub ni beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">Allaah Israaʼelis sodaachuudhaan ni jiraatu.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Warri dogoggoran hubannaa ni argatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">warri guungumanis qajeelfama ni fudhatu.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Saba Fincilaadhaaf Wayyoo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">“Ijoollee fincilan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">kanneen karoora karoora koo hin taʼin duukaa buʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">kanneen fedhii kootiin alatti walii galtee uuman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">kanneen cubbuu irratti cubbuu dabalaniif wayyoo;<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />kanneen utuu anaan hin mariʼatin Gibxitti gad buʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">kanneen gaaddisa Gibxi daʼoof,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">eegumsa Faraʼoon immoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">gargaarsaaf abdataniif wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Eegumsi Faraʼoon garuu qaanii isinitti taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">gaaddisni Gibxis salphina isinitti fida.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Isaan yoo Zooʼaan keessatti qondaaltota qabaatan iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">yoo ergamoonni isaaniis Haanees gaʼan iyyuu,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />tokkoon tokkoon isaanii sababii uummata isaan hin fayyadne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">kanneen qaanii fi salphina malee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">gargaarsa yookaan buʼaa hin kennine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">sanaatiif ni qaaneffamu.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Raajii waaʼee bineensota Negeeb dubbatame:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Ergamoonni qabeenya isaanii harreetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">meeshaa isaanii gaalatti feʼatanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">biyya leenci kormii fi leenci dhalaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">bofti summii qabuu fi bofti darbatamu jiraatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">lafa rakkinaa fi dhiphinaan guute keessa baʼanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">gara biyya homaa hin fayyadnee<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />gara Gibxi kan gargaarsi ishee gonkumaa buʼaa hin qabne sanaa dhaqu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">Kanaafuu ani, “Raʼaab, kan homaa hin fayyadne”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">jedhee ishee nan waama.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Amma dhaqiitii gabatee irratti barreessiif;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">kitaaba maramaa irratti katabiif;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">kunis akka baroota dhufuuf jiran keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">dhuga baʼumsa bara baraa taʼuuf.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Jarri kunneen uummata fincilaa, ijoollee sobduu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">ijoollee seera Rabbii Allaah dhagaʼuuf fedhii hin qabnee dha.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Isaan mulʼata argitootaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Siʼachi mulʼata tokko illee hin arginaa!” jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">nabiiʼiyyootaanis akkana jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Isin siʼachi mulʼata qajeelaa taʼe nutti hin himinaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Waan nama gammachiisu nutti himaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">gowwoomsaa nuuf raajaa.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Karaa kana gad dhiisaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">daandii kana irraa jalʼadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:11">Qulqullicha Israaʼel fuula keenya duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">dhabamsiisaa!” jedhu.<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Kanaafuu Qulqullichi Israaʼel akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">“Sababii isin ergaa kana diddanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">nama hacuucuu abdattanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">gowwoomsaatti irkattaniif,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />cubbuun kun, akkuma dallaa ol dheeraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">dhagaan ijaarame kan baqaqee bosose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">kan utuu hin beekamin tasa jiguu isinitti taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Dallaan sun akkuma miʼa supheetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">hamma wanni ittiin cilee bobaʼu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">iddoo ibiddaatii fuudhan iyyuu hin hafnetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">yookaan hamma wanni ittiin boolla bishaanii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">bishaan budduuqsan hin hafnetti akka malee caccabee burkutaaʼa.”<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan, Qulqullichi Israaʼel akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">“Deebiʼuu fi boqochuudhaan ni fayyitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">tasgabbaaʼuu fi abdachuudhaan ni jabaattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">isin garuu kana hin goone.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Isinis, ‘Lakki, nu fardeeniin ni baqanna’ jettu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Kanaafuu isin ni baqattu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Isin, ‘Nu fardeen ariifatanii fiiganiin ni gulufna’ jettu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Kanaafuu warri isin gugsan ni saffisu!<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Doorsisa nama tokkootiin, kumatu baqata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">doorsisa nama shaniitiin immoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">isin hamma akkuma muka alaabaa fiixee tulluu irra jiruu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">akkuma faajjii gaara irra jiruu taatanii haftanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">hundi keessan ni baqattu.”<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Taʼus Rabbii Allaahan isiniif arjoomuu barbaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">isiniif naʼuufis ni kaʼa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Rabbii Allaah murtii qajeelaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">Warri isa eeggatan hundi eebbifamoo dha.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Yaa saba Xiyoon, warri Yerusaalem keessa jiraattan, isin siʼachi hin boossan. Yeroo isin gargaarsa barbaachaaf gara isaatti iyyattanitti inni dhugumaan isiniif arjooma! Akkuma dhagaʼeenis deebii isiniif kenna. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Gooftaan buddeena rakkinaatii fi bishaan dhiphinaa siif kennu illee barsiisaan kee siʼachi hin dhokatu; ati ijuma keetiin isa argita. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Ati yeroo gara mirgaatti yookaan gara bitaatti gortutti, dugda kee duubaan sagalee, “Karaan kana; isa irra deemi” jedhu tokko gurri kee ni dhagaʼa. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Ati ergasii waaqeffatamtoota kee tolfamoo kanneen meetiin irra dibamee fi fakkiiwwan kee kanneen warqeen itti uffifame sana ni xureessita; akkuma huccuu xuraaʼummaas of irraa isaan darbattee, “Asii badaa!” jettaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Inni sanyii ati lafatti facaafattuuf bokkaa siif kenna; midhaan lafti baaftus kan misee fi kan akka malee baayʼate taʼa. Bara sana keessa loon kee lafa dheedaa balʼaa irratti bobbaʼu. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Qotiyyoo fi harreen qotiisaa okaa filatamaa qorbii fi afarsaadhaan qulqulleeffame nyaatu. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Guyyaa badiisa guddaatti, yeroo qooxiiwwan eegumsaa jijjiganitti yaaʼawwan bishaanii tulluuwwanii fi gaarran ol dhedheeroo hunda irra yaaʼu. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Gaafa Rabbii Allaahan cabaa saba isaa hidhee warra madeesse illee fayyisutti jiʼi akkuma aduu ifa; ifni aduus akkuma ifa guyyaa torbaa dachaa torba ni ifa.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Kunoo Maqaan Rabbii Allaah aarii bobaʼuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">duumessa gobbuu aaraatiin fagoodhaa dhufaa jira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">afaan isaa dheekkamsaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">arrabni isaas ibidda gubee balleessuun guutameera.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Hafuurri inni baafatu akkuma laga guutee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">hamma morma gaʼutti ol kaʼuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">Inni gingilchaa badiisaatiin saboota gingilcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">inni luugama karaa irraa isaan balleessu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">haʼoo sabootaa keessa kaaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Isin akkuma halkan ayyaana qulqulluu ayyaaneffattanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">faarfannaa ni faarfattu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">garaan keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">akkuma yeroo namoonni ulullee afuufaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">gara tulluu Rabbii Allaahatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">gara Kattaa Israaʼelitti ol baʼan sanaa ni gammada.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Rabbii Allaahan akka namoonni sagalee isaa surra qabeessa sana dhagaʼan ni godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">inni akka isaan irree isaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:30">kan aarii guddaa fi ibidda gubee balleessuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">bokkaa hamaadhaan, bakakkaa fi cabbiidhaan <optbreak /> dhufaa jiru argan ni godha.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Sagaleen Rabbii Allaah Asoorin ni caccabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:31">bokkuu isaatiinis isaan barbadeessa.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Adabbiin ulee kan Rabbii Allaahan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">isaan irra buusu hundi sagalee dibbeetii fi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:32">sagalee kiraaraa of keessaa qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">innis rukuttaa irree isaatiin waraana keessatti isaan lola.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Toofet dur qopheeffame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">inni mootichaaf qopheeffame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">Boolli ibiddaa isaa gad fageeffamee balʼifamee hojjetame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">innis ibiddaa fi qoraaniin guutameera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">hafuurri afaan Rabbii Allaahatii baʼus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">akkuma dinyii dhangalaʼuu akka inni bobaʼu godha.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Warra Gibxin Abdataniif Wayyoo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Warra gargaarsa barbaacha gara Gibxitti gad buʼaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">warra fardeen abdataniif</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">warra gaariiwwan isaaniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">jabina abbootii fardeen isaanii amanatanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">garuu gara Qulqullicha Israaʼel hin ilaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">yookaan gargaarsa Rabbii Allaah hin barbaanneef wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Taʼus inni ogeessa; balaas fiduu dandaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">inni waan jedhe irraa duubatti hin deebiʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Inni mana hamootaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">warra namoota hammina hojjetan gargaaraniitti ni kaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Warri Gibxi namootuma malee Allaah miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">fardeen isaaniis foonuma malee hafuura miti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">Yeroo Rabbii Allaahan harka isaa diriirfatutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">inni gargaaru ni gufata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">inni gargaaramus ni kufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">isaan lachuu walii wajjin badu.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana naan jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">“Akkuma leenci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">leenci guddaan tokko waan qabate irratti aadu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">tuunni tiksootaa guutuun isatti wal waammatan iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">inni iyya isaanii hin sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">yookaan waca isaaniitiin hin raafamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">akkasuma Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">Tulluu Xiyoon irratti waraana banuuf gad buʼa.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Akkuma simbirroon mataa namaa irra naannoftu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu <optbreak /> Yerusaalemiif gaachana taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">inni gaachana taʼeefii ishee baraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">ishee bira darba; ishee oolchas.”<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Yaa saba Israaʼel, gara Isa akka malee itti finciltan sanaatti deebiʼaa. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Bara sana tokkoon tokkoon keessan waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo harki keessan cubbamaan sun meetii fi warqee irraa hojjetee ture sana ni gattuutii.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />“Asoor goraadee kan namaa hin taʼiniin kufti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">goraadeen nama duʼa hin oollees isaan fixa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Isaan goraadee duraa baqatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">dargaggoonni isaaniis dirqamaan hojii humnaa hojjetu.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Daʼoon isaanii sababii sodaatiif ni jiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">ajajjoonni isaaniis faajjii waraanaa arganii hollatu”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">jedha Rabbii Allaahan, inni ibiddi isaa Xiyoon keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">kan boolli ibidda isaa immoo Yerusaalem keessa jiru sun.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Mootummaa Qajeelummaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Kunoo mootiin qajeelummaadhaan moʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">bulchitoonnis murtii qajeelaadhaan bulchu.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Tokkoon tokkoon namaa akkuma daʼannoo bubbee jalaa itti daʼatanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">akkuma iddoo itti jabaa jalaa baqataniitti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">akkuma bishaan gammoojjii keessa yaaʼuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">akkuma gaaddisa kattaa guddaa kan lafa gogaa keessaa ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Ergasiis iji warra waa arguu hin dunuunfatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">gurri warra waa dhagaʼuus ni dhaggeeffata.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Qalbiin nama jarjaru tokkoo ni beeka; ni hubata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">arrabni giingees qajeelchee qulqulleessee dubbata.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Siʼachi gowwaan ulfina qabeessa hin jedhamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">addaggeenis baayʼee hin kabajamu.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Gowwaan sababii gowwummaa dubbatuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">qalbiin isaa hammina hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">inni waan Allaahan hin jaallanne hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">waaʼee Rabbii Allaahas dogoggora odeessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">inni nama beelaʼe beela hin baasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">nama dheebote illee bishaan dhowwata.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Malli addaggee hammina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">inni utuma iyyanni rakkattootaa qajeelaa taʼee jiruu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">sobumaan hiyyeeyyii balleessuuf jedhee jalʼina yaada.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Namni ulfina qabeessi garuu karoora ulfaataa baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">hojii ulfina qabeessa sanattis ni jabaata.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubartoota Yerusaalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Yaa dubartoota akka malee boontan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">kaʼaatii na dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">yaa intallan waan nagaa qabdan of seetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">waan ani jedhu dhagaʼaa!<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Isin warri waan nagaa qabdan of seetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">erga waggaan tokko xinnuma darbee booddee ni hollattu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">wayiniin ija hin kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">yeroon itti iji walitti qabamus hin dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Yaa dubartoota boontuuwwan isin holladhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">intallan waan nagaa qabdan of seetanis raafamaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Uffata keessan of irraa baasaatii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">wayyaa gaddaa mudhii keessanitti hidhadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Lafa qotiisaa gaariif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">muka wayinii ija naqatuufis laphee keessan dhaʼaa;<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />lafa uummata koo kan qoraattii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">sokorruun irratti guddatuuf laphee keessan dhaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">dhugumaan manneen gammachuu hundaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">magaalaa fandalaltuu kanaaf booʼaa.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Daʼannoon ni ona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">magaalaan namni keessa guutes duwwaa hafti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">magaalaan jabduunii fi qooxiin eegumsaa bara baraan ni onu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">iddoo harreen diidaa keessa burraaqxuu fi iddoo bushaayeen itti bobbaʼan taʼu;<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />kunis hamma Hafuurri Qulqulluun <optbreak /> gubbaadhaa nurratti dhangalaafamuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">hamma gammoojjiin lafa qotiisaa gabbataa taʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">lafti qotiisaa gabbataan immoo bosona fakkaatutti taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Murtii qajeelaan gammoojjii keessa jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">qajeelummaan immoo lafa qotiisaa gabbataa keessa jiraata.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Buʼaan qajeelummaa nagaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">faayidaan qajeelummaa immoo utuu hin birʼatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">tasgabbiin bara baraan jiraachuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Sabni koo iddoo jireenyaa nagaa qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">manneen bultii sodaa hin qabne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">iddoo boqonnaa jeequmsi hin jirre keessa jiraata.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Yommuu cabbiin bosona irratti buʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:19">magaalattiin guutumaan guutuutti gad deebiti;<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />isin warri qarqara laga hundaatti sanyii facaafattanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">loon keessanii fi harroota keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">nagaan bobbaafattan akkam eebbifamoo dha.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Dhiphinaa fi Gargaarsa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Yaa barbadeessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">ati kan hin barbadeeffamin siif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Yaa gantuu, ati kan hin ganamin siif wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Ati yommuu barbadeessuu dhiiftutti ni barbadeeffamta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">yommuu ganuu dhiiftuttis ni ganamta.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Rabbii Allaah, nu maari; nu si eeggannaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">Ati ganama ganama jabina keenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">yeroo dhiphinaatti immoo fayyina keenya nuuf taʼi.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Sagalee kakawwee keetiitiin, namoonni baqatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">yeroo ati ol kaatutti, saboonni ni bittinnaaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Yaa saboota, akkuma hawwaannisni walitti qabamu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">boojuun keessan walitti qabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">namoonnis akkuma tuuta hawwaannisaa irra uʼutaalu.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Rabbii Allaahan ol ol jedha; inni ol gubbaa jiraataatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">inni murtii qajeelaa fi qajeelummaadhaan Xiyoonin guuta.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Inni bara keetiif hundee amansiisaa, kuusaa fayyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">kan ogummaatii fi kan beekumsaa taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">Rabbii Allaah sodaachuun furtuu badhaadhummaa kanaa ti.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Kunoo gootonni isaanii sagalee ol fudhatanii daandii irratti iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">ergamoonni nagaas hiqqifatanii booʼu.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Karaawwan gurguddaan onaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">namni karaa irra deemu hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Walii galteen diigameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">dhuga baatonni ishee tuffatamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">namni tokko iyyuu hin kabajamu.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Lafti ni boossi; ni barbadoofti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Libaanoon ni qaanofti; ni coollagdi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Shaaroon akka gammoojjii taati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Baashaanii fi Qarmeloos baala isaanii harcaafatu.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha; “Ani amma nan kaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ani amma ol ol nan jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ani amma nan kabajama.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Isin habaqii ulfooftu; cidii deessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">hafuurri isin baafattan ibidda gubee isin fixuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Namoonni akkuma nooraa gubamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">akkuma qoraattii cirameettis ibiddi itti qabsiifama.”<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Isin warri fagoo jirtan waan ani hojjedhe dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">warri dhiʼoo jirtanis humna koo beekaa!<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Cubbamoonni Xiyoon keessaa ni sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">warri Allaahatti hin bulles hollachaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">“Nu keessaa eenyutu ibidda waa balleessu wajjin jiraachuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">Nu keessaa eenyutu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">ibidda bara baraan hin dhaamne wajjin jiraachuu dandaʼa?” jedhu.<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Namni qajeelummaan jiraatee dhugaa dubbatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">kan faayidaa karaa dabaatiin argamu lagatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">harka isaa mattaʼaa fudhachuu irraa eeggatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">namni marii nama ajjeesuu irraa gurra isaa cuqqaallatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">jalʼina ilaaluu irraa ija isaa dunuunfatu,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />iddoo ol kaʼaa irra jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">daʼannoon isaas kattaa jabaa taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Buddeenni isaaf ni kennama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">bishaanis isatti hin hirʼatu.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Iji kee mooticha miidhagummaa isaatiin arga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">biyya fagoo jirtu illee ni ilaala.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Atis akkana jettee garaa keetti raafama durii sana yaadda:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">“Ajajaan ol aanaan sun eessa jira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Namichi gibira fuudhu sun eessa jira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Ajajaan itti gaafatamaan gamoowwanii eessa jira?”<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Ati siʼachi saba hamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">kan haasaan isaa namaaf hin galle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">kan afaan isaa haaraa taʼee fi hin hubatamne hin argitu.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Xiyoon, magaalaa ayyaana keenyaa hubadhuu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">iji kee Yerusaalemin, iddoo jireenyaa nagaa qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">dunkaana hin buqqifamne arga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">qofoon ishee hin buqqifamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">yookaan funyoon ishee tokko iyyuu hin citu.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Rabbii Allaahan achitti Humna keenya taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">Iddoon sunis akkuma lageen gurguddaatii fi burqaawwanii taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Dooniin waraanaa kan batoodhaan oofamu tokko iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">isaan irra hin deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">dooniin jabaan tokko iyyuu isaan irra hin qaxxaamuru.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Rabbii Allaahan abbaa murtii keenyaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">Rabbii Allaahan seera nuuf kenna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:22">Rabbii Allaahan mootii keenya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">inni nu fayyisa.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Funyoon kee laafeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">utubaan isaa jabaatee hin dhaabamne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">sharaanis hin diriirfamne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">Ergasii boojuun baayʼeen ni qoodama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">okkolaan iyyuu boojuu ni fudhata.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Namni Xiyoon keessa jiraatu kam iyyuu, “Na dhukkuba” hin jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">cubbuun warra achi jiraatanis ni dhiifamaaf.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Murtii Saboota Eeggattu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Yaa saboota, isin as dhiʼaadhaatii dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">yaa namoota, isinis qalbeeffadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Lafti haa dhageessu; kan ishee keessa jiraatu hundis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">addunyaa fi wanni ishee keessaa baʼu hundinuu haa dhagaʼan!<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Rabbii Allaahan saboota hundatti aareera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">dheekkamsi isaa loltoota isaanii hunda irra buʼeera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Inni guutumaan guutuutti isaan barbadeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">inni akka qalamaniif dabarsee isaan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Isaan keessaa warri duʼan alatti gad darbataman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">reeffi isaanii ni ajaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">tulluuwwan dhiiga isaaniitiin tortoru.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Raayyaawwan shamaayʼun hundinuu ni baqu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">shamaayʼuniinis akkuma kitaaba maramaa ni marmarama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">raayyaan urjiiwwanii hundinuu akkuma baala wayinii coollagee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">akkuma harbuu muka harbuu irraa harcaʼuutti harcaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Goraadeen koo shamaayʼun keessatti hamma quufutti dhugeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">kunoo inni Edoomitti muruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">gara saba ani guutumaan guutuutti barbadeesseetti gad buʼeera.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Goraadeen Rabbii Allaah dhiiga keessa cuuphameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">inni coomaan, dhiiga xobbaallaawwan hoolaatii fi reʼootaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">moora kalee korbeeyyii hoolaatiin haguugameera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Rabbii Allaahan Bozraa keessatti aarsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">Edoom keessatti immoo qalma guddaa qopheesseeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Gafarsi isaan wajjin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">jiboonnis korommii gurguddaa wajjin dhumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Lafti isaanii dhiigaan jiiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">biyyoon isaaniis moora quufa.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Rabbii Allaahan guyyaa itti haaloo baʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">waggaa itti waaʼee Xiyoon falmu qabaatii.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Burqaawwan Edoom leeleetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">biyyoon ishees dinyii bobaʼutti geeddarama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">lafti ishee immoo leelee bobaʼu taʼa!<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Inni halkan yookaan guyyaa hin dhaamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">aarri isaas bara baraan ol baʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Lafti sun dhalootaa hamma dhalootaatti ontee hafti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">namni tokko iyyuu deebiʼee ishee keessaan hin darbu.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Cululleen gammoojjiitii fi dhaddeen lafa sana ni fudhatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">urunguu fi arraagessi mana isaanii achitti ijaarratu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Allaahan Edoom irra, funyoo jeequmsaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">madaalii badiisaa ni diriirsa.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Gurguddoonni ishee waan mootummaa jedhamee waamamu <optbreak /> achii hin qabaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">ilmaan mootota ishee hundi ni badu.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Masaraa ishee qoraattii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">daʼannoo ishee doobbii fi sokorruutu dhaala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">Isheen boolla waangoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">iddoo urunguun jiraattu ni taati.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Uumamawwan gammoojjii waraabessa wajjin wal gaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">hafuuronni hamoo reʼee diidaa fakkaatan wal waamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">uumamawwan halkanii achi boqotan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">ofii isaaniitiifis iddoo aara galfannaa argatu.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Urunguun achitti manʼee ijaarrattee hanqaaquu hanqaaqxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">cuucii yaaftees qoochoo jalatti kunuunfatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">allaattiinis dhirsaa fi niitii taatee achitti walitti qabamti.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Kitaaba Rabbii Allaah keessaa ilaalaatii kan akkana jedhu dubbifadhaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Isaan kanneen keessaa tokko iyyuu hin dhabamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">tokkittiin iyyuu dhirsa ishee hin dhabdu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Afaan Allaaha ajajeeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">Hafuurri isaas walitti isaan qaba.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Isatu qooda isaanii hiraaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">harki isaa safartuudhaan isaaniif qooda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Isaan bara baraan qooda kana ni qabaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">dhalootaa hamma dhalootaattis achi jiraatu.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Gammachuu Warra Furamanii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Gammoojjii fi lafti gogaan ni gammadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">lafti onaan ni ililcha; ni daraaras.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">Akka arfaasee, <verse eid="ISA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />baayʼinaan daraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">akka malee gammadees ililcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Ulfinni Libaanoon, surraan Qarmeloosii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Shaaroon ni kennamaaf;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">isaan ulfina Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">surraa Allaah keenyaas ni argu.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Harka dadhabe jajjabeessaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:3">jilba laafes cimsaa;<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />warra garaan isaanii sodaatuun akkana jedhaa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">“Jabaadhaa; hin sodaatinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Allaahan keessan ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">inni haaloo baasuuf dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">gatii malu qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">isin oolchuuf ni dhufa.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Ergasii iji nama jaamaa ni banama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:5">gurri nama duudaas ni dhagaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Gaafas namni naafti akkuma gadamsaa utaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">arrabni hidhamaanis gammachuudhaan faarfata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Bishaan gammoojjii keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">burqaanis gammoojjii keessaa cabsee baʼa.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Lafti nama gubu haroo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">lafti gogaan immoo burqaa bishaanii taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">Boolla duraan waangoonni keessa ciisan irratti marga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">shambaqqoo fi dhallaadduutu biqila.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Karaan guddaan tokko achi ni jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">innis, Karaa Qulqullinaa jedhamee waamama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">inni warra Karaa sana irra deemaniif taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">“Xuraaʼonni” isa irra hin deeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">gowwoonni achiinuu hin baʼan.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Leenci achitti hin argamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">yookaan bineensi hamaan achi irra hin baʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">isaan achitti hin argaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Garuu warra furaman qofatu achi irra deema;<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />warri Rabbii Allaahan isaan fure ni deebiʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Isaan faarfannaadhaan Xiyoon seenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">gammachuun bara baraa mataa isaanii irra jiraata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Isaan gammachuu fi ililleedhaan guutamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">gaddii fi booʼichi isaan irraa fagaatu.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Senaaheriib Yerusaalemin Doorsise</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">36:1‑22</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 18:13">2Mt 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 18:17-37">17‑37</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:9-19">2Sn 32:9‑19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Bara mootummaa Hisqiyaas mootichaa keessa waggaa kudha afuraffaatti Senaaheriib mootichi Asoor magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen dallaa jabaa qaban hunda lolee ni qabate. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Ergasii mootichi Asoor, Raafaasqiis ajajaa waraana isaa loltoota hedduu wajjin Laakkiishii gara Yerusaalem, Hisqiyaas mootichatti erge. Ajajaan sunis jalʼisii Haroo Ol aanu kan karra Lafa Qotiisaa Namicha Wayyaa Miicuutti geessu bira gaʼee dhaabate; <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Eliiyaaqiim ilmi Hilqiyaa bulchaan masaraa mootummaa, Shebnaa barreessaanii fi Yooʼaa ilmi Asaaf galmeessaan gara isaatti gad baʼan.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Ajajaan waraanaa sunis akkana isaaniin jedhe; “Akkana jedhaa Hisqiyaasitti himaa:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ISA 36:4">“ ‘Mootiin guddaan, mootichi Asoor akkana jedha: Of amanachuu kee kana maal irratti hundeeffatte? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Ati, “Ani tooftaa fi jabina waraanaa qaba” jetta; garuu dubbii faayidaa hin qabne dubbatta. Ati eenyun abdattee natti fincilta? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Kunoo ati Gibxin jechuunis ulee shambaqqoo caccabaa harka nama isatti irkatu kamii iyyuu waraanee madeessu sana abdatteerta! Faraʼoon Mootichi Gibxis nama isa abdatu hundaaf akkasuma. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Yoo ati, “Nu Rabbii Allaah keenya abdanna” naan jette, inni isuma Hisqiyaas iddoowwan sagadaa isaatii fi iddoowwan aarsaa isaa diigee Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalemiin, “Isin fuula iddoo aarsaa kanaa duratti waaqeffachuu qabdu” jedhe sana mitii?<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />“ ‘Amma kottuutii gooftaa koo mooticha Asoor wajjin dubbadhu; anis yoo ati namoota farda yaabbatan qopheeffachuu dandeesse fardeen kuma lama siifin kenna! <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Yoos ati yoo gaariiwwanii fi abbootii fardaatiif jettee Gibxin abdatte iyyuu, akkamiin qondaaltota gooftaa kootii keessaa ajajaa gad aanaa isaa illee of irraa deebisuu dandeessa? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Ati waan ani dubbii Rabbii Allaah malee biyya kana lolee barbadeessuuf dhufe seetaa? Rabbii Allaahan mataan isaa akka ani biyya kanatti duulee ishee barbadeessu natti dubbateera.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Kana irratti Eliiyaaqiim, Shebnaa fi Yooʼaa ajajaa waraanaa sanaan, “Maaloo waan nu dhageenyuuf afaan warra Araamaayikiitiin garboota keetti dubbadhu. Utuma namoonni dallaa irra jiran dhagaʼanii afaan Ibrootaatiin nutti hin dubbatin” jedhan.<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Ajajaan waraanaa sun garuu akkana jedhee deebise; “Namni gooftaan koo akka ani waan kana itti himuuf itti na erge gooftaa keessanii fi isin qofaa? Namoota dallaa irra tataaʼan warra akkuma keessan udaan ofii isaanii nyaatanii fincaan ofii isaanii dhuguu qabaniifis mitii?”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Ergasii ajajaan waraanaa sun ol kaʼee afaan Ibrootaatiin akkana jedhe; “Dubbii mooticha guddaa, dubbii mootii Asoor dhagaʼaa! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Mootichi akkana jedha: Hisqiyaas isin hin gowwoomsin. Inni isin baasuu hin dandaʼu! <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Hisqiyaas, ‘Rabbii Allaahan dhugumaan nu baasa; magaalaan kunis dabarfamtee harka mooticha Asooritti hin kennamtu’ jechuudhaan akka isin Rabbii Allaah amanattaniif isin hin sossobin.<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />“Hisqiyaasin hin dhaggeeffatinaa. Mootiin Asoor akkana jedha: Ana wajjin nagaa buusaatii gara koo kottaa. Ergasii tokkoon tokkoon keessan muka wayiniitii fi muka harbuu keessan irraa ni nyaattu; boolla bishaan keessanii keessaas ni dhugdu; <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />kunis hamma ani dhufee gara biyya akkuma biyya keessanii jirtuu, gara biyya midhaanii fi daadhii wayinii haaraatti, biyya buddeenaa fi iddoo dhaabaa wayiniitti isin geessutti taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />“Hisqiyaas, ‘Rabbii Allaahan nu baraara’ jedhee isin hin dogoggorsin; Allaahan saboota kamii iyyuu takkumaa harka mooticha Asoor keessaa biyya ofii baafatee beekaa? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Waaqeffatamtoonni Hamaatii fi waaqeffatamtoonni Arfaad eessa jiru? Waaqeffatamtoonni Seefarwaayim eessa jiru? Isaan harka koo keessaa Samaariyaa baasaniiruu? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Waaqeffatamtoota biyyoota kanneenii hunda keessaa kamtu biyyoota isaanii harka koo keessaa baasuu dandaʼe? Yoos Rabbii Allaahan akkamiin harka koo keessaa Yerusaalemin baasuu dandaʼa ree?”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Namoonni garuu sababii mootichi, “Deebii hin kenninaafii” jedhee ajajeef inuma calʼisan malee deebii tokko iyyuu hin kennine.<verse eid="ISA 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Kana irratti Eliiyaaqiim ilmi Hilqiyaa bulchaan masaraa mootummaa, Shebnaa barreessaanii fi Yooʼaa ilmi Asaaf galmeessaan, uffata isaanii tatarsaasanii gara Hisqiyaas dhaqanii waan ajajaan waraanaa sun jedhe itti ni himan.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Bilisoomuun Yerusaalem Himame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:1-13">37:1‑13</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 19:1-13">2Mt 19:1‑13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Hisqiyaas mootichi yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti, uffata isaa tarsaasee wayyaa gaddaas uffatee mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah seene. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Innis Eliiyaaqiim bulchaa masaraa mootummaa, Shebnaa barreessaa fi luboota dura buʼoota hundi isaanii wayyaa gaddaa uffatan Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyicha ilma Amoos sanatti erge. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Isaanis akkana jedhanii isatti himan; “Hisqiyaas akkana jedha: Guyyaan kun akkuma yeroo daaʼimni tokko dhalachuu gaʼee garuu dubartiin humna ittiin ciniinsifattee deessu dhabduutti guyyaa lubbamuu, kan dheekkamsaatii fi kan salphinaa ti. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Rabbii Allaahan kee dubbii ajajaa waraanaa kan gooftaan isaa mootichi Asoor akka inni Allaah jiraataatti qoosuuf erge sanaa dhagaʼee dubbii Rabbii Allaahan kee dhagaʼe sanaaf jedhee isatti dheekkama taʼa. Kanaafuu ati hambaawwan hamma ammaatti jiraniif duʼaa godhi.”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Yommuu qondaaltonni Hisqiyaas Mootichaa gara Isaayyaas dhufanitti, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Isaayyaas akkana isaaniin jedhe; “Akkana jedhaa gooftaa keessanitti himaa; ‘Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: Ati waan dhageesse jechuunis dubbii garboonni mootii Asoor ittiin na arrabsan sana hin sodaatin. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Dhaggeeffadhaa! Ani akka inni oduu wayii dhagaʼee gara biyya ofii isaatti deebiʼuuf hafuura tokko isa keessa nan kaaʼa; achittis akka inni goraadeedhaan ajjeefamu nan godha.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Ajajaan waraanaas yommuu akka mootiin Asoor Laakkiishii baʼee deeme dhagaʼetti, duubatti deebiʼee utuu mootichi Libnaa lolaa jiruu argate.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Senaaheriibis akka Tiirhaaq mootichi Itoophiyaa sun isa loluuf dhufaa jiru dhagaʼe. Innis yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti, akkana jedhee Hisqiyaasitti ergamoota erge: <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Hisqiyaas mooticha Yihuudaatiin akkana jedhaa: Allaahan ati abdattu sun, ‘Yerusaalem dabarfamtee harka mootii Asooritti hin kennamtu’ jedhee si hin gowwoomsin. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Ati waan mootonni Asoor guutumaan guutuutti isaan balleessuudhaan biyyoota hunda godhan dhageesseerta. Ati immoo ni haftaa ree? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Waaqeffatamtoonni saboota abbootiin koo barbadeessan sanaa jechuunis waaqeffatamtoonni Goozaan, waaqeffatamtoonni Kaaraan, waaqeffatamtoonni Rezefii fi waaqeffatamtoonni namoota Eden kanneen Telaasaar keessa turan sanaa isaan oolchaniiruu? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Mootiin Hamaati yookaan mootiin Arfaad eessa jira? Mootiin magaalaa Seefarwaayim, mootiin Heenaa yookaan mootiin Iwaa eessa jira?”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duʼaa Hisqiyaas</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:14-20">37:14‑20</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 19:14-19">2Mt 19:14‑19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hisqiyaasis ergamoota sana harkaa xalayaa fuudhee dubbifate. Ergasiis gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti ol baʼee xalayaa sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti diriirse. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Hisqiyaas akkana jedhee Rabbii Allaah duratti duʼaa godhe: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandeessu, Allaah Israaʼel, kan Kiirubeel gidduu teessoo irra jirtu, si qofatu mootummoota lafaa hunda irratti Allaaha. Ati shamaayʼunii fi lafa uumteerta. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Rabbii Allaah, gurra kee as qabiitii dhagaʼi; yaa Rabbii Allaah, ija kees banadhuu ilaali; dubbii Senaaheriib kan inni Allaah jiraataa arrabsuuf erge kana hunda dhaggeeffadhu.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />“Rabbii Allaah, mootonni Asoor uummata kana hundaa fi biyyoota isaanii balleessuun dhugaa dha. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Isaan waaqeffatamtoota jaraa ibiddatti naqanii barbadeessaniiru; waaqeffatamtoonni sun mukaa fi dhagaa harka namaatiin soofaman turan malee waaqeffatamtoota hin turreetii. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Kanaafuu yaa Rabbii Allaah keenya, akka mootummoonni lafaa hundinuu akka ati qofti Rabbii Allaah taate beekaniif, harka isaatii nu baasi.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufaatii Senaaheriib</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">37:21‑38</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 19:20-37">2Mt 19:20‑37</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:20-21">2Sn 32:20‑21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Sana booddee Isaayyaas ilmi Amoos akkana jedhee Hisqiyaasitti ergaa erge; “Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel akkana jedha: Sababii ati waaʼee Senaaheriib mooticha Asoor na duratti duʼaa godhatteef, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />dubbiin Rabbii Allaahan isaan mormuudhaan dubbate kunoo kanaa dha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">“Intalli Xiyoon durbi qulqullittiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">si tuffattee sitti qoosti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Intalli Yerusaalem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">yeroo ati baqattutti mataa ishee sitti raafti.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Kan ati itti qoostee arrabsite sun eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Ati eenyutti sagalee kee ol fudhattee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">of tuulummaadhaan ija ol qabatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Qulqullichuma Israaʼel sanatti mitii!<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Ati karaa ergamoota keetiitiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Gooftaatti qoosteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ati akkanas jetteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">‘Ani gaariiwwan koo hedduudhaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">fiixee tulluuwwaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">fiixee Libaanoon kan akka malee ol dheeratuttis ol baʼeera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ani birbirsawwan isaa akka malee dhedheeroo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">gaattiraawwan isaa filatamoo sanas ciccireera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ani fiixeewwan isaa kanneen akka malee ol fagoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">bosonoota akka malee mimmiidhagoo qaqqabeera.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Ani biyya ormaatti boolla bishaanii qotadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">achitti bishaan dhugeera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Ani faana miilla kootiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">lageen Gibxi hunda gogseera.’<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />“Ati waan kana hin dhageenyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">Bara dheeraan dura anatu waan kana hojjete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Ani bara durii keessa waan kana nan karoorfadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">amma immoo hojii irra oolfadheera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">kunis akka ati magaalaawwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">dallaa jabaa qaban diigdee tuullaa dhagaa gootuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Namoonni isaanii humna dhabanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">abdii kutataniis qaanaʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Isaan akkuma biqiltuu diidaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">akkuma biqiltuu kichuu tokkoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">akkuma marga mana gubbaatti biqilu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">kan utuu hin guddatin gubatee ti.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />“Ani garuu lafa ati jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">yoom akka dhuftuu fi yoom akka deemtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">akka ati akka malee natti aartu illee nan beeka.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Sababii ati akka malee natti aartee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">of tuulummaan kees gurra koo seeneef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">ani funyaan keetti hokkoo koo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">afaan keetti immoo luugama koo kaaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">akka ati karuma dhufte sanaan deebitu sin godha.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />“Yaa Hisqiyaas kun mallattoo siif taʼa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">“Isin waggaa kana waan ofumaan biqilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">waggaa lammaffaatti immoo waanuma isa irraa latu nyaattu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Waggaa sadaffaatti garuu facaafadhaa galfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">muka wayiniis dhaabbadhaatii ija isaa nyaadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Ammas hambaan mootummaa Yihuudaa tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">jalaan hidda baafatee gubbaan immoo ija naqata.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Yerusaalem keessaa hambaan tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">Tulluu Xiyooniitii immoo <optbreak /> gareen warra badiisa jalaa baʼe tokkoo ni dhufa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:32">Hinaaffaan Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">waan kana ni raawwata.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />“Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan waaʼee mooticha Asoor akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">“Inni magaalaa kana hin seenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">yookaan xiyya tokko illee asitti hin darbatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Inni gaachana qabatee fuula isaa duratti hin dhiʼaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">yookaan tuullaa biyyoo itti hin marsu.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Inni karuma dhufe sanaan ni deebiʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">magaalaa kanas hin seenu”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />“Anis sababii ofii kootii fi sababii garbicha koo Daawudiif jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">magaalaa kana nan eega; nan oolchas!”<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Ergasii malaʼikkaan Rabbii Allaah gad baʼee qubata warra Asoor keessatti nama kuma dhibba tokkoo fi saddeettamii shan fixe. Yommuu namoonni guyyaa itti aanu ganama bariin kaʼanitti kunoo reeffi namaa lafa guutee ture. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Kanaafuu Senaaheriib mootichi Asoor qubata sana keessaa baʼee baqate; Nanawweetti deebiʼees achi jiraate.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Gaaf tokko utuu inni mana sagadaa Allaah isaa Nisrook jedhamuu keessatti waaqeffachaa jiruu ilmaan isaa Adramelekii fi Sharezer goraadeedhaan isa ajjeesanii gara biyya Araaraatitti baqatan. Ilmi isaa Eesarhadoonis iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Hisqiyaas Dhukkubsachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 38:1-8">38:1‑8</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2Mt 20:1‑11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2Sn 32:24‑26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Bara sana keessa Hisqiyaas dhukkubsatee duʼuu gaʼee ture. Isaayyaas ilmi Amoos nabiiʼiyyichi gara isaa dhaqee, “Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: Mana kee tottolfadhu; ati ni duuta malee hin fayyituutii” jedheen.<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Hisqiyaasis fuula isaa gara keenyan manaatti garagalfatee akkana jedhee Rabbii Allaah duratti duʼaa godhate; <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />“Rabbii Allaah, akka ani amanamummaa fi garaa tokkoon fuula kee dura jiraadhee waan fuula kee duratti gaarii taʼes hojjedhe yaadadhu.” Hisqiyaasis hiqqifatee ni booʼe.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Ergasiis dubbiin Rabbii Allaah akkana jedhee gara Isaayyaas dhufe: <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />“Dhaqiitii akkana jedhii Hisqiyaasitti himi; ‘Rabbii Allaahan abbaa kee Daawud akkana jedha: Ani duʼaa kee dhagaʼeera; imimmaan kees argeera; ani umurii kee irratti waggaa kudha shan siifan dabala. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Ani siʼii fi magaalaa kana harka mooticha Asooriitii nan baasa. Ani magaalaa kana nan eega.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />“ ‘Kun mallattoo Rabbii Allaah kan akka inni waan waadaa gale sana guutu mirkaneessuuf Rabbii Allaah biraa siif kennamee dha: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Ani akka gaaddidduun aduu tarkaanfii kurnan gulantaa Aahaaz irraan gad buʼe sana dugda duubatti deebiʼu nan godha.’ ” Kanaafuu gaaddidduun tarkaanfii kurnan gad buʼee ture sun dugda duubatti deebiʼe.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Barreeffama Hisqiyaas mootichi Yihuudaa erga dhukkubsatee fayyee booddee barreesse:<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Anis, “Walakkaa umurii kootiitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">ani siiʼool seenuun qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">Bara jireenya koo kan hafes dhabuun qabaa?” nan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Ani akkanan jedhe; “Ani biyya jiraattotaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">lammata Rabbii Allaah hin argu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">ani siʼachi sanyii namaa hin ilaalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">yookaan warra addunyaa kana irra jiraatan wajjin hin jiraadhu.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Manni koo akkuma dunkaana tiksootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">buqqifamee narraa fudhatameera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Ani akkuma wayyaa dhooftuu jireenya koo marmareera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">inni miʼa wayyaa dhooftuu irraa na kuteera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">ati halkanii guyyaa na balleessita.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Ani hamma bariitti obsaan nan eeggadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">inni garuu akka leencaa lafee koo hunda caccabse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">ati halkanii guyyaas na balleessita.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Ani akka simbirroo yookaan akkuma daalotee nan wace;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">akka gugee boossuus nan aade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">iji koo gara shamaayʼun ilaaluudhaan dadhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">yaa Gooftaa ani rakkadheeraa kottuu na gargaari!”<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Ani garuu maal jechuun dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Inni natti dubbate; inni mataan isaas waan kana godhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Ani waaʼee dhiphinaa lubbuu kootiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">umurii koo guutuu gad of qabee nan jiraadha.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Yaa Gooftaa, namoonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">waanuma akkasiitiin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">hafuurri koos isaanumaan jireenya argata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">Ati na fayyiftee lubbuudhaanis na jiraachifte.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Dhugumaan akkas dhiphachuun koo faayidaa kootiif.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">Ati jaalala keetiin boolla badiisaa irraa na eegde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">cubbuu koo hundas, dugda kee duubatti gatte.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Siiʼool si galateeffachuu hin dandaʼutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">duutis si jajachuu hin dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Warri qileetti gad buʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">amanamummaa kee abdachuu hin dandaʼan.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Isaan akkuma ani harʼa gochaa jiru kana yaa jiraataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">yaa jiraataa jedhanii si jajatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">abbootiin waaʼee amanamummaa keetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">ijoollee isaaniitti ni odeessu.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Rabbii Allaahan na baraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">nus bara jireenya keenyaa guutuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">miʼa ribuu irraa hojjetameen faarfanna.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isaayyaas, “Maxinoo harbuu tolchaatii dhullaa isaa irra kaaʼaa; innis ni fayyaa” jedhee ture.<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hisqiyaasis, “Akka ani gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti ol baʼuuf maaltu mallattoo taʼa?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Ergamoota Baabilonii Dhufan</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">39:1‑8</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2Mt 20:12‑19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Yeroo sanatti Meroodak Baladaan ilmi Baladaan mootiin Baabilon sababii akka Hisqiyaas dhukkubsatee fayye dhagaʼeef xalayootaa fi kennaa ergeef. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hisqiyaasis ergamoota sana gammachuudhaan simatee waan mankuusa isaa keessa ture meetii, warqee, urgooftuu, zayitii qulqulluu akkasumas kuusaa miʼa lolaa isaa guutuu fi waan mankuusa isaa keessatti argamu hunda isaanitti argisiise. Wanni Hisqiyaas masaraa mootummaa isaa keessaa yookaan mootummaa isaa hunda keessaa isaanitti hin argisiisin tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Kana irratti Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyichi gara Hisqiyaas mootichaa dhaqee, “Namoonni sun maal jedhan? Isaan eessaa dhufan?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:3">Hisqiyaasis, “Isaan Baabilonii biyya fagoodhaa na bira dhufan” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Nabiiʼiyyichi, “Jarri masaraa mootummaa keetii keessatti maal argan?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hisqiyaas immoo, “Isaan waan masaraa mootummaa koo keessa jiru hunda argan; wanni ani mankuusa koo keessaa isaanitti hin argisiisin tokko iyyuu hin jiru” jedheen.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Isaayyaasis kana irratti Hisqiyaasiin akkana jedhe; “Dubbii Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu dhagaʼi: <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Yeroon itti wanni masaraa mootummaa keetii keessa jiru hundii fi wanni abbootiin kee hamma harʼaatti kuusan hundinuu saamamee gara Baabilonitti geeffamu tokko dhugumaan ni dhufa. Wanni tokko iyyuu hin hafu, jedha Rabbii Allaahan. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Sanyii kee keessaa namoonni tokko tokko, foonii fi dhiigni kee kanneen siif dhalatan boojiʼamanii masaraa mootummaa mooticha Baabilon keessatti xuʼaashiiwwan taʼu.”<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hisqiyaasis, “Dubbiin Rabbii Allaah kan ati dubbatte kun gaarii dha” jedhee deebise. Inni, “Bara jireenya koo keessa nagaa fi tasgabbiin ni jiraata” jedhee yaadee tureetii.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Sabni Allaaha Jajjabeeffame</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Jajjabeessaa; saba koo jajjabeessaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">jedha Allaahan keessan.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Garaa Yerusaalemitti dubbadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">hojiin garbummaa ishee akka dhume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">gatiin cubbuu ishee akka baafameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">isheen cubbuu ishee hundaaf</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">harka Rabbii Allaahatii adabbii dachaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">akka fudhatte isheetti labsaa.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Sagalee akkana jedhee iyyu tokko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">“Gammoojjii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">Rabbii Allaahaf karaa qopheessaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">gammoojjii keessatti Allaah keenyaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">karaa guddicha qajeelchaa.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Sululli hundi ni guutama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">tulluu fi gaarri hundinuus gad deebifama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">lafti wal caalu, wal qixxeeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">lafti buʼaa baʼiinis dirree taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Ulfinni Rabbii Allaah ni mulʼata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">sanyiin namaa hundinuus tokkummaadhaan ni arga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">Afaan Rabbii Allaah dubbateeraatii.”<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Sagaleen tokko “Iyyi” jedha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Anis, “Maal jedheen iyya?” nan jedhe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 40:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">“Namni hundi akkuma margaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">ulfinni isaa hundis akkuma daraaraa dirree ti.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Sababii hafuurri Rabbii Allaahan baafatu isaanitti bubbisuuf margi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">ni coollaga; daraaraanis ni harcaʼa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">Dhugumaan namni marguma.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Margi ni coollaga; daraaraanis ni harcaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">dubbiin Allaah keenyaa garuu bara baraan ni jiraata.”<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Ati kan Xiyooniif oduu gaarii fiddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">tulluu dheeraatti ol baʼi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Ati kan Yerusaalemiif oduu gaarii fiddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">sagalee kee ol fudhuutii iyyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">ol fudhadhuu iyyi; hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">magaalaawwan Yihuudaatiinis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">“Allaahan keessan kunoo ti!” jedhi.<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Kunoo, Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan humnaan ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">irreen isaa jabaadhaanis ni bulcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Kunoo, gatiin isaa isa wajjin jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">gatiin inni namaaf kennu isuma harka jira.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Inni akkuma tiksee tokkootti bushaayee isaa tikfata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">xobbaallaawwan hoolaas irree isaatiin walitti qaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">ofitti qabees qoma isaatti hammata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">haadhota hoolotaa warra hoosisanis suutuma oofa.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Bishaanota konyee isaatiin kan safare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">yookaan shamaayʼuniiwwan taakkuu isaatiin kan safare eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Biyyoo lafaa safartuudhaan walitti kan qabe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">yookaan tulluuwwan madaaliidhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">gaarran immoo madaaliidhaan kan madaale eenyu?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Eenyutu Hafuura Rabbii Allaah qajeelchuu dandaʼe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">Yookaan namni gorsaa isaa taʼee isa barsiise eenyu?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Rabbii Allaahan hubannaa argachuuf eenyun gorsa gaafate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Daandii qajeelaas eenyutu isa barsiise?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Eenyutu beekumsa isaaf kennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">yookaan daandii hubannaa isa argisiise?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Dhugumaan saboonni akkuma copha baaldii keessaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">isaan akkuma awwaara madaalii irra jiruutti ilaalamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">inni biyyoota bishaan gidduu illee akkuma biyyoo bullaaʼaatti madaala.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Libaanoon qoraan iddoo aarsaatiif gaʼu hin qabdu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">yookaan horiin ishee aarsaa gubamuuf hin gaʼan.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Fuula isaa duratti saboonni hundinuu wayittuu hin lakkaaʼaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">isaan akka ilaalcha isaatti homaattuu hin hedaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">gatiis hin qaban.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Yoos Allaah eenyutti fakkeessitu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">Fakkii kam wajjin isa wal bira qabdu?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa tumtuu sibiilaatu baqsee tolcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">tumtuun warqees warqee itti uffisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">foncaa meetiitiinis ni miidhagsa.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Hiyyeessi aarsaa akkasii dhiʼeessuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">hin dandeenye tokko muka hin tortorre filata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa hin jigne dhaabuufis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">nama ogummaa hojii harkaa qabu barbaaddata.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Isin hin beektanii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Isin hin dhageenyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Wanni kun jalqabumaa kaasee isinitti hin himamnee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Isin erga lafti hundeeffamtee jalqabee hin hubannee?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Inni geengoo lafaatii ol taaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">uummanni lafaas akkuma korophisaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Inni shamaayʼuniiwwan akkuma golgaatti diriirsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">akka dunkaana keessa jiraataniittis isaan diriirsa.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Inni ilmaan moototaa faayidaa dhabsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">bulchitoota addunyaas harka duwwaa hambisa.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Akkuma isaan dhaabamaniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">akkuma isaan facaafamaniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">akkuma isaan lafa keessatti hidda yaafataniin, <optbreak /> inni isaanitti bubbise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">isaanis ni coollagan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">obombolettiinis akkuma habaqiitti isaan haxaaʼe.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />“Isin eenyutti na fakkeessitu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Yookaan eenyutu anaan qixxaata?” jedha Qulqullichi.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Ija keessan ol fudhadhaatii shamaayʼuniiwwan ilaalaa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">Eenyutu kanneen hunda uume?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Isa tuuta urjiiwwanii tokko tokkoon fidee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">tokkoo tokkoo isaanii maqaa maqaadhaan waamu sanaa dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Sababii humna isaa cimaa sanaatii fi jabina isaa guddaa sanaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">isaan keessaa tokko iyyuu hin dhabamu.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Yaa Yaaʼikuub, yaa Israaʼel, ati maaliif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">“Karaan koo Rabbii Allaah duraa dhokateera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">haajaan koos fuula Allaah koo duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">tuffatameera” jettee guungumta?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Ati hin beektuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Ati hin dhageenyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Rabbii Allaah bara baraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">inni Uumaa handaara lafaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Inni hin dadhabu yookaan haara hin galfatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">hubannaa isaas kan qoree bira gaʼu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Inni dadhabdootaaf jabina kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">nama laafaaf immoo humna dabala.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Ijoolleen iyyuu ni dadhabu; ni bututus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">dargaggoonnis gufatanii kufu;<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Warri Rabbii Allaah abdatan garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">humna isaanii ni haaromfatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Isaan akkuma risaa qoochoodhaan barrisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">ni fiigu; hin dadhaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">ni deemu; hin bututan.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Gargaaraa Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">“Yaa biyyoota bishaan gidduu, fuula koo duratti calʼisaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Saboonni jabina isaanii haa haaromfatan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">Isaan fuula duratti baʼanii haa dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">walii wajjin murtiidhaaf haa dhiʼaannu.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />“Kan baʼa biiftuutii nama tokko kakaasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">qajeelummaadhaan tajaajila isaatiif isa waame eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Inni saboota dabarsee harka isaatti kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">moototas isa jalatti bulcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Inni goraadee isaatiin daaraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">xiyya isaatiinis habaqii bubbeedhaan <optbreak /> bittinnaaʼu isaan godha.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Inni isaan ariʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">daandii miilli isaa irra deemee hin beekne irra nagaan darba.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Jalqabaa kaasee dhaloota waamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">waan kana kan tolchee fi hojjete eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Ani Rabbii Allaah isa duraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">isa dhumaatiifis ani isuma.”<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Biyyoonni bishaan gidduu arganii sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">daariiwwan lafaa ni hollatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Isaanis ni dhiʼaatu; gara fuula duraattis dhufu;<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />tokkoon tokkoon namaa wal gargaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">obboleessa isaatiinis, “Jabaadhu!” jedha.<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Tumtuun sibiilaa tumtuu warqee ni jajjabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">inni burruusaan wal qixxeessus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">isa gemmoo irratti sibiila tumu jajjabeessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Waaʼee sibiila walitti baqsuu, “Wanni kun gaarii dha” jedha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">Akka inni hin sochooneefis waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa sana <optbreak /> mismaaraan walitti qabsiisa.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />“Ati garuu, yaa garbicha koo Israaʼel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">yaa Yaaʼikuub kan ani filadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">sanyii Ibraahim michuu kootii,<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />ani handaara lafaatii si fudhadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">golee fagoodhaan si waammadhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Ani, ‘Ati garbicha koo ti’ siin jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">ani si filadheera; si hin gannes,<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Kanaafuu ati hin sodaatin; ani si wajjin jiraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">hin raafamin; ani Allaah keetii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Ani sin jabeessa; sin gargaaras;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">ani harka koo mirgaa qajeelaa sanaan hirkisee ol sin qaba.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />“Kunoo, warri sitti aaran hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">ni qaanaʼu; ni salphatus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">warri siin morman akka waan hin jirree taʼu; ni badus.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Ati diinota kee barbaadduu iyyuu, isaan hin argattu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">Warri waraana sitti banan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">guutumaan guutuutti akka waan hin jirree taʼan.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Ani Rabbii Allaahan kee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">harka kee mirgaa nan qabaatii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">inni, ‘Hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ani sin gargaaraa’ siin jedhus anuma.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Yaa Yaaʼikuub raammoo nana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Yaa Israaʼel xinnoo nana hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">ani mataan koo sin gargaaraatii” jedha Rabbii Allaahan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Furaan kee, Qulqullichi Israaʼel sun.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />“Ani kunoo, meeshaa ittiin midhaan dhaʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">meeshaa haaraa fi qaramaa kan ilkaan baayʼee qabu sin taasisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Ati tulluuwwan dhooftee caccabsita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">gaarran immoo akka habaqii goota.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Ati jara ni afarsita; qilleensis ol isaan fudhata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">bubbeen jabaan isaan bittinneessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Ati garuu Rabbii Allaahatti ni gammadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">Qulqullicha Israaʼelinis ulfina argatta.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />“Hiyyeeyyii fi rakkattoonni bishaan barbaadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">garuu homaa hin argatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">arrabni isaanii dheebuudhaan goggogeera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Ani Rabbii Allaahan garuu deebii nan kennaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">ani Allaahan Israaʼel jara hin gatu.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Lafa ol kaʼaa qullaa irra lageen nan yaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">sululoota keessa immoo burqaa nan burqisiisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Gammoojjii haroo bishaaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">lafa goges burqaa bishaaniitti nan geeddara.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Gammoojjii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">gaattiraa, laaftoo, kusaayee fi ejersa nan biqilcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Lafa onaa keessatti immoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">Birbirsa, qararoo fi hadheessa wal faana nan dhaaba.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Kunis akka namoonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">akka harki Rabbii Allaah waan kana hojjete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">akka Qulqullichi Israaʼel waan kana uume arganii beekaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">akkasumas akka hundi isaanii waan kana qalbeeffatanii hubataniif.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />“Dhimma keessan dhiʼeeffadhaa” jedha Rabbii Allaahan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">“Ragaa keessan fidadhaa” jedha mootiin Yaaʼikuub.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />“Akka isaan waan taʼuuf jiru nutti himaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">waaqeffatamtoota keessan tolfamoo fidadhaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Akka nu isaan hubannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">waan isaan dhuma irratti taʼan beeknuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">wantoonni bara dur maal akka turan nutti himaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">Yookaan wantoota dhufuuf jiran nutti odeessaa;<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />akka nu akka isin waaqeffatamtoota taatan beeknuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">waan fuul duratti taʼuuf jiru nutti himaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Akka nu rifannee sodaan guutamnuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">waan gaarii yookaan waan hamaa hojjedhaa.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Kunoo isin wayittuu hin hedamtan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">hojiin keessanis gonkumaa gatii hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">kan isin filatu kam iyyuu jibbisiisaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />“Ani nama tokko kaabaa nan kaase; innis dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">inni baʼa biiftuutii dhufus maqaa koo ni waammata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Inni akkuma suphee dhooftuun suphee dhidhiitu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">bulchitoota akka dhoqqeetti dhidhiita.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Akka nu beekuu dandeenyuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">eenyutu jalqabumaa kaasee waan kana dubbate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Yookaan akka nu, ‘Inni sirrii dha’ jechuu dandeenyuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">eenyutu duraan dursee waan kana dubbate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Eenyu iyyuu waan kana hin himne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">namni tokko iyyuu duraan dursee hin himne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">namni tokko iyyuu dubbii keessan hin dhageenye.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Namni jalqabatti, ‘Kunoo isaan as jiru!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">jedhee Xiyoonitti hime ana ture.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">Ani nama oduu gaarii himu tokko Yerusaalemiif kenneera.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Ani nan ilaale; garuu homtuu hin turre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">isaan keessaa namni gorsa kennu tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">yommuu ani isaan gaafadhus namni deebii kennu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Kunoo, hundi isaanii faayidaa hin qaban!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">Hojiin isaaniis gatii hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">fakkiiwwan isaaniis qilleensuma duwwaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Garbicha Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />“Tajaajilaan koo inni ani utubee dhaabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">filatamaan koo kan ani itti gammadu isa kana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">ani Hafuura koo isa irra nan kaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">inni sabootaaf murtii qajeelaa ni kenna.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Inni hin wacu yookaan hin iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">yookaan daandii irratti sagalee isaa hin dhageessisu.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Shambaqqoo buruqe hin cabsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">foʼaa ibsaa kan seequs hin dhaamsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">Inni amanamummaadhaan murtii qajeelaa ni fida;<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />hamma murtii qajeelaa lafa irratti fidutti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">inni hin dadhabu; abdiis hin kutatu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">Biyyoonni bishaan gidduu seera isaa ni abdatu.”<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Rabbii Allaahan shamaayʼuniiwwan uumee diriirse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">inni lafaa fi wantoota ishee keessa jiran hunda hojjete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">inni saba isheetiif hafuura baafatan kennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">warra ishee irra jiraataniifis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">jireenya kenne sun akkana jedha:<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />“Ani Rabbii Allaahan qajeelummaadhaan si waameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">harka kees nan qaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Ani si eegee sabootaaf kakuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">Namoota Ormaatiif immoo ifa sin taasisa;<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />atis ija jaamotaa ni banta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">mana hidhaatii boojiʼamtoota ni hiikta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">warra dukkana keessa jiraatanis hidhaadhaa ni baafta.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />“Ani Rabbii Allaah; maqaan koos kanaa dha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">Ani ulfina koo kan biraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">galata koos waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoof dabarsee hin kennu.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Kunoo wanni duraanii raawwatameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">anis waan haaraa nan dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">utuu isaan hin biqilin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ani waaʼee isaanii sitti nan odeessa.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Faarfannaa Galataa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Isin warri galaana buutanii fi wantoonni achi keessa jiraattan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">biyyoonni bishaan gidduu fi warri achi keessa jiraattan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">faarfannaa haaraa Rabbii Allaahaf faarfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">handaara lafaatiis galata isaa faarfadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Gammoojjii fi magaalaawwan ishee sagalee isaanii ol haa fudhatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">gandoonni Qeedaar keessa jiraatan haa gammadan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Namoonni Seelaa gammachuudhaan haa faarfatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">fiixee tulluuwwanii irraa haa iyyan.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Isaan Rabbii Allaahaf ulfina haa kennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">biyyoota bishaan gidduu keessattis galata isaa haa labsan.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Rabbii Allaahan akka nama jabaa tokkootti ni duula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">akka goota tokkoottis onnee isaa kakaasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">sagalee ol fudhatees ni dhaadata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">diinota isaa irrattis ol aantummaa argata.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />“Ani yeroo dheeraaf calʼiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">ani afaan qabadhee of dhowweera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Amma garuu akka dubartii ciniinsuun qabeetti nan iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">nan argana; hafuurris na cita.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Ani tulluuwwanii fi gaarran nan onsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">biqiltuuwwan isaanii hundas nan gogsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">ani lageen biyyoota bishaan gidduutti nan geeddara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">haroowwanis nan gogsa.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Ani jaamota karaa isaan hin beekne irra nan qajeelcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">daandii duraan hin beekamin irra nan deemsisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">ani dukkana fuula isaanii dura jiru ifatti nan geeddara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">lafa buʼaa bayiis wal nan qixxeessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Wanni ani hojjedhu kanneenii dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">ani isaan hin dhiisu.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Warri waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo amanatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">kanneen fakkiiwwaniin, ‘Isin waaqeffatamtoota keenya’ jedhan garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">duubatti deebiʼu; ni salphatus.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israaʼel Jaamaa fi Duudaa dha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />“Isin duudota nana, dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">jaamota nana, ilaalaa; argaas!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Tajaajilaa koo malee jaamaan eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Duudaan akka malaʼikkaa ani ergu sanaas eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Jaamaan akka nama anaaf of kennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">jaamaan akka Garbicha Rabbii Allaah eenyu?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Ati waan baayʼee argite; garuu hin qalbeeffanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">gurri kee banaa dha; garuu ati waan tokko iyyuu hin dhageessu.”<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Waaʼee qajeelummaa isaatiif jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">seera isaa guddisuu fi ulfina qabeessa gochuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">Rabbii Allaah gammachiiseera.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Sabni kun garuu saba saamamee boojiʼamee dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">hundii isaanii boolla keessatti kiyyoodhaan qabamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">mana hidhaa keessas dhokfamaniiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Isaan fudhatamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">kan isaan baraarus hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">isaan boojiʼamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">namni, “Isaan deebisaa” jedhus hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Isin keessaa eenyutu waan kana dhaggeeffata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">Bara dhufuuf jiru keessas eenyutu qalbeeffatee dhagaʼa?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Eenyutu Yaaʼikuubin boojuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Israaʼelinis saamtotatti dabarsee kenne?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Kan nu cubbuu itti hojjenne, Rabbii Allaah mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Isaan sababii karaa isaa duukaa hin buuneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">seera isaatiif hin ajajamne.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Kanaafuu inni dheekkamsa isaa bobaʼaa sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">waraana hamaas isaanitti erge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Arraba ibiddaatiin isaan marse; isaan garuu hin hubanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">ibiddi sunis isaan gube; isaan garuu hin qalbeeffanne.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Fayyisaa Israaʼel Tokkicha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Amma garuu yaa Yaaʼikuub, Rabbii Allaahan inni si uume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">yaa Israaʼel, inni si tolche akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">“Ani si fureeraatii hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">ani maqaa keetiin si waameera; ati kan koo ti.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Yommuu ati bishaan keessa dabartu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">ani si wajjinan jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">yommuu ati lageen ceetus, isaan si hin liqimsan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Yommuu ibidda keessa deemtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">ati hin gubattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">arrabni ibiddaas si hin gubu.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Ani Rabbii Allaahan kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Qulqullichi Israaʼel Fayyisaa keeti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">ani biyya Gibxi furii keetiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">qooda kee immoo Kuushii fi Saabaa nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Waan ati ija koo duratti jaallatamaa fi kabajamaa taateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">anis waanan si jaalladhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">qooda kee namoota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">qooda lubbuu keetii immoo saboota nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Ani si wajjinan jiraatii hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">ani ijoollee kee baʼa biiftuutii nan fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">lixa biiftuutiis walitti sin qaba.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Ani Kaabaan, ‘Isaan gad dhiisi!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">Kibbaan immoo ‘Isaan hin dhowwin’ nan jedha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Ilmaan koo fagoodhaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">intallan koo immoo handaara lafaatii fidi;<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />kan maqaa kootiin waamame hunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">kanneen ani ulfina kootiif uume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">warra ani tolchee fi hojjedhe sana fidaa.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Warra utuu ija qabanuu jaamanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">utuu gurra qabanuu duudan gad baasi.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Sabni hundi tokkummaadhaan walitti haa qabamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">namoonnis wal haa gaʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Isaan keessaa namni duraan dursee waan kana nutti himee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">wantoota duraas nuuf labse eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Akka warri kaan dhagaʼanii, “Kun dhugaa dha” jedhaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">akka dhugaa qabeeyyii taʼuun isaanii mirkaneeffamuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">isaan dhuga baatota isaanii haa dhiʼeeffatan.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">“Akka isin beektanii na amantaniif</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">akka ani isa taʼes akka hubattaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">isin dhuga baatota koo, garbicha koo kan ani filadhee dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Anaan dura waaqeffatamaan hin hojjetamne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">anaan booddees hin jiraatu.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Ana, anuma qofatu Rabbii Allaah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">ana malees fayyisaan biraa hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ani mulʼiseera; fayyiseera; labseeras;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">ana malee waaqeffatamaan ormaa gidduu keessan hin turre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Akka ani Allaah taʼe, isin dhuga baatota koo ti” <optbreak /> jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />“Bara duriitii jalqabee ani isuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">Namni tokko iyyuu harka kootii waa baasuu hin dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">Ani nan hojjedha; eenyutu dhowwuu dandaʼa?”<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Araara Allaahatii fi Amanamummaa Dhabuu Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Rabbii Allaahan Furiin kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Qulqullichi Israaʼel akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Ani isiniif jedhee Baabilonitti loltoota ergee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">dooniiwwan isaan ittiin boonaniin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">namoota Baabilon hunda boojiʼee nan fida.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ani Rabbii Allaahan, Qulqullicha keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">Uumaa Israaʼel, Mootii keessanii dha.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Rabbii Allaahan inni, galaana keessaan karaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">bishaanota jajjaboo keessaan immoo daandii tolche akkana jedha;<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />inni gaariiwwanii fi fardeen, loltootaa fi gargaartota isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">tokkummaadhaan ariʼee baase akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">isaan achuma ciciisu; lammatas hin kaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">akkuma foʼaa ibsaattis dhaamanii badu;<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />“Wantoota durii irraanfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">waan darbettis hin cichinaa.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Kunoo, ani waan haaraa tokko nan hojjedhaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">Innis amma ni biqila; isin hin hubattanii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Ani gammoojjii keessatti karaa nan qopheessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">lafa onaa keessattis burqaa nan burqisiisa.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Bineensonni bosonaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">waangoowwanii fi guchiiwwan ulfina naaf kennu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">akka sabni koo kan ani filadhe dhuguuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">ani gammoojjii keessatti bishaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">lafa onaa keessattis burqaa nan kennaatii;<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />sabni ani ofii kootiif filadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">akka na galateeffatuuf ture.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />“Yaa Yaaʼikuub, ati garuu na hin waammanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">yaa Israaʼel, ati fuula koo duratti dadhabdeerta.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Ati aarsaa gubamuu fi hoolota naaf hin fidne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">yookaan aarsaa keetiin ulfina naaf hin kennine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Ani aarsaa midhaaniitiin si hin rakkifne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">yookaan aarsaa ixaanaa gaafachuudhaan si hin dadhabsiifne.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Ati qundhii urgaa gaarii qabu naa hin binne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">yookaan cooma qalma keetiitiin na hin quubsine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Garuu baʼaa cubbuu keetii natti feete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">yakka keetiinis na dadhabsiifte.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />“Kan ofii kootiif jedhee yakka kee sirraa haqee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">cubbuu kees deebiʼee hin yaadanne, ani anuma.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Mee waan darbe irra naa deebiʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">walitti dhufnee dubbii kana irratti haa falminu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">dubbii kee dhiʼeeffadhuutii qajeelaa taʼuu kee mirkaneeffadhu.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Abbaan kee kan jalqabaa cubbuu hojjete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">barsiistonni kee natti fincilan.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Kanaafuu ani itti gaafatamtoota <optbreak /> mana qulqullummaa keetii nan salphisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Yaaʼikuubin badiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Israaʼelin immoo tuffiif dabarsee nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Israaʼel Saba Filatamaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />“Amma garuu yaa Yaaʼikuub garbicha ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">yaa Israaʼel kan ani si filadhe, dhaggeeffadhu.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Rabbii Allaahan inni si uume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">kan gadameessa keessatti si tolche,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">inni si gargaaru sun akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">Yaa garbicha koo Yaaʼikuub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">yaa Yishuruun kan ani si filadhe hin sodaatin.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Ani lafa dheebote irratti bishaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">lafa gogaa irratti burqaa nan dhangalaasaatii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">ani ijoollee kee irratti Hafuura koo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">sanyii kee irratti immoo eebba koo nan dhangalaasa.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Isaan akkuma marga bishaan gidduutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">akka muka alaltuu kan qarqara lagaa jiruutti ni lalisu.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Namni tokko, ‘Ani kan Rabbii Allaah ti’ ofiin jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">kan biraa maqaa Yaaʼikuubiin of waama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">kaan immoo harka isaa irratti, ‘Ani kan Rabbii Allaah ti’ <optbreak /> jedhee barreeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">maqaa Israaʼeliinis of waama.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rabbii Allaahan Tokkichuma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />“Rabbii Allaahan Mootii fi Furiin Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Ani kan jalqabaa ti; ani kan dhumaatis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">ana malee Allaahan biraa hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Yoos kan akka koo eenyu? Mee inni hafuura haa baafatu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Inni waan erga ani saba koo kan durii hundeessee as taʼe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">waan hamma ammaatti hin taʼin haa dubbatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">fuula koo durattis haa ibsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">waan gara fuulduraatti taʼu illee duraan dursee haa himu.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Hin rifatinaa; hin sodaatinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Ani waan kana labsee bara dheeraan dura sitti hin himnee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Isin dhuga baatota koo ti. Ana malee Allaahan biraa jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Lakkii, Kattaan biraa hin jiru; ani tokko iyyuu hin beeku.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Warri waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo tolchan hundi gatii hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">wanni isaan hawwan faayidaa hin qabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:9">Warri isaaniif falmanis jaamota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">isaan beekumsa hin qaban; kanaafuu ni qaaneffamu.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Eenyutu waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:10">fakkii homaa isa hin fayyadne tolcha?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Isaa fi namni akka isaa ni qaaneffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">ogeeyyiin hojii harkaas namootuma malee homaa miti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:11">Isaan hundi walitti qabamanii iddoo tokko haa dhaabatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">isaan ni naʼu; ni salphatus.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Tumtuun meeshaa ittiin waa tumu harkatti qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">cilee bobaʼu irratti ittiin hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">inni burruusaan waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa tolcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">irree isaa jabaadhaanis ni miidhagsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">Inni ni beelaʼa; humnas ni dhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">bishaan hin dhugu; ni gaggabas.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Namni muka soofu funyoodhaan safara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">cilaattiidhaan mallattoo itti godha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">qirixiidhaan qiriixee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">safartuudhaan mallattoo itti godha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Fakkii namaatiin hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">akka inni galma waaqeffannaa keessa jiraatuufis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">miidhagina namaa itti tolcha.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Inni birbirsa mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">gaattiraa yookaan qilxuu filata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:14">Akka inni mukkeen bosonaa keessatti guddatuuf ni dhiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">yookaan hadheessa dhaaba; bokkaanis isa guddisa.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Mukni sun qoraan bobeeffamu taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">namni muraasa isaa fudhatee bobeessee qaqqaammata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">ibidda qabsiisee buddeena ittiin tolfata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:15">Allaah sobaas tolfatee waaqeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">waaqeffatamaa tolfamaas tolfatee gad jedhee sagadaaf.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Gartokkee mukkeen sanaa ni bobeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">isa irratti nyaata bilcheeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">foonis irratti waaddatee hamma quufutti nyaata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:16">Ibidda qaqqaammachaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">“Ishoo! Ibiddi natti hoʼe; ibidda nan arga” jedha.<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Mukkeen hafaniin immoo waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa, <optbreak /> waaqeffatamaa isaa tolfamaa tolfata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">gad jedhees ni sagadaaf.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:17">Isa duratti duʼaa godhatees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">“Situ Allaah koo ti; na baraari” jedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Isaan homaa hin beekan; homaa hin hubatanis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">akka arguu hin dandeenyeef iji isaanii haguugameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">akka hin hubanneefis qalbiin isaanii cufameera.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Namni tokko iyyuu itti hin yaadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">namni tokko iyyuu akkana jechuuf beekumsa <optbreak /> yookaan hubannaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">“Ani walakkaa isaa qoraan godhadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">cilee isaa irratti buddeena tolfadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">foon ittiin waaddadhee nyaadheera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">Ani amma waan hafe kanaan waan jibbisiisaa nan hojjedhaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">Ani gad jedhee jirmaaf sagaduu qabaa?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Inni daaraa nyaata; garaan gowwoomfames karaa irraa isa jalʼiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">inni of oolchuu yookaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">“Wanni harka koo mirgaa keessa jiru kun soba mitii?” <optbreak /> jechuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />“Yaa Yaaʼikuub, ati waan kana yaadadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">yaa Israaʼel, ati garbicha koo ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Ani si tolcheera; atis garbicha koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">yaa Israaʼel, ani si hin dagadhu.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Ani yakka kee akkuma duumessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">cubbuu kees akkuma hurrii ganamaa haxaaʼee balleesseera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Ani si fureeraatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">ati gara kootti deebiʼi.”<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Yaa shamaayʼuniiwwan, Rabbii Allaahan waan kana godheeraatii <optbreak /> gammachuudhaan faarfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">yaa qileewwan lafaa, gammachuudhaan iyyaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Isin yaa tulluuwwan, bosonoonnii fi mukkeen keessan hundi ililchaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Rabbii Allaahan Yaaʼikuubin furee Israaʼel keessatti ulfina isaa ibseeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusaalem Lafa Jireenyaa Ni Taati</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />“Rabbii Allaahan Furiin kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">kan gadameessa keessatti si tolche akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Ani Rabbii Allaahan Tolchaan waan hundaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">isa shamaayʼuniiwwan diriirse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">isa ofuma kootiin lafa illee diriirsee dha;<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />isa mallattoo nabiiʼiyyoota sobaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">busheessee ilaaltota raatessu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">isa ogeeyyii duubatti deebisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">beekumsa isaanii faayidaa dhabsiisuu dha;<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />isa dubbii garboota isaa mirkaneessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">raajii ergamoota isaa fiixaan baasu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:26" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">isa, ‘Isheen iddoo jireenyaa ni taati’ jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">waaʼee Yerusaalem dubbate, isa, ‘Isaan ni ijaaramu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">diigamaa isaaniis nan haaromsa’ jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">waaʼee magaalaawwan Yihuudaa dubbatuu dha;<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />isa tuujubaan, ‘Ati gogi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">ani lageen kee nan gogsa’ jedhu,<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />isa Qiirosin, ‘Inni tiksee koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">fedhii koo hundas ni raawwata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">inni waaʼee Yerusaalem, “Isheen deebifamtee haa ijaaramtu”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">waaʼee mana qulqullummaa immoo, “Hundeen isaa haa hundeeffamu”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">jedhee dubbatu sun anuma.’<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />“Rabbii Allaahan dibamaa isaa Qiiros,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">kan ani saboota isa jalatti bulchuu fi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">hidhannaa moototaa hiiksisuuf jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">harka isaa mirgaa qabee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">akka karrawwan hin cufamneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">balbalawwan banuuf sanaan akkana jedha:<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Ani fuula kee dura deemee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">tulluuwwan wal nan qixxeessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">karrawwan naasii nan caccabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">danqaraawwan sibiilaas nan kukkuta.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Ati akka ani Rabbii Allaahan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">Allaah Israaʼel isa maqaa keetiin si waamu taʼe akka beektuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">ani badhaadhummaa dukkana keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">qabeenya lafa dhoksaatti kuufames siif nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Ati na beekuu baattu iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">ani garbicha koo Yaaʼikuubiif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">Israaʼel filatamaa kootiif jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">maqaa keetiin si waameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">maqaa ulfinaas siif kenneera.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Ani Rabbii Allaah; ana malee kan biraa hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">ana malee Allaahan tokko iyyuu hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">Ati na beekuu baattu iyyuu, ani sin jabeessa;<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Kunis akka namoonni baʼa biiftuutii hamma lixa biiftuutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">ana malee kan biraa akka hin jirre beekaniif.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">Ani Rabbii Allaah; ana malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Ani ifa nan tolcha; dukkanas nan uuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">badhaadhummaa nan fida; balaas nan uuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">ani Rabbii Allaahan wantoota kanneen hunda nan godha.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />“Yaa shamaayʼuniiwwan, isin ol gubbaadhaa qajeelummaa roobsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">duumessoonnis gad coccobsaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Lafti haa banamtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">fayyinni haa biqilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">qajeelummaanis isa wajjin haa guddatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">ani Rabbii Allaahan waan kana uumeera.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />“Qiraacii qiraaciidhuma lafaa taʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Uumaa isaatiin wal loluuf wayyoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Supheen, suphee dhooftuudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Ati maal hojjechaa jirta?’ jedhaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Hojiin ati hojjettus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Inni harka hin qabu’ siin jedhaa?<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Nama Abbaadhaan, ‘Ati maal dhalchite?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">yookaan haadhaan, ‘Ati maal deesse?’ jedhuuf wayyoo.<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />“Rabbii Allaahan, Qulqullichi Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">Uumaan ishee sun akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Isin waaʼee wantoota dhufuuf jiranii jechuunis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">‘Waaʼee ijoollee koo na gaafadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">yookaan waaʼee hojii harka koo na ajajaa.’<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Kan lafa tolchee namas ishee irratti uume ana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">Harki koo shamaayʼuniiwwan diriirseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">raayyaa isaanii hundas ajajeera.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Ani qajeelummaa kootiin Qiirosin ol nan kaasa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">Karaa isaa hundas wal nan qixxeessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Inni magaalaa koo deebisee ijaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">boojiʼamtoota koos bilisa baasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">garuu gatiidhaan yookaan badhaasaan miti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">jedha Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu.”<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">“Qabeenyi Gibxii fi daldalli Itoophiyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">namoonni dhedheeroon Saabaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">gara kee ni dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">kan kees ni taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">isaan foncaadhaan hidhamanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">dugda duubaan si duukaa buʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Fuula kee durattis gad jedhanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Dhugumaan Allaahan si wajjin jira; <optbreak /> isa malees tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">isa malees Allaahan biraa hin jiru’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">jedhanii si kadhatu.”<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Yaa Allaah, Fayyisaa Israaʼel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">ati dhugumaan Allaah of dhoksituu dha.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Warri waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo tolchan hundinuu ni qaanaʼu; ni salphatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">walii wajjinis salphina keessa buʼu.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Israaʼel garuu fayyina bara baraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">Rabbii Allaahan ni fayyifama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">isin bara baraan hin qaanoftan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">yookaan hin salphattan.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">kan shamaayʼuniiwwan uume, inni Allaaha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">inni lafa miidhagsee tolchee ishee hundeesse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">inni akka isheen iddoo jireenyaa taatuuf ishee uume malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">akka isheen ona taatuuf ishee hin uumne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">inni akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">“Ani Rabbii Allaah; ana malee kan biraa hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Ani biyya dukkanaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">dhoksaadhaan hin dubbanne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">ani sanyiiwwan Yaaʼikuubiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">‘Akkasumaan na barbaadaa’ hin jenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ani Rabbii Allaahan dhugaa nan dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">waan qajeelaas nan labsa.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />“Walitti qabamaa kottaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">isin baqattoonni sabootaa wal gaʼaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Warri waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa muka irraa hojjetame baatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">kanneen waaqeffatamtoota fayyisuu hin dandeenye waammatan <optbreak /> homaa beekumsa hin qaban.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Waanan taʼuu qabu dubbadhaa; dhiʼeeffadhaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">isaanis walii wajjin haa mariʼatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Eenyutu waan kana duraan dursee bara dheeraan dura hime?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Duruma iyyuu eenyutu labse?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Anuma Rabbii Allaah mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Ana malee Allaahan qajeelaa fi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Fayyisaan tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">ana malee tokko illee hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />“Isin warri handaara lafaa hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">gara kootti deebiʼaatii fayyaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">ani Allaaha; ana malee kan biraa hin jiruutii.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Ani mataa kootiin kakadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">afaan koos akkana jedhee qajeelummaadhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">dubbii hin geeddaramne dubbateera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">‘Jilbi hundi fuula koo duratti ni jilbeenfata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">arrabni hundis anaan kakata.’<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Isaanis, ‘Qajeelummaa fi jabinni Rabbii Allaah qofaan argama’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">jedhanii waaʼee koo ni dubbatu.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Warri aariidhaan isatti kaʼan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">gara isaa dhufanii ni qaanaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Sanyiin Israaʼel hundi garuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">Rabbii Allaahan qajeeltota taasifamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">ni kabajamus.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Waaqeffatamtoota Baabilon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beel gad jedha; Neboo akka malee gugguufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">waaqeffatamtoonni isaanii tolfamoon kotte duudaa fi horiitti feʼamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">fakkiiwwan isaan qabatanii jooran baʼaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">horii dadhabeef baʼaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Isaan gugguufanii walii wajjin gad jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">baʼaa sana oolchuu hin dandaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">isaan iyyuu ni boojiʼamu.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />“Yaa mana Yaaʼikuub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">isin hambaan mana Israaʼel hundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">warri ani gaafa isin gadameessa keessatti <optbreak /> uumamtanii jalqabee ol isin qabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">gaafa dhalattanii jalqabees isin baadhe hundi dhaggeeffadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Hamma dulloomtanii arrii baaftanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ani isa; isuma isin jiraachisuu dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Ani isin uumeera; isinan baadhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ani isinan jiraachisa; isinan baraaras.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />“Isin eenyuun wal bira na qabdu yookaan eenyuun wal na qixxeessitu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">Akka wal madaalluufis eenyutti na fakkeessitu?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Namoonni tokko tokko korojoo isaanii keessaa warqee gad naqanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">madaalliidhaan meetii madaalu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">waaqeffatamaa tolchuuf jedhanii tumtuu warqee qacaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">isaanis gad jedhanii sagaduuf.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Ol fuudhanii gatiittii isaaniitti ni baatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">iddoo isaatti ni deebisu; innis achi dhaabata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">Inni iddoo sanaa sochoʼuu hin dandaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Yoo namni gara isaatti iyye iyyuu, inni deebii hin kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">inni rakkoo isaa keessaa isa baasuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />“Yaa finciltoota, waan kana yaadadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">qalbiittis qabadhaa; garaa keessan keessas kaaʼadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Wantoota darban kanneen bara durii yaadadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ani Allaaha; kan biraa hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ani Allaaha; kan akka koo hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ani dhuma waan tokkoo jalqabumatti nan labsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">waan amma iyyuu dhufuuf jiru, ani durumaa jalqabee dubbadheera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Ani, ‘Kaayoon koo cimee jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">waan na gammachiisu hundas nan hojjedha’ nan jedha.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Baʼa biiftuutii allaattii waa adamsitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">lafa fagootii immoo nama kaayyoo koo fiixaan baasu nan waama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Ani waanan dubbadhe nan guuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">waanan karoorfadhes nan raawwadha.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Yaa mata jabeeyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">isin warri qajeelummaa irraa fagoo jirtan na dhaggeeffadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Ani qajeelummaa koo nan dhiʼeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">innis fagoo hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">fayyisuun koos hin barfatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Ani Xiyooniif fayyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Israaʼeliif immoo ulfina koo nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Kufaatii Baabilon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />“Yaa intala Baabilon Durba Qulqullittii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">gad buʼi; awwaara irra taaʼi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">yaa Intala Baabilonotaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">teessoo malee lafa taaʼi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Ati siʼachi bareedduu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">yookaan kichuu jedhamtee hin waamamtu.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Dhagaa daakuu fudhadhuutii midhaan daaki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">haguuggii kee of irraa fuudhi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">Wandaboo kee soqoladhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">gudeeda kee mulʼisi; laga ceʼi.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Qullaan kee ifatti ni baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">qaaniin kees hin dhokatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Ani haaloo nan baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">ani nama tokko iyyuu hin dhiisu.”<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Furiin keenya maqaan isaa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">inni Qulqullicha Israaʼel.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />“Yaa Intala Baabilonotaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">calʼisii taaʼiitii dukkana seeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">ati siʼachi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">mootittii mootummootaa jedhamtee hin waamamtu.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Ani saba kootti dheekkameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">handhuuraa koos xureesseera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">ani dabarsee harka keetti isaan kenneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">atis garaa hin laafneef.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Warra dullooman irra iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">waanjoo ulfaataa keesse.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Ati, ‘Ani bara baraan itti fufee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">mootittii bara baraa nan taʼa!’ jette.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">Ati garuu wantoota kana hin hubanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">yookaan dhumni isaanii maal akka taʼu hin yaadanne.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />“Ammas yaa ishee qananiituu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">kan nagaan jiraattee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">garaa kee keessattis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">‘Anuma; ana malee tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">ani siʼachi haadha hiyyeessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">yookaan nama dhalee dhabe hin taʼu’ ofiin jettu dhagaʼi.<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Wantoonni kunneen lamaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">dhalanii dhabuu fi haadha hiyyeessaa taʼuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">akkuma tasaa guyyuma tokkotti sitti dhufu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">Isaan baayʼina falfala keetiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">tolcha kee cimaa sanaa hunda irraan iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">humna isaanii guutuudhaan sitti dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Ati hammina kee amanattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">‘Namni tokko iyyuu na hin argu’ jette.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Yeroo ati garaa kee keessatti, ‘Ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">ana malee namni biraa hin jiru’ jettutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">ogummaa fi beekumsi kee si dogoggorsu.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Wanni hamaan sitti dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ati immoo eessaa akka inni dhufu hin beektu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Balaan ati of irraa ittisuu hin dandeenye tokko sitti dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">badiisni ati duraan dursitee hin beekin akkuma tasaa sitti dhufa.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />“Yoos ati tolcha keetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">falfala kee baayʼee ijoollummaa keetii jalqabdee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">itti dadhabde sana jabeessii eegi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Yoo akkas taʼe ati ni milkoofta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">yoo akkas taʼe nama ni sodaachifta taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Gorsi ati argatte hundi dadhabbii qofa sitti fide!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">Urjii lakkooftonni kee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">warri jiʼa jiʼaan urjii ilaalanii raajan sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">mee waan sitti dhufu duraa si haa baasan kaa.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Dhugumaan isaan akkuma cidii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">ibiddi isaan guba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Isaan mataa isaanii iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">humna arraba ibiddaa jalaa baasuu hin dandaʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Barbadaan ibiddaa kan namni hoʼifatu <optbreak /> tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">ibiddi bira taaʼanis hin argamu.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Wanni warri ati wajjin dadhabdee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">ijoollummaa keetii jalqabdee wajjin daldalte sun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">siif gochuu dandaʼan kanuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">Tokkoon tokkoon isaanii dogoggora isaanii itti fufan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">kan si baasuu dandaʼu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Mataa Jabaachuu Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />“Yaa mana Yaaʼikuub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">isin warri maqaa Israaʼeliin waamamtan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">kanneen sanyii Yihuudaa irraa argamtan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">isin warri maqaa Rabbii Allaahatiin kakattanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">garuu dhugaadhaan yookaan qajeelummaadhaan utuu hin taʼin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">maqaa Allaah Israaʼel dhooftan waan kana dhaggeeffadhaa;<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />isin warri maqaa magaalaa qulqullittiitiin of waamtan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">kanneen Allaah Israaʼelitti irkattan, <optbreak /> waan kana dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">maqaan isaa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu dha:<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Ani wantoota durii duraan dursee dubbadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">isaan afaan kootii baʼan; 1 anis akka isaan beekaman nan godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">anis akkuma tasaa hojjedhe; isaanis ni raawwataman.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Ani akka ati mata jabeessa taate beekeen tureetii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ribuun morma keetii sibiila ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">addi kee naasii ture.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Kanaafuu ani wantoota kanneen bara dheeraan dura sitti himeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ani akka ati, ‘waaqeffatamtoota koo tolfamootu isaan hojjete;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">fakkii koo kan muka irraa hojjetamee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa sibiila irraa hojjetametu murteesse’ <optbreak /> jechuu hin dandeenyeef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">utuu isaan hin uumaminiin dura sitti himeera.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Ati wantoota kanneen dhageesseerta; isaan hunda ilaali.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">Ati isaan amantee hin fudhattuu?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">“Ani ammaa jalqabee waan haaraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">waan dhokfamee jiru kan ati hin beekin sitti nan hima.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Isaan amma uumaman malee bara dheeraan dura miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">ati harʼaan dura waaʼee isaanii hin dhageenye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Kanaafuu ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">‘Kunoo ani waaʼee isaanii beekeen ture’ <optbreak /> jechuu hin dandeessu.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Ati takkumaa dhageessee yookaan hubattee hin beektu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">gurri kee durumaa jalqabee hin banamne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Ani akka ati micciiramaa taate beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ati dhaloota keetii jalqabdee fincilaa jedhamtee waamamte.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Ani maqaa kootiif jedhee dheekkamsa koo nan tursiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ani akka si hin balleessineef galata kootiif jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">dheekkamsa koo duubatti harkisa.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Kunoo, ani yoo akka meetiitti taʼuu baate iyyuu <optbreak /> si qulqulleesseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">ibidda dhiphinaa keessattis qoree si ilaaleera.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Ani ofii kootiif jedhee, ofuma kootiif jedhee waan kana nan godha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Maqaan koo akkamitti baduu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Ani ulfina koo dabarsee kan biraatiif hin kennu.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israaʼel Bilisoomte</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />“Yaa Yaaʼikuub, Yaa Israaʼel kan ani si waame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">na dhaggeeffadhu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Ani isuma; ani kan jalqabaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">ani kan dhumaa ti.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Harki koo hundeewwan lafaa dhaabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">harki koo mirgaa immoo shamaayʼuniiwwan diriirse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">yommuu ani isaan waamutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">hundi isaanii walii wajjin dhaabatu.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />“Hundi keessan walitti qabamaatii dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo keessaa kamitu duraan dursee <optbreak /> wantoota kanneen dubbate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Michuun Rabbii Allaah filatamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">kaayyoo Allaaha Baabilon irratti fiixaan baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">irreen isaa Baabilonotatti kaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Ani, ani mataan koo dubbadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">dhugumaan ani isa waameera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:15">Ani isa nan fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">innis karaa isaa irratti ni milkaaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />“Natti dhiʼaadhaatii waan kana dhagaʼaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">“Ani jalqabumaa kaasee dhoksaatti hin dubbanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">yeroo wanni sun taʼettis ani achuman ture.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Ammas Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaanii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">Hafuurri isaa na erganiiru.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Rabbii Allaahan Furiin kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">Qulqullichi Israaʼel akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">“Ani Rabbii Allaah kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">kan waan siif tolu si barsiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">kan karaa ati deemuu qabdu irra si qajeelchuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Ati utuu ajaja koo qalbeeffattee jiraattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">nagaan kee akka lagaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">qajeelummaan kee immoo akka dhaʼaa galaanaa taʼa ture.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Sanyiin kee akkuma cirrachaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">ijoolleen kee akkuma biyyoo lafaa baayʼatu ture;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">maqaan isaanii hin haqamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">isaanis fuula koo duraa hin dhabaman ture.”<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Baabilon keessaa baʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Baabilonota duraa baqadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Waan kana iyya gammachuutiin beeksisaa; labsaas.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Hamma handaara lafaatti dabarsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">“Rabbii Allaahan garbicha isaa Yaaʼikuubin fureera” jedhaa.<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Isaan yommuu inni lafa gammoojjii keessa isaan qajeelchetti <optbreak /> hin dheebonne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">inni kattaa keessaa bishaan burqisiiseef;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">inni kattaa dhoosee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">bishaanis humnaan cabsee baʼe.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />“Hamootaaf nagaan hin jiru” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Tajaajilaa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Yaa biyyoota bishaan gidduu na dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">yaa saboota fagoo jiraattan waan kana dhagaʼaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Utuu ani hin dhalatin dura Rabbii Allaahan na waame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">utuu ani gadameessa haadha koo keessa jiruu maqaa naa baase.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Inni afaan koo akka goraadee qaramee godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">gaaddidduu harka isaatiin na dhokse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">xiyya cululuqfame na godhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">manʼee xiyya isaa keessa na kaaʼate.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Innis, “Yaa Israaʼel, ati garbicha koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">kan ani ulfina koo isa irratti mulʼisuu dha” anaan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Ani garuu, “Akkasumaanan itti dadhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">humna koos waanuma faayidaa hin qabnettan fixe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Taʼus dhugaan koo harka Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">gatiin koos Allaah bira jira” nan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Waan ani fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti ulfina argadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Allaahan koo jabina naa taʼeef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Rabbii Allaahan inni akka ani Yaaʼikuubin deebisee gara isaatti fiduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Israaʼelin isa biratti walitti qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">akka ani garbicha isaa taʼuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">gadameessa keessatti na tolche sun akkana jedha;<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Innis, “Ati gosoota Yaaʼikuub deebiftee dhaabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Israaʼeloota ani eege sanas deebiftee fiduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">garbicha koo taʼuun kee siif baayʼee salphaa dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Akka fayyinni koo qarqara lafaa gaʼuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ani Namoota Ormaatiif ibsaa sin taasisa” jedha.<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Rabbii Allaahan Furii fi Qulqullichi Israaʼel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">isa namaan tuffatamee sabnis jibbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">tajaajilaa bulchitootaa sanaan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">“Sababii Rabbii Allaahan amanamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Qulqullicha Israaʼel isa si filate sanaatiif</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">jedhanii mootonni si arganii ol kaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">ilmaan moototaas arganii sagadu.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deebifamtee Ijaaramuu Israaʼel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">“Ani yeroo fudhatama qabutti siifin deebisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">gaafa fayyinaattis sin gargaara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">akka ati dhaala abbaa hin qabne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">deebiftee dhaalchiftuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">ani sin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">akka ati sabaaf kakuu taatus sin godha;<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />akka ati warra boojiʼamaniin, ‘Kottaa baʼaa’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">warra dukkana keessa jiraataniin immoo, ‘Bilisa baʼaa’ jettu sin godha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 49:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">“Isaan karaa irratti waa nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">gaara qulqullaaʼaa irrattis iddoo qubataa argatu.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Isaan hin beelaʼan; hin dheebotanis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">hoʼi gammoojjii yookaan aduun isaan hin gubu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Inni isaaniif garaa laafu isaan geggeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">qarqara burqaa bishaanii irra isaan qajeelcha.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Tulluuwwan koo hunda karaatti nan geeddara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">daandiiwwan koo gurguddaanis wal qixxeeffamu.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Kunoo, isaan biyya fagoodhaa ni dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">gariin kaabaa, gariin dhiʼaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">kaan immoo biyya Aswaaniitii ni dhufu.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Yaa shamaayʼuniiwwan, ililchaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">yaa lafa gammadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">yaa tulluuwwan, guddisaa faarfadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Rabbii Allaahan saba isaa ni jajjabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">warra rakkataniifis garaa ni laafaatii.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Xiyoon garuu, “Rabbii Allaahan na gateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">Gooftaanis na irraanfateera” jette.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />“Haati daaʼima ishee kan hoosiftu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">irraanfachuu ni dandeessii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Mucaa deesseefis garaa hin laaftuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Yoo isheen irraanfatte iyyuu ani si hin irraanfadhu!<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Kunoo, ani barruu harka koo irratti si qirixeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">dallaawwan kee yeroo hunda fuula koo dura jiru.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Ilmaan kee ariitiidhaan ni dachaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">warri si diiganis sirraa baqatu.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Ija kee ol fudhadhuutii naannoo kee ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">ilmaan kee hundi walitti qabamanii gara kee ni dhufu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Ani jiraataadhaatii” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">“Ati isaan kanneen hunda akka faayaatti ni uffatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">akka misirroottis ittiin miidhagfamta.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />“Ati diigamtee ontee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">biyyi kee barbadaaʼu iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">amma saba keetti lafti ni dhiphata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">warri si liqimsan sirraa ni fagaatu.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Ijoolleen ati yeroo gadda keetiitti deesse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">utuma gurri kee dhagaʼuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">‘Lafti kun nutti dhiphateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">lafa irra jiraannu nuuf kenni’ siin jedhu.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Ergasii ati garaa keetti akkana jetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Eenyutu jara kanneen naa daʼe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ani gaddituu fi maseentuun ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">ani baqattuu fi jibbamtuun ture.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Isaan kanneen eenyutu guddise?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ani kophaatti hafeen ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">yoos, isaan kunneen eessaa dhufan ree?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">“Kunoo ani namoota ormaa harkaan nan waama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">faajjii koos uummataaf ol nan qaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">isaan ilmaan kee hammatanii fidu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">intallan kee immoo gatiittii isaaniitti baatu.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Mootonni abbootii kee kanneen si guddisan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">niitonni isaanii immoo haadhota kee kanneen harma si hoosisan ni taʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Isaan adda isaaniitiin lafatti gombifamanii siif sagadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">awwaara miilla keetii illee ni arraabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Ergasii ati akka ani Rabbii Allaah taʼe ni beekta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">warri na abdatan hin salphatan.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Gootota harkaa boojuu fudhachuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">gara jabeeyyii harkaas boojuu baasuun ni dandaʼamaa?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Rabbii Allaahan garuu akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">“Eeyyee, gootota harkaa boojiʼamtoonni ni baafamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">gara jabeeyyii harkaas boojuun ni fudhatama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">warra siin falmaniin nan falma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">ijoollee kees nan baraara.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Ani akka warri si hacuucan foon ofii isaanii nyaatan nan godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">isaan akkuma nama daadhii wayiniitiin machaaʼuu <optbreak /> dhiiga ofii isaaniitiin ni machaaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Ergasii sanyiin namaa hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">akka ani Rabbii Allaahan, Fayyisaan kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Furiin kee, Jabaa Yaaʼikuub taʼe ni beeka.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Cubbuu Israaʼelii fi Ajajamuu Tajaajiltichaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">“Waraqaan ragaa, kan ani ittiin haadha keessan hiikee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">of irraa ittiin ishee geggeesse meerre?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Yookaan namni liqii narraa qabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">kan ani itti isin gurgure eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Isin sababii cubbuu keessaniif gurguramtaniirtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">sababii yakka keessaniitiifis haati keessan ariʼamteerti.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Yeroo ani dhufetti namni maaliif achi hin jiraatin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Yeroo ani waametti namni owwaatu maaliif achii dhabame?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Harki koo akka furuu hin dandeenyeef gabaabateeraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Ani isin baraaruuf humna dhabeeraa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Ani dheekkamsa qofaan galaana nan gogsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">lageenis gammoojjiitti nan geeddara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">qurxummiiwwan isaanii bishaan dhabanii ajaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">dheebuudhaanis ni dhumu.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Ani shamaayʼuniitti dukkana nan uffisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">wayyaa gaddaas itti nan haguuga.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Akka ani warra dadhaban jajjabeessuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan arraba barate naa kenneera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Inni ganama ganama na dammaqsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">akka inni akkuma barataa tokkootti dhaggeeffatuufis <optbreak /> gurra koo dammaqsa.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan gurra koo naa baneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">anis fincilaa hin turre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">ani dugda duubatti hin deebine.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Ani warra na rukutanitti dugda koo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">warra areeda narraa buqqisanitti immoo maddii koo nan kenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">yeroo isaan natti qoosanii hancufa natti tufanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">ani fuula koo isaan hin dhokfanne.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan na gargaaruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">ani hin salphifamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Kanaafuu ani fuula koo akkuma dhagaa gurraachaa godhadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">ani akka hin qaaneffamne illee nan beeka.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Inni dhugaa naaf baasu dhiʼoo jira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Yoos eenyutu na himata ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Mee walitti gad haa baanu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Himataan koo eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Inni mee natti gad haa baʼu!<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Rabbii Allaah Gooftaatu na gargaara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">Eenyutu natti mura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Isaan hundi akkuma wayyaa moofaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">dholdholeenis isaan nyaatti.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Isin keessaa kan Rabbii Allaah sodaatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">dubbii garbicha isaatiif ajajamu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Namni dukkana keessa deddeebiʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">kan ifa hin qabne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">maqaa Rabbii Allaah amanatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Allaah isaatti haa irkatu.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Amma garuu isin warri ibidda bobeessitanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">guca bobaʼaa deemu qabattan hundinuu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">ifa ibiddaa keessaniitii fi ifa guca</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">bobeessitanii keessa deemaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Wanni isin harka koo irraa argattan kanaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">isin dhiphinaan ni ciciiftu.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Fayyina Bara baraa Xiyooniif</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />“Isin warri qajeelummaa duukaa buutan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">warri Rabbii Allaah barbaaddan na dhaggeeffadhaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Isin kattaa irraa argamtan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">boolla keessaa baafamtan sana ilaalaa.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Abbaa keessan Ibraahimii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">Saaraa ishee isin deesse sana ilaalaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Yeroo ani isa waametti, inni tokkicha ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">ani isa nan eebbise; nan baayʼises.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Rabbii Allaahan dhugumaan Xiyoonin ni jajjabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">diigama ishee hundas gara laafinaan ni ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">inni gammoojjii ishee goggogaa akka Eeden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">lafa onaa ishees akka iddoo biqiltuu Rabbii Allaah ni godha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Ililchuu fi gammaduun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">galannii fi sagaleen faarfannaa ishee keessatti argama.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Yaa uummata koo na dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">yaa saba koo na dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">seerri na biraa baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">murtiin koos sabootaaf ifa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Qajeelummaan koo dafee dhiʼaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">fayyisuun koos dhufaa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">irreen koo moototaaf murtii qajeelaa fida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">biyyoonni bishaan gidduu na eeggatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">irree koos ni abdatu.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Ija keessan gara shamaayʼuniiwwaniitti ol qabadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">lafas gad ilaalaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">shamaayʼuniiwwan akkuma aaraa ni badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">lafti akkuma wayyaa moofofti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">Jiraattonni ishees akkuma tisiisaa ni duʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Fayyisuun koo garuu bara baraan jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">qajeelummaan koos hin badu.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />“Isin warri waan qajeelaa beektan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">namoonni seera koo garaa keessaa qabdan na dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">tuffii namootaa hin sodaatinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">yookaan arrabsoo isaaniitiin hin raafaminaa.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Biliin akka wayyaatti isaan nyaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">raammoonis akkuma rifeensa hoolaatti isaan fixxi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">Garuu qajeelummaan koo bara baraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">fayyisuun koos dhalootaa gara dhalootaatti itti fufa.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Yaa irree Rabbii Allaaha, kaʼi; kaʼi! Jabina uffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">akkuma baroota darbanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">akkuma dhaloota durii keessatti taʼe sana kaʼi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Kan Raʼaabin kukkute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">kan jawwee galaanaa waraane sun suma mitii?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Inni akka warri furaman ceʼaniif, galaanicha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">bishaan tuujuba guddichaa gogse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">kan dhidhima galaanaa keessaan karaa baase suma mitii?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Warri Rabbii Allaahan isaan fure ni deebiʼu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">Isaan faarfannaadhaan Xiyoon seenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">gammachuun bara baraa mataa isaanii irra jiraata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Isaan gammachuu fi ililleedhaan guutamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">gaddii fi booʼichi isaan irraa fagaatu.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />“Kan isin jajjabeessu ana; anuma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">Yoos maaliif namoota duʼa hin oolle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">ilmaan namaa kanneen akkuma margaa taʼan sodaattu ree?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Ati kan Rabbii Allaahan Tolchaa kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">isa shamaayʼuniiwwan diriirsee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">hundee lafaa buuse sana dagattu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Ati kan sababii dheekkamsa cunqursaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">waa balleessuuf qophaaʼe sanaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">utuu gargar hin kutin guyyaa guyyaan sodaattu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Yoos dheekkamsi cunqursaa sanaa meerree?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Boojiʼamtoonni hidhaman ariitiidhaan gad dhiifamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:14">isaan boolla itti hidhaman keessatti hin duʼan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">yookaan buddeena hin dhaban.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Ani Rabbii Allaah kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">kan akka dhaʼaan bishaanii huursuuf galaana raasuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">maqaan isaas Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu dha.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Ani kan shamaayʼuniiwwan iddoo isaanii kaaʼe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">kan hundee lafaa hundeessee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Xiyooniin, ‘Ati saba koo ti’ jedhe sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">dubbii koo afaan kee keessa kaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">gaaddidduu harka kootiinis si haguugeera.”<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoofoo Dheekkamsa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Yaa Yerusaalem, ati kan harka Rabbii Allaah irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">xoofoo dheekkamsa isaa keessaa dhugde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">ati kan xoofoo dhugaatii nama gatantarsuu keessaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">siicoo isaa xuruurfattee dhugde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">dammaqi, dammaqi! Ol kaʼi.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Ilmaan isheen deesse hunda keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">kan ishee qajeelchu tokko iyyuu hin turre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">ilmaan isheen guddifte hunda keessaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">kan harka ishee qabu tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Balaawwan kunneen dachaadhaan sitti dhufaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">egaa eenyutu si jajjabeessuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Diigamnii fi badiisni, beellii fi goraadeen sitti dhufaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">eegaa eenyutu si jajjabeessuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Ijoolleen kee gaggabaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">akkuma borofa kiyyoon qabame tokkoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">roga karaa irra ciciisu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Isaan dheekkamsa Rabbii Allaahatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">ifata Allaah keetiinis guutamaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Kanaafuu yaa ishee miidhamte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">kan utuu daadhii wayinii hin dhugin machoofte, <optbreak /> waan kana dhagaʼi.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">Allaahan kee inni saba isaa eegu akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">“Kunoo ani xoofoo dhugaatii nama gatantarsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">harka keetii fuudheera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">ati siʼachi xoofoo dheekkamsa koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">keessaa deebitee hin dhugdu.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Anis xoofoo sana harka warra si dhiphisan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">kanneen, ‘Akka nu sirra yaanuuf, lafa irra diriirfami’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">siin jedhan sanaa keessa nan kaaʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Ati immoo dugda kee akkuma lafaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">akkuma daandii namni irra deemuu goote.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Yaa Xiyoon, dammaqi, dammaqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">jabina kee uffadhu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Yaa Yerusaalem, yaa magaalaa qulqullittii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">wayyaa kee miidhagaa sana uffadhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Namoonni dhagna hin qabaminii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">xuraaʼonni lammaffaa sitti hin seenan.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Yaa Yerusaalem, awwaara of irraa dhadhaʼadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">kaʼiitii teessoo irra taaʼi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Yaa intala Xiyoon boojiʼamtittii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">foncaa morma keetii of irraa hiiki.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhaatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">“Isin gatii malee gurguramtanii turtan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">amma immoo maallaqa malee furamtan.”<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akkana jedhaatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:4">“Jalqabatti sabni koo jiraachuuf jedhee Gibxitti gad buʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">ergasii Asoor sababii malee isaan cunqurse.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />“Yoos ani amma maalan asii qaba?” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">“Sabni koo sababii malee fudhatameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">warri isaan bulchanis ni qoosu” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">“Guyyaa guutuus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">maqaan koo ittuma fufee arrabsama.<verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Kanaafuu sabni koo maqaa koo ni beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">kanaafuu isaan gaafas kan duraan dursee waan sana dubbate</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">akka ana taʼe ni beeku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">Eeyyee, inni anuma.”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Miilli warra injiila fidanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">kan nagaa labsanii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">kan oduu gammachiisaa fidanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">kan fayyina labsanii, kan Xiyooniin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">“Allaahan kee moʼeera!” jedhanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">tulluuwwan irratti akkam miidhagaa dha!<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Dhaggeeffadhu! Eegdonni kee sagalee isaanii ol fudhataniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">isaan tokkummaadhaan gammachuudhaan iyyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Yeroo Rabbii Allaahan Xiyoonitti deebiʼutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">isaan ijuma isaaniitiin ni argu.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Yaa diigamtoota Yerusaalem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">tokkummaadhaan faarfannaa gammachuu faarfadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Rabbii Allaahan uummata isaa jajjabeessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">Yerusaaleminis fureeraa.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Rabbii Allaahan fuula saboota hundaa duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">irree isaa qulqulluu sana ni mulʼisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">handaarri lafaa hundis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">fayyisuu Allaah keenyaa ni argu.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Isin warri miʼa Rabbii Allaah baattan, addaan baʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">addaan baʼaa; achii fagaadhaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Waan xuraaʼaa tokko illee hin tuqinaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">Ishee keessaa baʼaatii qulqulloota taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Isin garuu ariitiidhaan achii hin baatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">yookaan baqattanii hin deemtan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Rabbii Allaahan fuula keessan dura deemaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Allaahan Israaʼel dugda duubaan isin eega.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhiphinaa fi Ulfina Garbicha Sanaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Kunoo, garbichi koo ogummaadhaan hojjeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">inni ni kabajama; ol kaafama; ulfina guddaas ni argata.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Namoonni baayʼeen waaʼee isaa hamma naʼanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">fuulli isaa nama hundumaa caalaa golgolaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">bifti isaas nama hundumaa caalaa badeera;<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />akkasiinis inni saboota hedduu dinqisiifachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">mootonni sababii isaatiif afaan isaanii qabatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Isaan waan isaanitti hin himamin arguutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">waan hin dhagaʼinis ni hubatu.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Ergaa keenya eenyutu amane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">Irreen Rabbii Allaahas eenyutti mulʼate?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Inni fuula isaa duratti akkuma biqiltuu kichuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">akkuma hidda lafa gogaa keessaa baʼu tokkootti guddate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Akka nu isa ilaalluuf, inni bifa hin tolu, <optbreak /> yookaan simboo hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">akka nu isa hawwinuufis miidhagina hin qabu.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Inni nama biratti tuffatamee jibbame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">inni nama gaddaa fi gadadamuun jiraatuu dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Akkuma nama namoonni fuula isaanii irraa garagalfatanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">inni ni tuffatame; nus ulfina hin kennineef.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Dhugumaan inni dhukkuba keenya fudhate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">gadda keenyas baate;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">nu garuu akka waan Allaahan isa dhaʼeetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">akka waan inni rukutee isa miidheetti isa hedne.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Inni garuu sababii yakka keenyaatiif waraaname;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">balleessaa keenyaafis caccabsame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">nu adabamuu isaatiin nagaa arganne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">madaaʼuu isaatiin immoo fayyine.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Hundi keenya akka hoolaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">karaa irraa badnee turre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">tokkoon tokkoon keenya gara karaa keenyaatti gorre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">Rabbii Allaahanis balleessaa hunda keenyaa isa irra kaaʼe.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Inni ni cunqurfame; ni dhiphates;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">garuu afaan isaa hin saaqqanne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">inni akkuma ilmoo hoolaa kan iddoo qalmaatti geeffamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">akkuma hoolaa fuula nama rifeensa irraa murmuruu duratti calʼisuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">akkasuma afaan isaa hin saaqqanne.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Inni cunqursaa fi murtiidhaan fudhatame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">Eenyutu waaʼee dhaloota isaa dubbachuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Inni biyya jiraattotaa irraa kutameeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">dogoggora saba kootiifis rukutameera.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Inni goolii kaasuu baatu iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">yookaan sobni afaan isaatii baʼuu baatu iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">akka qabriin isaa hamoota wajjin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">duuti isaas sooreyyii wajjin taʼu godhan.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Taʼus isa dirmammeessuu fi isa dhiphisuun fedhii Rabbii Allaah ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">Rabbii Allaahan lubbuu isaa aarsaa yakkaa godhu iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">inni sanyii isaa ni arga; umurii isaas ni dheeressa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">fedhiin Rabbii Allaahas harka isaatti ni raawwatama.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Inni erga lubbuun isaa dhiphatee booddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">ifa ni arga; ni gammadas;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">garbichi koo qajeelaan sun beekumsa isaatiin namoota baayʼee <optbreak /> qajeeltota taasisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">yakka isaaniis ni baata.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Kanaafuu ani gurguddoota gidduutti qooda nan kennaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">innis jajjaboota wajjin boojuu ni qooddata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">inni lubbuu isaa duʼaaf kennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">yakkitootatti lakkaaʼameeraatii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Taʼus inni cubbuu nama hedduu baatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">yakkamtootaaf araara buuseera.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Ulfina Egeree Xiyoon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />“Yaa dubartii dhabduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">kan takkumaa hin daʼin, amma faarfadhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">ati kan takkumaa ciniinsifattee hin beekin iyyii faarfadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">guddisiitii ililchi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Ijoollee dubartii dhirsa qabduu caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">ijoolleen dubartii gatamtee ni baayʼatu”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />“Iddoo dunkaana keetii balʼifadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">golgaa dunkaana keetii balʼisii diriirsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">walitti hin dachaasin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">funyoo kee dheereffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">qofoo kees jabeeffadhu.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Ati gara mirgaattii fi gara bitaatti ni babalʼattaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">sanyiiwwan kee saboota ni dhaalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">magaalaawwan isaanii kanneen duwwaa hafan keessas ni qubatu.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />“Hin sodaatin; ati hin qaanoftuutii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">Hin yaaddaʼin; ati hin salphattuutii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Qaanii ijoollummaa keetii ni dagatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">tuffii dhirsi kee sirraa duunaan sirra gaʼes siʼachi hin yaadattu.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Uumaan kee dhirsa keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">maqaan isaas Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Qulqullichi Israaʼel Furii kee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">innis Allaah guutummaa lafaa jedhama.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Rabbii Allaahan akka waan ati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">akkuma niitii gatamtee garaan ishee gaddee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">akka niitii dargaggeessaa kan jibbamteetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">deebisee ofitti si waama” jedha Allaahan kee.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />“Ani yeroo muraasaafan si dhiise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">garuu gara laafina guddaadhaan deebisee sin fida.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Ani dheekkamsa guddaadhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">yeroo muraasaaf fuula koo si dhokfadheen ture;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">garuu jaalala bara baraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">garaa siifin laafa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">jedha Rabbii Allaahan Furiin kee.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Wanni kun anaaf akkuma bara Nuuhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">yeroo ani itti bishaan Nuuhi deebiʼee lafa irra hin garagalu jedhee <optbreak /> kakadhe sanaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Kanaafuu ani akkan sitti hin aarre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">gonkumaas lammata akkan si hin ifanne kakadheera.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Tulluuwwan raafamanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">gaarran buqqifaman iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">jaalalli hin geeddaramne kan ani siif qabu garuu hin raafamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">yookaan kakuun koo kan nagaa hin diigamu”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">jedha Rabbii Allaahan inni garaa siif laafu sun.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />“Yaa magaalaa miidhamte kan dambaliidhaan garagalfamtee <optbreak /> nama si jajjabeessu dhabde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">ani dhagaa gatii guddaatiin si ijaaree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">sanpeeriidhaanis si hundeessa.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Ani fiixee kee lula diimaadhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">karrawwan kee dooqa calaqqisuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">dallaa kee hunda immoo dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyiidhaan nan ijaara.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Rabbii Allaahan ilmaan kee hunda ni barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">nagaan ijoollee keetiis guddaa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Ati qajeelummaadhaan hundeeffamta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">cunqurfamuun sirraa fagaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">wanni si sodaachisu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Gooliin sirraa fageeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">sitti iyyuu hin dhiʼaatu.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Yoo namni tokko iyyuu lola sitti kaase ani keessaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">namni lola sitti kaasu kam iyyuu harka sitti kennata.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />“Kunoo, kan tumtuu sibiilaa kan cilee buufee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">ibidda bobeessee miʼa waraanaa tumee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">hojii isaatiif mijeessu sana uume anuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">Kan nama waa balleessu tokko akka inni balaa buusuuf uumes anuma;<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />meeshaan si miidhuuf tolfame kam iyyuu hin milkaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">atis arraba si himatu hunda of irraa deebifta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Kun dhaala tajaajiltoota Rabbii Allaah ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">innis qajeelummaa isaan narraa argatanii dha”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Affeerraa Warra Dheebotaniif Godhame</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />“Isin warri dheebottan hundinuu kottaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">gara bishaanii kottaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">isin warri maallaqa hin qabne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">kottaatii bitadhaa; nyaadhaas!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Kottaatii maallaqaa fi gatii malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">daadhii wayiniitii fi aannan bitadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Isin maaliif waan buddeena hin taʼinitti maallaqa baaftu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">Waan nama hin quubsine irrattis maaliif humna keessan fixxu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Dhagaʼaa; na dhagaʼaa; waan gaarii nyaadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">lubbuun keessanis coomaan haa gammaddu.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Gurra naaf kennaatii gara koo kottaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">akka lubbuun keessan jiraattuufis na dhagaʼaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Ani kakuu bara baraa isin wajjin nan gala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">innis jaalala amanamaa isa Daawud <optbreak /> abdachiifame sanaa dha;<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />kunoo ani sabootaaf dhuga baatuu isa godheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">hoogganaa fi ajajaa sabootaas isa taasiseera.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Qulqullichi Israaʼel sun, ulfina siif kenneef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">ati dhugumaan saboota hin beekne ni waamta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">saboonni si hin beeknes ariitiidhaan gara kee dhufu.”<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Yeroo inni argamutti Rabbii Allaah barbaaddadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">yeroo inni dhiʼoo jiruttis isa waammadhaa.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Namni hamaan karaa isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">namni jalʼaan immoo yaada isaa haa dhiisu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Inni gara Rabbii Allaahatti haa deebiʼu; innis ni araaramaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">gara Allaah keenyaatti haa deebiʼu; dhiifamni isaa baayʼeedhaatii.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />“Yaadni koo yaada keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">karaan keessanis karaa koo miti”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />“Akkuma shamaayʼuniiwwan lafa irraa ol fagaatan sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">karaan koo karaa keessan irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">yaadni koos yaada keessan irraa ol fagoo dha.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Akkuma bokkaa fi cabbiin shamaayʼuniidhaa roobu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">akka lafti biqila biqilchitee isa facaafatuuf sanyii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">isa nyaatuuf immoo buddeena kennituuf malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">utuu ishee hin quubsin hin deebine sana,<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />dubbiin koo kan afaan kootii baʼus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">fedhii koo raawwata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">kaayyoo ani isa ergeefis galmaan gaʼa malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">harka duwwaa gara kootti hin deebiʼu.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Isin gammachuudhaan baatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">nagaadhaan geggeeffamtu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">tulluuwwanii fi gaarran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">fuula keessan duratti ililchanii faarfatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">mukkeen dirree hundinuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">harka walitti rukutu.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Qooda qoraattii birbirsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">qooda sokorruus kusaayeen ni biqila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Kunis Rabbii Allaahaf yaadannoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">mallattoo bara baraa kan hin badne taʼa.”<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Fayyina Warra Kaaniif Kenname</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">Sababii fayyisuun koo dhiʼaatee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">qajeelummaan koo dafee mulʼatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">“Murtii qajeelaa eegaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">waan qajeelaas hojjedhaa.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Namni waan kana hojjetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">kan waan kanattis cimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">kan Sanbata utuu hin xureessin <optbreak /> eeguu fi waan hamaa kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">hojjechuu irraa harka isaa eeggatu eebbifamaa dha.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Alagaan Rabbii Allaahatti cichee tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">“Rabbii Allaahan dhugumaan <optbreak /> saba isaa irraa addaan na baasa” hin jedhin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Xuʼaashiin kam iyyuus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">“Ani mukuma gogaadha” ofiin hin jedhin.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhaatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">“Xuʼaashiiwwan Sanbatoota koo eegan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">kanneen waan na gammachiisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">filatanii fi kakuu koo jabeessanii eeganiif,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />ani mana qulqullummaa kootii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">dallaa isaa keessatti yaadannoo fi maqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">ilmaanii fi intallan caalu tokko nan kennaaf;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">ani maqaa bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">kan hin haqamne isaaniif nan kenna.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Alagoota isa tajaajiluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">maqaa Rabbii Allaah jaallachuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">isa waaqeffachuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">Rabbii Allaahatti cichan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">kanneen Sanbata utuu hin xureessin eeganii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">kakuu koos cimsanii eegan hunda,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />ani gara tulluu koo qulqulluutti isaan nan fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">mana duʼaa koo keessattis gammachuu isaaniif nan kenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Aarsaan isaanii kan gubamuu fi qalmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">iddoo aarsaa koo irratti fudhatama ni argata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">manni koo saboota hundaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">mana sagadaa jedhamee waamamaatii.”<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">inni Israaʼeloota bittinnaaʼan walitti qabu sun akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">“Ani warra duraan walitti qabaman biratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">warra kaanis gara isaaniitti walitti nan qaba.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allaahan Dura Buʼoota Israaʼel himate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Bineensonni dirree hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">bineensonni bosonaa hundis kottaatii itti gaggabaa nyaadhaa!<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Eegdonni Israaʼel jaamota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">isaan hundi beekumsa hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">hundi isaanii saroota duudaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">dutuus hin dandaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">isaan ciisanii abjootu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">rafuus ni jaallatu.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Isaan saroota albaadheyyii dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">nyaataniis hin quufan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Isaan tiksoota hubannaa hin qabnee dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">hundi isaanii daandii ofii isaanii irra deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">tokkoon tokkoon isaanii faayidaa ofii isaanii barbaadu.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Tokkoon tokkoon isaanii akkana jedhu; <optbreak /> “Kottaa daadhii wayinii dhugnaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">Kottaa dhugaatii cimaa dhugnee quufnaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Guyyaan borii akkuma harʼaa taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">yookaan caaluu iyyuu ni dandaʼa.”<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Namni qajeelaan ni duʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">kan waan kana yaadatti qabatu tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">warri Allaahaf of kennan ni fudhatamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">akka qajeeltonni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">waan hamaa jalaa baraaramuuf fudhataman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">namni tokko iyyuu hin hubatu.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Namni qajeelummaadhaan jiraatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">gara nagaa seena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">isaan siree isaanii irra boqotu.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />“Isin garuu yaa ilmaan falfaltittii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">isin sanyiin ejjituutii fi sagaagaltuu as kottaa!<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Isin eenyutti qoostu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Eenyutti afaan banattu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Eenyuttis arraba baaftu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Isin ilmaan finciltootaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">sanyii sobdootaa mitii?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Isin mukkeen qilxuu gidduutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">mukkeen dagaagan hunda jalatti hawwii hamaadhaan gubattan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">sululoota keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">holqa kattaa keessattis ijoollee keessan qaltan.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Dhagaawwan cululuqoon sulula keessaa qooda kee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">dhugumaan carraan kee isaanuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Ati dhibaayyuu isaaniif dhangalaafte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">aarsaa midhaanii isaaniif dhiʼeessiteerta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">Ani wantoota kanneen calʼisee nan ilaalaa?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Ati siree kee tulluu guddaa fi ol dheeraa irra dhaabbatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">aarsaa kee dhiʼeeffachuufis achi ol baate.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Ati cufaa keetii fi michichila cufaa keetii duubaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">yaadannoo kee fannifatteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Ana dhiiftee siree kee saaqqatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">yaabdees balʼiftee banattee keessa seente;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">ati warra siree isaanii jaallatte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">wajjin walii galte sana qullaa isaanii ilaalte.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Ati zayitii ejersaa fudhattee gara Moolek dhaqxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">shittoo kee illee ni baayʼifatte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Ergamoota kee biyya fagootti ergite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">siiʼoolittis gad ergite!<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Dheerina karaa keetiitiin dadhabdee turte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">ati garuu, ‘Wanni kun faayidaa hin qabu’ hin jenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Jabina haaromfame argatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">kanaafuu ati hin dadhabne.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Ati akka na sobduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">akka na hin yaadanneef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">yookaan akka waan kana garaatti hin qabanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">eenyuun sodaattee akkas naate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Ati sababii ani yeroo dheeraa calʼiseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">na sodaachuu dhiifte mitii?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Ani qajeelummaa keetii fi hojii kee ifatti nan baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">isaan garuu si hin fayyadan.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Yeroo ati gargaarsaaf iyyitutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">mee waaqeffatamtoonni tolfamoon ati walitti qabatte sun si haa baasan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Bubbeen hunda isaanii fudhatee bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">hafuurri baafatan iyyuu afuufee isaan balleessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Namni daʼannoo isaa ana godhatu garuu <optbreak /> biyyattii ni dhaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">tulluu koo qulqulluu sana illee ni dhuunfata.”<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abdii Warra Gad Qabamaniif Kenname</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Akkanas ni jedhama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">“Tolchaa; tolchaa; daandii qopheessaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">Karaa saba kootii irraa gufuuwwan bubuqqisaa.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Inni guddaanii fi ol ol jedhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">kan bara baraan jiraatuu fi <optbreak /> kan maqaan isaa qulqulluu jedhamu sun akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">“Ani iddoo ol kaʼaa fi iddoo qulqulluu irra nan jiraadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">hafuura warra gad qabamanii bayyanachiisuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">garaa warra gad of qabanii jajjabeessuuf garraamii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">kan hafuuraan gad qabame wajjinis nan jiraadha.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Ani bara baraan namatti hin falmu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">yookaan yeroo hunda hin dheekkamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">yoo akkas taʼe hafuurri namaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">hafuurri namni ani uume baafatu ni citaatii.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Ani dharraa isaa kan cubbuun guutame sanattan dheekkame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">isa adabees aariidhaan fuula koo isa duraa nan dhokfadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">inni garuu karuma fedhii isaatiin itti fufe.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Ani karaa isaa argeera; garuu isa nan fayyisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">ani isa nan qajeelcha; deebisees nan jajjabeessa;<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />arraba boossuuwwan Israaʼel keessa jiraatanii irrattis <optbreak /> galata nan uuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">Warra fagoo jiraataniif nagaan, warra dhiʼoo jiraataniifis nagaan haa taʼu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">Anis isaan nan fayyisa” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Namoonni hamoon garuu akkuma galaana olii gadi daddarbatamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">kan boqochuu hin dandeenye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">kan dambaliin isaa laaqii fi dhoqqee tufuu ti.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />“Namoota hamoof nagaan hin jiru” jedha Allaahan koo.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Sooma Allaahan itti Gammadu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />“Guddisii iyyi; hin qusatin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Akkuma malakataa sagalee kee ol fudhadhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Saba kootti fincila isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">mana Yaaʼikuubitti immoo cubbuu isaanii labsi.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Isaan guyyuma guyyaan na barbaaduutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">isaan akkuma saba waan qajeelaa hojjetee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">ajajawwan Allaah isaa hin dhiisin tokkootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">waan karaa koo beekuu barbaadan fakkaatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Isaan murtii qajeelaa na kadhatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">akka Allaahan isaanitti dhiʼaatus waan hawwan fakkaatu.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Isaanis, ‘Yoo ati waan kana hin argine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">nu maaliif soomne?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Yoo ati waan kana hin qalbeeffanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">nu maaliif gad of qabne?’ jedhu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">“Taʼus isin guyyaa sooma keessanii waan feetan gootan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">hojjettoota keessan hundas ni hacuuccan.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Soomni keessan wal loluu fi wal qoccoluudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">aboottee hamminaatiin wal tumuudhaan raawwata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Soomni isin harʼa soomaa jirtan kun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">akka sagaleen keessan gubbaatti dhagaʼamu hin godhu.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Soomni ani filadhe sooma akkanaatii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Namni tokko guyyuma tokko qofaaf gad of qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Wanni kun akkuma dhallaadduu mataa gad qabachuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">wayyaa gaddaatii fi daaraa irra ciisuu qofaafii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Wanni isin sooma jettaniin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">guyyaan fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti fudhatama qabu kanaa?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />“Soomni ani itti gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">kan foncaa jalʼinaa furu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">kan funyoo waanjoo hiiku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">kan cunqurfamtoota bilisa baasuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">waanjoo hunda caccabsu mitii?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Akka ati warra beelaʼaniif nyaata kee qoodduu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">akka hiyyeeyyii mana hin qabne mana keetti simattu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">akka ati yeroo nama daare argitutti <optbreak /> daara isa baaftuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">akka nama foonii fi dhiiga kee taʼetti <optbreak /> dugda hin galle mitii?<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Yoos ifni kee akka biiftuu ganamaa ni baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">fayyinni kees dafee ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">qajeelummaan kee fuula kee dura deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">ulfinni Rabbii Allaah immoo duubaan si eega.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Yeroo sana ati ni waammatta; Rabbii Allaahanis deebii siif kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">ati gargaarsa barbaacha iyyatta; innis, ‘Ani asan jira’ siin jedha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">“Ati yoo waanjoo cunqursaa, haasaʼa hamminaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">quba namatti qabuu of irraa fageessite,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />ati yoo warra beelaʼaniif nyaata kennite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">warra rakkatanis rakkinaa baafte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">ifni kee dukkana keessa ni ibsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">halkan kees akka guyyaa saafaa taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Rabbii Allaahan yeroo hunda si geggeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">inni lafa aduudhaan gubate keessatti iyyuu <optbreak /> fedhii kee siif guuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">lafee kees ni jabeessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Ati akka lafa biqiltuu bishaan quufee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">akka burqaa hin gognees ni taata.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Uummanni kee diigamaa durii deebisee ni ijaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">atis hundee dhaloota baayʼee ol kaasta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">atis, Suphaa Dallaawwan Jijjiganii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">Haaromsaa Daandiiwwan Jireenyaa jedhamtee waamamta.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />“Ati yoo miilla kee Sanbata cabsuu irraa eeggattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">guyyaa koo qulqulluu waan jaallattu gochuu dhiifte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">ati yoo Sanbataan, ‘Gammachuu’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">guyyaa qulqullaaʼaa Rabbii Allaahatiin immoo, ‘Kabajamaa’ jette,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">yoo daandii ofii keetii deemtuu fi yoo waan feete gochuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">yookaan haasaa faayidaa hin qabne haasaʼuu baattee <optbreak /> Sanbata ulfeessite,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />yeroo sana Rabbii Allaahatti ni gammadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">anis akka ati lafa ol dheeraa irra guluftu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">dhaala abbaa kee Yaaʼikuub nyaattee akka quuftus sin taasisa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Afaan Rabbii Allaah dubbateeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Cubbuu, Balleessaa Himachuu fi Furama</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Dhugumaan harki Rabbii Allaah fayyisuuf gabaabaa miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">yookaan gurri isaa dhagaʼuu hin didne.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Yakki keessan garuu Allaah keessaniin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">gargar isin baaseera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">akka inni isin hin dhageenyeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">cubbuun keessan fuula isaa isin duraa dhokseera.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Harki keessan dhiigaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">qubni keessan immoo yakkaan faalameeraatii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">Afaan keessan soba dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">arrabni keessan immoo waan hamaa guunguma.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Namni murtii qajeelaa barbaadu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">kan himata isaa amanamummaadhaan dhiʼeeffatu <optbreak /> tokko iyyuu hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Isaan waan faayidaa hin qabne amanatan; soba dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">gowwoomsaa ulfaaʼanii hammina dhalan.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Isaan hanqaaquu buutii yaasan; manʼee sariitii foʼan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">Namni hanqaaquu isaanii nyaatu kam iyyuu ni duʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">yommuu tokkoon isaa cabutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">buutiitu keessaa baʼa.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Foʼaan isaanii uffata hin taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">waan tolchaniinis dhagna isaanii haguuggachuu hin dandaʼan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Hojiin isaanii hojii hamminaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">harka isaanii keessas hojii fincilaatu jira.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Miilli isaanii gara cubbuutti fiiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">isaan dhiiga qulqulluu dhangalaasuuf ariifatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Yaadni isaanii jalʼaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">diiguu fi barbadeessuun mallattoo karaa isaanii ti.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Isaan karaa nagaa hin beekan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">murtiin qajeelaan karaa isaanii irra hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Daandii isaanii jalʼisaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">namni achi irra deemu tokko iyyuu nagaa hin beeku.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Kanaafuu murtiin qajeelaan nurraa fagaateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">qajeelummaanis nu bira hin gaʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Nu ifa barbaanna; garuu hundinuu dukkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">ifa guyyaa barbaanna; garuu dimimmisa keessa deemna.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Nu akkuma jaamaa dallaa qaqqabachaa deemna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">akkuma warra ija hin qabnee harkaan karaa keenya barbaaddanna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Akka nama halkaniin deemuu guyyaa saafaadhaan guggufanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">namoota jajjaboo gidduutti akka warra duʼanii taaneerra.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Nu hundi akka amaaketaa gururiina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">akka gugees gaddaan aadna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Murtii qajeelaa barbaanna; garuu hin arganne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">fayyina barbaanna; inni garuu nurraa fagaateera.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Yakki keenya fuula kee duratti baayʼateeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">cubbuun keenyas dhugaa nutti baʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Yakki keenya nu wajjin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nus balleessaa keenya ni beekna;<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />nu fincillee Rabbii Allaah sobne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">Allaah keenya duukaa buʼuu irraa garagalleerra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">goolii fi fincila kakaafneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">soba garaan keenya yaades dubbanneerra.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Kanaafuu murtii qajeelaan duubatti deebifameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">qajeelummaanis fagoo dhaabata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">dhugaan karaatti gufate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">tollis ol seenuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Dhugaan eessumattuu hin argamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">namni cubbuu irraa fagaatus waan hamaaf saaxilama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">Rabbii Allaahan akka murtii qajeelaan hin jirre arge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">kunis isa gaddisiise.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Inni akka namni tokko iyyuu hin jirre arge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">kan gara isaatti duʼaa dhiʼeessu waan dhabameefis <optbreak /> ni dinqisiifate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Kanaafuu irreen isaa fayyina isaa fidde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">qajeelummaan ofii isaas isa utube.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Qajeelummaa akka gaachana qomaatti kaaʼatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">gonfoo fayyinaas mataatti gombifate;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">wayyaa ittiin haaloo baʼu uffatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">akka nama waaroo uffatuuttis hinaaffaa ofitti marate.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Kanaafuu inni akkuma hojii isaaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">diinota isaatiif dheekkamsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">amajaajota isaaniitiif immoo adabbii malu ni kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">biyyoota bishaan gidduutiifis hojii harka isaanii kennaaf.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Namoonni lixa biiftuu maqaa Rabbii Allaah sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">warri baʼa biiftuutti argaman immoo ulfina isaa kabaju.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Inni akkuma lolaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">kan bubbeen Rabbii Allaah oofuutti ni dhufaatii.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />“Furaan gara Xiyoon, gara warra mana Yaaʼikuub keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">qalbii jijjiirratanii ni dhufa”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />“Gama kootiin kakuun koo kan ani isaan wajjin qabu kana” jedha Rabbii Allaahan. “Hafuurri koo kan sirra jiru, dubbiin koo kan ani afaan kee keessa kaaʼe sun afaan keetii yookaan afaan ijoollee keetiitii yookaan afaan ijoollee ijoollee isaaniitii harʼaa jalqabee bara baraan hin badu” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Ulfina Xiyoon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />“Ifni kee dhufeeraatii kaʼii ibsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">ulfinni Rabbii Allaah siif baʼeera.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Kunoo, dukkanni lafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">dukkanni hamaan immoo uummattoota haguuga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">Rabbii Allaahan garuu siif kaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">ulfinni isaas sirraa mulʼata.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Saboonni gara ifa keetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">mootonni immoo gara ifa kee 2 isa bariitti ni dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />“Ija kee ol fudhadhuutii naannoo kee ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">hundinuu wal gaʼanii gara kee ni dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">ilmaan kee fagoodhaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">intallan kees qomatti baatamanii gara kee ni dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Ergasii ni ilaalta; ni calaqqiftas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">lapheen kee ni dhaʼata; gammachuudhaanis ni guutama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">qabeenyi galaanotaa hundinuu gara kee dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">badhaadhummaan sabootaas kan kee taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Gaalli baayʼeen, ilmaan gaalaa kan Midiyaanii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">kan Eefaa biyya kee ni guutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Naannoon hundi warqee fi ixaana fidanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">galata Rabbii Allaah labsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">biyya Shebaatii ni dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Bushaayeen Qeedaar hundinuu gara keetti walitti qabamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">korbeeyyiin hoolaa Nabaayot si tajaajilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">isaan iddoo aarsaa koo irratti aarsaawwan fudhatama qaban ni taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">anis mana ulfina kootii nan kabaja.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />“Warri akkuma gugeewwanii manneen isaaniitti barrisan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">kanneen akka duumessaa gugatan kunneen eenyu faʼi?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Dhugumaan biyyoonni bishaan gidduu na abdatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">sababii inni ulfina sitti uffiseef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">maqaa Rabbii Allaah keetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Qulqullicha Israaʼeliitiif jedhanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">dooniiwwan Tarshiish dursanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">meetii fi warqee isaanii wajjin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">ilmaan kee fagoodhaa ni fidu.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />“Namoonni ormaa dallaa kee ni ijaaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">mootonni isaaniis si tajaajilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Ani aariidhaan si dhaʼu illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">gara laafina koo jaalalaan sitti nan argisiisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Akka namoonni badhaadhina sabootaa gara keetti fidaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">akka mootonni isaaniis hiriiraan gara keetti seenaniif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">karrawwan kee yeroo hunda banamaa taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">isaan halkanii guyyaa gonkumaa hin cufaman;<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Sabni yookaan mootummaan si hin tajaajille <optbreak /> ni barbadaaʼuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">guutummaan guutuuttis ni balleeffamu.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />“Ulfinni Libaanoon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">gaattiraan, qararoo fi hadheessi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">lafa iddoo qulqulluu koo miidhagsuuf gara kee ni dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">anis iddoo miilli koo dhaabatu nan kabaja.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Ilmaan warra si cunqursanii siif sagadaa gara kee dhufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">warri si tuffatan hundinuus miilla keetti kufu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">isaanis Magaalaa Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Xiyoon kan Qulqullicha Israaʼel jedhanii si waamu.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />“Yoo ati jibbamtee gatamtee namni tokko iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">si keessaan darbuu lagate iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">ani boontuu bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">gammachuu dhaloota hundaa sin taasisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Ati aannan sabootaa ni dhugda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">harma moototaas ni hoota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Yommus ani Rabbii Allaahan Jabaan Yaaʼikuub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">Fayyisaa kee fi Furaa kee akkan taʼe ni beekta.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Ani qooda naasii warqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">qooda sibiilaa immoo, meetii siif nan fida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Qooda mukaa naasii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">qooda dhagaa immoo, sibiila siif nan fida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Nagaa mootii kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">qajeelummaa immoo, bulchaa kee nan godha.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Siʼachi biyya kee keessatti gooliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">daarii kee keessatti immoo diigamni yookaan badiisni <optbreak /> hin dhagaʼamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">ati garuu dallaa kee Fayyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">karrawwan kee immoo Galata jettee waamta.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Siʼachi aduun guyyaadhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">ifni jiʼaas halkaniin ifa kee hin taʼu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">Rabbii Allaahan ifa kee bara baraa taʼaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">Allaahan kee ulfina kee ni taʼa.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Aduun kee deebitee hin dhiitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">jiʼi kee hin badu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">Rabbii Allaahan ifa kee bara baraa ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">barri gadda kees ni raawwatama.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Yoos uummanni kee hundi qajeelaa ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">bara baraanis lafa ni dhaala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Isaan biqiltuu ani dhaabbadhee dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">hojii harka koo, kan ani ittiin ulfina koo mulʼisuuf <optbreak /> jedhee hojjedhee dha.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Maatiin muraasni kuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">gareen xinnaan immoo saba guddaa taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Ani Rabbii Allaah dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">waan kana yeroo isaatti dafee nan hojjedha.”<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Bara Tola Rabbii Allaah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan akka ani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">hiyyeeyyiitti oduu gaarii lallabuuf na dibeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">Hafuurri Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa narra jira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Inni akka ani garaa cabe fayyisuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">akka ani boojiʼamtootaaf bilisummaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">warra hidhamaniif immoo hiikamuu lallabuuf na ergeera;<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />akka ani bara tola Rabbii Allaahatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">guyyaa haaloo baʼuu Allaah keenyaa labsuuf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">akka ani warra booʼan hunda jajjabeessuuf,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />akka ani warra Xiyoon keessatti gaddaniif arjoomee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">qooda daaraa miidhagina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">qooda booʼichaa, zayitii gammachuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">qooda abdii kutachuu immoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">wayyaa galataa kennuuf na erge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Isaanis qilxuu qajeelummaa, biqiltuu Rabbii Allaaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">kan inni ittiin kabajamu jedhamanii waamaman.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Isaan waan dur diigame deebisanii ijaaru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">iddoowwan bara dheeraan dura onanii turanis <optbreak /> akka duraatti deebisu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">magaalaawwan diigaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">kanneen dhaloota hedduun dura onanii turan ni haaromsu.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Alagoonni bushaayee keessan ni tiksu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">ormoonnis lafa qotiisaa fi <optbreak /> iddoo dhaabaa wayinii keessanii keessa ni hojjetu.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Isin luboota Rabbii Allaah jedhamtanii ni waamamtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">tajaajiltoota Allaah keenyaa jedhamtaniis ni moggaafamtu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Isin qabeenya sabootaa ni nyaattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">badhaadhummaa isaaniitiin illee ni boontu.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Qooda qaanii keessanii hiree dachaa ni argattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">qooda salphinaa isin dhaala keessanitti ni gammaddu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">kanaafuu isin biyya keessan keessatti hiree dachaa ni dhaaltu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">gammachuun bara baraas kan keessan.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />“Ani Rabbii Allaahan murtii qajeelaa nan jaalladhaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">saamichaa fi yakka nan jibba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Ani amanamummaa kootiin isaan nan badhaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">kakuu bara baraas isaan wajjin nan gala.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Sanyiin isaanii saboota gidduutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">ijoolleen isaanii immoo uummata gidduutti ni beekamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Warri isaan argan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">akka isaan saba Rabbii Allaahan eebbise taʼan ni beeku.”<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Ani Rabbii Allaahatti guddaa nan gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">lubbuun koos akka malee Allaah kootti gammaddi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Inni akkuma misirrichi akka lubaatti mataa isaa miidhagfatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">misirrittiin immoo faayaan of bareechitu sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">wayyaa fayyinaa natti uffiseera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">uffata qajeelummaa narra buuseeraatii.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Akkuma lafti biqiltuu biqilchitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">iddoon biqiltuu immoo akka sanyiin guddattu godhu sana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akka qajeelummaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">galanni fuula saboota hundaa duratti biqilan ni godha.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Maqaa Xiyoon Haaraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Hamma qajeelummaan ishee akka barii barraaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">fayyinni ishee akka guca bobaʼuu ifutti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">ani waaʼee Xiyoon hin calʼisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">waaʼee Yerusaalemis afaan hin qabadhu.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Saboonni qajeelummaa kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">mootonni hundinuus ulfina kee ni argu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">ati maqaa haaraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">kan afaan Rabbii Allaah siif baasuun ni waamamta.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Ati harka Rabbii Allaah keessatti gonfoo ulfinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">harka Allaah keetii keessattis marata mootii ni taata.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Ati siʼachi, Gatamtuu hin jedhamtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">yookaan biyyi kee Ontuu hin jedhamtu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Ati garuu, “Ani isheetti nan gammada” jedhamta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">biyyi kees “kan heerumte” jedhamti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Rabbii Allaahan sitti gammadaatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">biyyi kee ni heerumti.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Akkuma dargaggeessi durba fuudhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ilmaan kee si fuudhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">akkuma misirrichi misirrittiitti gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">Allaahan kees sitti gammada.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Yaa Yerusaalem, ani dallaawwan kee irratti <optbreak /> eegdota ramadeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">isaan gonkumaa halkanii fi guyyaa hin calʼisan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Isin warri Rabbii Allaah waammattan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">ofii keessaniif boqonnaa hin kenninaa;<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />hamma inni Yerusaalemin cimsee ijaaree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">akka isheen lafa irratti leellifamtuu taatu godhutti <optbreak /> boqonnaa isaaf hin kenninaa.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">harka isaa mirgaatii fi irree isaa jabaa sanaan kakateera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">“Ani lammata midhaan kee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">nyaata godhee diinota keetiif hin kennu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">namoonni ormaas lammata daadhii wayinii haaraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">kan ati itti dadhabde hin dhugan;<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />garuu warri galfatan midhaan sana ni nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">Rabbii Allaahas ni galateeffatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">warri ija wayinii guurratanis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">oobdii iddoo qulqulluu koo keessatti ni dhugu.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Keessa darbaa; karrawwan keessaan darbaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">Uummataaf karaa qopheessaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Tolchaa; karaa guddaa tolchaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">Dhagaawwan bubuqqisaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Sabootaafis faajjii ol qabaa.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">hamma moggaa lafaatti labseera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">“Intala Xiyooniin akkana jedhaa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">‘Kunoo Fayyisaan kee ni dhufa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Badhaasni isaa kunoo isa harka jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">beenyaan inni namaaf baasus isuma wajjin jira.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Isaanis Saba Qulqulluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Furamtoota Rabbii Allaah jedhamanii ni waamamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">atis barbaadamtuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Magaalaa Siʼachi Hin Onne ni jedhamta.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Guyyaa Rabbii Allaah Haaloo Baʼu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Kan uffata isaa halluu diimaa cuuphee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">Edoom keessaa, Bozraadhaa dhufaa jiru kun eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Kan ulfina uffatee guddina jabina isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">fuula duratti deemaa jiru kun eenyu?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">“Inni anuma, kan qajeelummaan dubbatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">kan oolchuufis humna qabu anaa dha.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Uffanni kee maaliif akkuma uffata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">nama boolla wayinii itti cuunfan keessatti <optbreak /> wayinii dhidhiitu tokkoo diimata?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />“Ani kophaa koo boolla itti wayinii cuunfan keessatti <optbreak /> wayinii nan dhidhiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">saboota keessaa namni tokko iyyuu na wajjin hin turre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Ani aarii kootiin isaan irra dhaabadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">dheekkamsa kootiin gad isaan dhidhiite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">dhiigni isaanii wayyaa kootti faffacaʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">wayyaa koo hundas ni faale.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Guyyaan haaloo baʼuu garaa koo keessa jiraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">waggaan ani itti nama furus dhufeera.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Anis milʼadhee nama na gargaaru tokko iyyuu nan dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">gargaarsa tokko iyyuu dhabnaan nan dinqisiifadhe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">kanaafuu irreen koo fayyina naa fide;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">dheekkamsi koos na utube.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Ani aarii kootiin saboota irra nan dhidhiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">dheekkamsa kootiinis isaan nan macheesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">dhiiga isaanii lafa irra nan lolaase.”<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galateeffannaa fi Duʼaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Akkuma waan inni nuuf hojjete hundaatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">ani waaʼee jaalala Rabbii Allaah <optbreak /> kan hin geeddaramne sanaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">hojii inni ittiin galateeffamuu qabu nan odeessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">wantoota gaggaarii inni akkuma gara laafinaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">arjummaa isaa hedduu sanaatti mana Israaʼeliif hojjete baayʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">ani dhugumaan nan odeessa.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Innis, “Isaan dhugumaan saba koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">ijoollee hin sobnee dha” jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">kanaafuu inni Fayyisaa isaanii taʼe.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Dhiphina isaanii hunda keessatti, innis ni dhiphate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">malaʼikkaan Allaah kan fuula isaa dura dhaabatu isaan baraare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Jaalalaa fi araara isaatiin isaan fure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">bara durii hunda keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">inni ol fuudhee isaan baate.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Isaan garuu fincilanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">Hafuura isaa Qulqulluu gaddisiisan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">Kanaafuu inni deebiʼee diina isaanii taʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">inni mataan isaas isaan lole.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Kana irratti sabni isaa bara durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">bara Muusaatii fi saba isaa yaadatee akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Inni tiksee bushaayee isaa wajjin <optbreak /> galaana keessaa isaan baase sun eessa jira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Inni Hafuura isaa Qulqulluu gidduu isaanii buuse,<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />kan akka irreen isaa ulfina qabeessi jabaan sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">harka mirgaa kan Muusaa wajjin jiraatuuf erge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">kan maqaa bara baraa ofii isaatiif godhachuudhaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">fuula isaanii duratti bishaan gargar qoode,<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />kan tuujuba keessaan isaan qajeelche sun eessa jira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">Isaan akkuma farda biyya balʼaa keessa gulufu tokkoo hin gufanne;<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />akkuma loon dirreetti bobbaʼaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">Hafuurri Rabbii Allaah boqonnaa isaaniif kenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Akki ati itti maqaa ulfina qabu ofii keetiif godhachuudhaaf jettee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">saba kee qajeelchite kanaa dha.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Ati shamaayʼun irraa, teessoo kee qulqulluu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">ulfina qabeessa sana irraa gad ilaali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Hinaaffaan keetii fi jabinni kee eessa jiru?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">Jaalallii fi gara laafinni kee nurraa ittifamaniiru.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Yoo Ibraahim nu beekuu baatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">yookaan Israaʼel nu yaadachuu baate iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">ati dhugumaan abbaa keenya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Rabbii Allaah, ati abbaa keenya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Furaan keenya durumaa jalqabee maqaa kee ti.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Rabbii Allaah, ati maaliif akka nu karaa kee irraa badnuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">akka garaan keenya jabaatee nu si sodaachuu didnu nu goota?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Sababii garboota kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">gosoota handhuuraa kee taʼaniitiif jedhii deebiʼi.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Sabni kee yeroo yartuuf iddoo kee qulqulluu dhaalee ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">amma garuu diinonni keenya iddoo kee qulqulluu <optbreak /> gad dhidhiitaa jiru.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Nu durumaa jalqabnee kanuma kee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">ati garuu isaan hin bulchine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">isaanis maqaa keetiin hin waamamne.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Akka tulluuwwan fuula kee duratti raafamaniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">maaloo ati utuu shamaayʼuniiwwan tarsaaftee gad buutee!<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Akkuma ibiddi hanxaxii gubee, bishaan danfisu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">akka maqaan kee diinota kee biratti beekamuuf</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">gad buʼiitii akka saboonni fuula kee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">duratti hollatan godhi!<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Ati yeroo waan sodaachisaa nu hin yaadin hojjettetti gad buute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">tulluuwwanis fuula kee duratti hollatan.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Si malee Allaah warra isa abdataniif dhaabatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">bara duriitii jalqabee namni tokko iyyuu hin dhageenye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">yookaan gurri tokko iyyuu hin qalbeeffanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">iji tokko iyyuu hin argine.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Ati warra gammachuudhaan waan tolaa hojjetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">kanneen karaa kee yaadatan gargaaruuf ni dhufta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Garuu yommuu nu ittuma fufnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">cubbuu hojjennetti ati ni dheekkamte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">Yoos nu akkamitti fayyuu dandeenya ree?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Hundi keenya akka nama qulqullina hin qabnee taaneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">hojiin qajeelummaa keenyaa hundis akka huccuu xuraaʼummaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">hundi keenya akkuma baalaa coollagne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">cubbuun keenyas akkuma bubbee haxaaʼee nu fudhate.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Namni maqaa kee waammatu tokko iyyuu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">yookaan namni si qabachuuf carraaqu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">ati fuula kee nu dhokfattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">sababii cubbuu keenyaatiifis nu fixxeertaatii.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Taʼus yaa Rabbii Allaah, ati Abbaa keenya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">Nu suphee dha; ati immoo dhooftuu suphee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">hundi keenya hojii harka keetii ti.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Rabbii Allaah, ati akka malee hin dheekkamin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">cubbuu keenyas bara baraan hin yaadatin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Maaloo si duratti duʼaa godhanna, fuula kee nuuf deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nu hundinuu saba keetii.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Magaalaawwan kee qulqulloonni onaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Xiyoon iyyuu onteerti; Yerusaalemis duwwaa hafteerti.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Manni qulqullummaa keenya qulqullichii fi ulfina qabeessi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">iddoon abbootiin keenya itti si galateeffatan sun ibiddaan gubameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">wanni nu itti gammannu hundis barbadeeffameera.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Rabbii Allaah, ati wantoota kanneen hunda <optbreak /> calʼuma jettee ilaaltaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Ati calʼistee akka malee nu adabdaa?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Murtii fi Fayyina</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />“Ani warra na hin iyyaafatinitti nan mulʼadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">warri na hin barbaadinis na argatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Ani saba maqaa koo hin waammatiniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">‘Ani asan jira; ani asan jira’ nan jedhe.<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Ani guyyaa guutuu gara uummata didaa taʼeetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">kan karaa gaarii hin taʼin irra deemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">kan yaada ofii isaa duukaa buʼuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">harka koo nan diriirfadhe;<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Isaan saba iddoo biqiltuu keessatti aarsaa dhiʼeessuudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">iddoo aarsaa kan xuubii irrattis ixaana aarsuudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:3">utuu gargar hin kutin, utuma ani arguu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">dheekkamsaaf na kakaasanii dha;<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />isaan warra qabrii gidduu tataaʼanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">lafa dhoksaa bulanii dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">warra foon booyyee nyaatanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">okkoteen isaanii bishaan foon xuraaʼaa baatuu dha;<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />isaan warra, ‘Achi fagaadhu; natti hin dhiʼaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">ani si caalaa qulqulluudhaatii!’ jedhanii dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Sabni akkasii funyaan koo keessatti akkuma aaraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">akkuma ibidda guyyaa guutuu bobaʼuu ti.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />“Kunoo, wanni kun akkana jedhamee fuula koo duratti barreeffameera:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ani hin calʼisu; garuu gatii hojii isaanii guutuu nan kennaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">dhugumaanis qomatti isaan nan baachisa.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Kunis cubbuu keessanii fi cubbuu abbootii keessanii ti”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">“Isaan tulluuwwan irratti aarsaa dhiʼeessanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">gaarran irratti waan na arrabsaniif,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">ani hojii isaanii kan duriitiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">kaffaltii guutuu isaaniifin kenna.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">“Akkuma yeroo hurbuu wayinii keessa cuunfaan jirutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">namoonni, ‘Amma iyyuu eebbatu keessa jiraatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">hin balleessinaa’ jedhan sana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">anis tajaajiltoota kootiif akkasuma nan godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">isaan hundas hin balleessu.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Anis Yaaʼikuub keessaa sanyii tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">Yihuudaa keessaa immoo warra tulluuwwan koo dhaalan nan biqilcha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">sabni koo filatamaan tulluuwwan sana dhaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">tajaajiltoonni koos achi ni jiraatu.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Saba koo kan na barbaaduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Shaaroon lafa bushaayeen itti bobbaʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Sululli Aakoor immoo lafa loon boqotan ni taʼan.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />“Garuu isin warra Rabbii Allaah dhiiftanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">tulluu koo qulqulluu dagattan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">kanneen waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa ‘Milkii’ jedhamuuf <optbreak /> maaddii qopheessitanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">waaqeffatamaa, ‘Hiree’ jedhamuuf immoo dhibaayyuu kubbaayyaatti guuttan,<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />ani irbaata goraadee isinan godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">isin hundis qalamuuf gad jettu; ani isin waameen ture;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">isin garuu na jalaa hin owwaanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ani dubbadheen ture; isin garuu na hin dhaggeeffanne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Isin fuuluma koo duratti waan hamaa hojjettanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">waan na hin gammachiifne filattan.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">“Garboonni koo ni nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">isin garuu ni beeloftu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">garboonni koo ni dhugu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">isin garuu ni dheebottu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">garboonni koo ni gammadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">isin garuu ni qaanoftu.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Garboonni koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">gammachuu garaa irraa maddeen ni faarfatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">isin garuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">waan garaan keessan miidhameef ni boossu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">waan hafuurri keessan gaddeef ni wawwaattu.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Filatamtoonni koo maqaa isin dabarfattan sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">abaarsaaf itti fayyadamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Rabbii Allaahan Gooftaan isin fixa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">garboota isaatiif garuu maqaa biraa ni kenna.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Namni lafa irratti eebbifamu kam iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">Allaah dhugaatiin eebbifama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">namni lafa irratti kakatus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">Allaah dhugaatiin kakata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Rakkinni durii ni irraanfatama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">ija koo duraas ni dhokataatii.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shamaayʼuniiwwan Haaraa fi Lafa Haaraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />“Kunoo ani, shamaayʼuniiwwan haaraa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">lafa haaraa nan uuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">Wanni durii hin yaadatamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">yookaan qalbii namaatti hin dhufu.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Isin garuu waan ani uumutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">bara baraan gammadaa ililchaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">ani Yerusaalemin gammachuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">saba ishee immoo ililleef nan uumaatii.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Ani Yerusaalemitti nan gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">saba koottis nan gammada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">siʼachi sagaleen booʼichaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">iyyaa ishee keessatti hin dhagaʼamu.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />“Siʼachi, daaʼimni guyyaa muraasa qofa jiraatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">yookaan jaarsi umuriin isaa hanqatu tokko iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">ishee keessatti hin argamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">namni waggaa dhibbatti duʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">akka waan dargaggummaan duʼeetti yaadama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">namni waggaa dhibba hanqate tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">akka waan abaarameetti hedama.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Namoonni mana ni ijaarratu; achi keessas ni jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">wayinii dhaabbatu; ija isaas ni nyaatu.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Siʼachi isaan mana ijaaranii namoonni biraa keessa hin jiraatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">yookaan isaan biqiltuu dhaabanii namoonni biraa hin nyaatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Umuriin saba koo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">akkuma umurii mukaa ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">warri ani filadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">hojii harka isaaniitiin bara dheeraa ni gammadu.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Isaan akkasumaan hin dadhaban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">yookaan ijoollee balaan eeggattu hin dhalchan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">isaan sanyii isaanii wajjin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">saba Rabbii Allaahan eebbisu ni taʼu.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Ani utuu isaan na hin waammatin nan deebisaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">utuu isaan dubbatanii hin fixinis nan dhagaʼa.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Yeeyyii fi xobbaallaan hoolaa walii wajjin nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">leenci akka sangaa okaa nyaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">biyyoon garuu soora bofaa taʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Isaan tulluu koo qulqulluu hunda irratti homaa hin miidhan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">yookaan homaa hin balleessan”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Murtii fi Abdii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">“Shamaayʼuniin teessoo koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">laftis ejjeta miilla kootii ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Manni isin naaf ijaartan meerre?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">Lafti boqonnaa kootii eessa?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Waan kana hunda harki koo hin hojjennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">Kanaafuu wantoonni kunneen hundi kanuma koo ti”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 66:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">“Ani garuu nama gad of qabuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">kan garaa isaa keessatti gaabbee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">dubbii kootiin hollatuu nan ilaala.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Garuu namni korma qalu kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">akkuma nama nama ajjeesu tokkoo ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">namni xobbaallaa hoolaa qalu kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">akkuma nama morma saree cabsu tokkoo ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">namni aarsaa midhaanii dhiʼeessu kam iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">akkuma nama dhiiga booyyee dhiʼeessu tokkoo ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">namni ixaana yaadannoo aarsu kam iyyuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">akkuma nama waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa waaqeffatu tokkoo ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Isaan karaa ofii isaanii filataniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">lubbuun isaaniis xuraaʼummaa isaaniitti gammaddi.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Kanaafuu ani gidiraa isaaniif nan fila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">waan isaan akka malee sodaatanis isaanitti nan fida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Yeroo ani waametti namni tokko iyyuu na jalaa hin owwaanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">yeroo ani dubbadhetti namni tokko iyyuu <optbreak /> hin dhaggeeffanneetii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Isaan fuula koo duratti waan hamaa hojjetanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">waan na hin gammachiifne illee filatan.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Warri dubbii isaatiin hollattan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">dubbii Rabbii Allaah dhagaʼaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">“Obboleeyyan keessan warri sababii maqaa kootiif isin jibbanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">isin ariʼan sun akkana jedhan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">‘Akka nu gammachuu keessan argiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">mee Rabbii Allaahan haa ulfaatu!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">Taʼus isaan ni qaanaʼu.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Huursaa magaalaa keessaa sana dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">waca mana qulqullummaa keessaa dhagaʼaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Wanni kun sagalee Rabbii Allaah kan yeroo inni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">gatii diinota isaa hundaaf malu isaaniif kennuu ti.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />“Isheen utuu hin ciniinsifatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">ni deessi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">utuu miixuun daʼumsaa ishee hin qabatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">ilma deessi.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Eenyutu takkumaa waan akkasii dhagaʼe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Waan takkumaa akkasii eenyutu arge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Biyyi tokko guyyuma tokkotti dhalachuu dandeessii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Yookaan sabni yeruma tokkotti biqiluu dandaʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Xiyoon garuu akkuma ciniinsifatteen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">ijoollee ishee deesse.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ani yeroo daʼumsaatiin nama gaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">daʼuu nan dhowwaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">jedha Rabbii Allaahan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">“Ani daʼumsaan gaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">gadameessa nan cufaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">jedha Allaahan kee.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />“Isin warri ishee jaallattan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">Yerusaalem wajjin gammadaa; isheefis ililchaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">isin warri isheef boossan hundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">guddisaatii ishee wajjin gammadaa.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Isin harma ishee kan nama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">jajjabeessu sana hootanii ni quuftuutii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">ulfina ishee guddaa sana irraas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">gammachuudhaan ni dhugdu.”<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedhaatii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">“Kunoo ani nagaa akkuma bishaan lagaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">badhaadhummaa sabootaas akkuma laga yaaʼuu <optbreak /> isheef nan dhangalaasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">isin ni hootu; harka ishee irratti ni baatamtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">gudeeda ishee irra illee ni taphattu.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Akkuma haati daaʼima ishee urursitu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">anis isinan urursa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">isinis Yerusaalem keessatti ni ururfamtu.”<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Isin yommuu waan kana argitanitti garaan keessan ni gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">lafeen keessan akka margaa ni haaromfama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">harki Rabbii Allaah akka garboota isaa wajjin jirus ni beekama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">dheekkamsi isaa garuu amajaajota isaa irratti ni mulʼifama.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Kunoo, Rabbii Allaahan ibiddaan ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">gaariiwwan isaas akkuma bubbee hamaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">inni aarii isaa dhaʼichaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">ifannaa isaa immoo arraba ibiddaatiin gad buusa.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Rabbii Allaahan ibiddaa fi goraadee isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">namoota hunda irratti murtii raawwataatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">namoonni Rabbii Allaahan ajjeefaman ni baayʼatu.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />“Warri iddoo biqiltuu seenuuf jedhanii, isa warra foon booyyee, foon hantuutaatii fi wantoota jibbisiisoo biraa nyaatan gidduutti argamu duukaa buʼuudhaan addaan of baasanii of qulqulleessan wajjin barbadeeffamu” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />“Ani waanan hojii fi yaada isaanii beekuuf, sabootaa fi afaanota hunda walitti qabuuf jedhee nan dhufa; isaanis dhufanii ulfina koo ni argu.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />“Ani gidduu isaanii mallattoo nan kaaʼa; hambaawwan keessaa namoota tokko tokko gara sabootaa jechuunis gara Tarshiish, Phuulii fi gara Luud warra xiyyaan lolan, gara Tuubaalii fi Yaawaan akkasumas gara biyyoota bishaan gidduu fagoo jiran kanneen waaʼee koo hin dhagaʼinii yookaan ulfina koo hin arginiitti nan erga. Isaanis saboota gidduutti ulfina koo ni labsu. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Isaanis saboota hunda keessaa obboloota keessan hunda akkuma aarsaa Rabbii Allaahaf dhiʼeeffamu tokkootti fardeeniin, gaariiwwaniin, harrootaan, gaangolii fi gaalawwaniin gara tulluu koo qulqulluutti, gara Yerusaalem ni fidu” jedha Rabbii Allaahan. “Isaanis akkuma Israaʼeloonni miʼa akka seeraatti qulqulluu taʼeen aarsaa midhaan isaanii gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti fidan sanatti jara fidu. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Anis isaan keessaa namoota tokko tokko akka isaan lubootaa fi Lewwota taʼaniif nan filadha” jedha Rabbii Allaahan.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />“Akkuma shamaayʼuniin haaraanii fi lafti haaraan ani uumu itti fufanii fuula koo dura jiraatan sana maqaa fi sanyiin keessan itti fufanii jiraatu” jedha Rabbii Allaahan. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />“Ayyaana Baatii tokkoo hamma Ayyaana Baatii kaaniitti, Sanbata tokkoo hamma Sanbata kaaniittis sanyiin namaa hundi dhufee fuula koo duratti ni sagada” jedha Rabbii Allaahan. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />“Isaanis gad baʼanii reeffa warra natti fincilanii ni ilaalu; raammoon isaanii hin duʼu; ibiddi isaaniis hin dhaamu; isaanis sanyii namaa hundaaf jibbisiisoo taʼu.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>